<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="DEU" style="id"/>
  <para style="h">Sariyane Sora</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nabi Musa Alaa Falan Naxan Sɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Sariyane</para>
  <para style="mt1">Sariyane</para>
  <para style="mt2">Nabi Musa Alaa Falan Naxan Sɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="ip">Tawureta Musa yire suulunden ni i ra. Isirayila kaane bata yi findi konyine ra Misiran yamanani. Na konyiyaan bata yi bu han Ala Nabi Musa xɛ waxatin naxan yi. Ala yi a mali a xa Isirayila kaane raxɔrɔya. E yi mini Misiran yamanani Ala sɛnbɛn barakani. Na xanbi ra, Ala yi e xun ti Kanan yamanan na, a dɛnaxan fixi e ma. E yi kira yi, Ala yi mini e xa Sinayi geyaan fari. A yi a sariyan fi Nabi Musa ma alogo yamaan xa lu e Marigin sagoon ligɛ. Koni yamaan yi Ala matandi sanɲa yi wuyaxi tonbonni. Na taruxun birin sɛbɛxi Tawureta Musa yiren bonne kui.</para>
  <para style="ip">Benun e xa Kanan bɔxɔn sɔtɔ, Nabi Musa yi Isirayila kaane malan. A yi taruxuni ito birin nabira e ma. A mɔn yi xɛtɛ Alaa sariyan birin ma alogo e nama ɲinan a xɔn Kanan bɔxɔni. Na kawandin nan sɛbɛxi Kitabun yireni ito kui.</para>
  <para style="ip">Isirayila kaane somatɔna Kanan bɔxɔni, Musa yi kawandi saxan ba Isirayila kaane xa. A singen sɛbɛxi keli Sariyane sora 1 ma han a sora 4.43. A firinden sɛbɛxi keli Sariyane 4.44 ma han a sora 28.68. A saxanden sɛbɛxi keli Sariyane 28.69 ma han a sora 30.20.</para>
  <para style="ip">Musa Ala kɛwanle nan ma fe rabirama en ma, a naxanye rakamalixi a xanuntenya gbeeni a yamaan xa: a bata yi layirin xidi e tagi, a yi ti e yɛɛ ra ɲɛɛ tonge naanin bun ma tonbonni, a yi e ratanga e yaxune ma, a yi a sariyane nun yamarine fala e xa e nun a dɛ xuine. Koni Kitabun yireni ito mi findixi kawandin xan gbansan na, hanma sariyan naxanye bata yi kolon nun Kitabun yire singene xɔn. Musa falan tima nɛn be alo kawandi ba kɛndɛna, naxan a ramɛ muxune xilima sɛnbɛn na alogo e xa e xaxili lu Alaa tinxinyaan xɔn ma. Nayi, e yi kisi feen lanna raso e nun a tan Ala keden peen tagi. Musa yi a fala, a naxa, “Isirayila kaane, ɛ tuli mati. Alatala en ma Ala keden peen na a ra. I xa Alatala i ya Ala xanu i bɔɲɛn birin na e nun i niin birin na e nun i sɛnbɛn birin na.” (Sariyane 6.4-5) Falani ito findixi Isirayila kaane tubi xuiin nan na e naxan falama lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ e dɛnkɛlɛyana fe ra.</para>
  <para style="ip">A sora naanin dɔnxɛne, ne findixi fala ɲaxumɛ firin nun taruxu firin nan na: a singen feene nan falama naxanye a yitama Yosuwe sugandi kii naxan yi Musa ɲɔxɔni alogo a xa ti Isirayila yamaan yɛɛ ra, siga na yamanani Ala yi naxan fima e ma (Sariyane 31). A mɔn bɛtin yitama naxan xili “Musaa bɛtina” (Sariyane 32). A mɔn Musaa dubana fe yɛbama Isirayila kaane xa (Sariyane 33), a yi Musa faxa feen fala (Sariyane 34).</para>
  <para style="ip">E sariya kɛdin naxan to Yerusalɛn taani Ala Batu Banxini Manga Yosiya waxatini, na nɔɛ findɛ Kitabun yireni ito nan na (A mato Mangane Firinden sora 22 kui). Kitabun yireni ito a feene mɔn falama kitabu gbɛtɛ yire wuyaxi kui alo Mangane nun Nabi Yeremi a Kitabun yirena han sa dɔxɔ Yesu waxatin na. Misaala ra, Matiyu 4.4 hanma Matiyu 10 e nun Maraka 12.32.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="DEU 1"/>
  <para style="s">Nabi Musaa kawandi baana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 1:1"/>Falane ni itoe ra, Nabi Musa naxanye fala Isirayila kaane birin xa. Na waxatini, a yi Yurudɛn sogetede mabinna nin, Araba tonbonni Sufi yɛtagi, Paran, Tofeli, Laban, Xaserɔti, nun Disahabi longonne ra. <verse eid="DEU 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 1:2"/>Keli Horebe geyaan ma siga Kadesi-Barineya, xii fu nun keden sigatiin na a ra kiraan xɔn ma naxan danguma Seyiri geyane binni. <verse eid="DEU 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 1:3"/>E minin ɲɛɛ tonge naaninden kike fu nun kedenden xii singe lɔxɔni Misiran bɔxɔni, Nabi Musa yi Alatalaa yamarine birin nali Isirayila kaane ma. <verse eid="DEU 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 1:4"/>Na waxatini, Musa bata yi Amorine manga Sixɔn nɔ yɛngɛni naxan yi dɔxi Xɛsibɔn yi, e nun Manga Ogo, Basan mangana, naxan yi dɔxi Asatarɔti nun Edere yi. <verse eid="DEU 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 1:5"/>Yurudɛn sogeteden mabinni, Moyaba bɔxɔni, Nabi Musa yi Alaa sariyan yɛba e xa, a naxa:<verse eid="DEU 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 1:6"/>Alatala en ma Ala ito nan falaxi en xa, Horebe geyaan ma, a naxa, “Ɛ bata bu geyani ito ma. <verse eid="DEU 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 1:7"/>Ɛ keli, ɛ siga geyane ma Amorine dɛnaxan yi, mɛnna longonna birin, Araba bɔxɔni, geyane fari, Sefela nun Negewi binni, fɔxɔ ige dɛɛn na, han Kanan bɔxɔni, han Liban yi, sa dɔxɔ Efirati baa gbeen na. <verse eid="DEU 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 1:8"/>Ɛ xa na bɔxɔn mato, n naxan fixi ɛ ma. Ɛ siga, ɛ xa na tongo, bayo n tan Alatala yati nan n kɔlɔ ɛ benbane xa, Iburahima nun Isiyaga nun Yaxuba, e nun e bɔnsɔnna birin hali e dangu xanbini, a n na bɔxɔn nan soma e yii.”<verse eid="DEU 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nabi Musa yi kitisane dɔxɔ</para>
  <para style="r">Xɔrɔyaan 18.13-27</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 1:9"/>Na waxatini, n ni ito nan fala ɛ xa, n naxa, “N tan kedenna mi nɔɛ ɛ goronna tongɛ. <verse eid="DEU 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 1:10"/>Alatala ɛ Ala bata ɛ rawuya ayi. Iki ɛ bata wuya ayi alo sarene kore. <verse eid="DEU 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 1:11"/>Alatala ɛ benbane Ala xa ɛ rawuya ayi han wuli wuli. A xa ɛ baraka alo a a falaxi kii naxan yi. <verse eid="DEU 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 1:12"/>Koni, n tan kedenna nɔɛ ɛ birin goronna tongɛ di, n yi ɛ kitine birin sa? <verse eid="DEU 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 1:13"/>Ɛ xa xɛmɛne sugandi ɛ bɔnsɔnne yi, naxanye xaxili fan, e feene yɛɛ toma, e binyaxi. N ne nan tima yamaan xun na.” <verse eid="DEU 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 1:14"/>Ɛ yi n yabi, a n ma falan lanxi. <verse eid="DEU 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 1:15"/>Nayi, n yi ɛ yɛɛratine tongo, xɛmɛ xaxilimaan naxanye binyaxi ɛ bɔnsɔnne yɛ. N yi e dɔxɔ muxu wuli xun na hanma muxu kɛmɛ hanma muxu tonge suulun hanma muxu fu. E findi kuntigine ra ɛ bɔnsɔnne tagi. <verse eid="DEU 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 1:16"/>Na waxatini, n yi yamarini ito so ɛ kitisane yii. N naxa, “Ɛ xa ɛ tuli mati ɛ bari bodene ra. Ɛ yi e birin makiti tinxinni, ɛ ngaxakedenne tagi e nun e tan nun xɔɲɛne tagi. <verse eid="DEU 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 1:17"/>Ɛ nama muxu yo rafisa bonne xa kiti sadeni. Ɛ ɛ tuli mati sɛnbɛ kanna nun sɛnbɛtaren fan na. Ɛ nama gaxu muxu yo yɛɛ ra, bayo Ala nan kitisaan na. Xa kitin xɔdɔxɔ ɛ yii, ɛ xa a fala n xa, n tan yi kitin sa.” <verse eid="DEU 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 1:18"/>Na kiini n bata yamarine birin yɛba ɛ xa, a lan ɛ xa naxan liga.<verse eid="DEU 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Murutɛn Kadesi yi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="NUM 13:1-33">Yatɛne 13.1-33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 1:19"/>Na to dangu, en bata keli Horebe geyaan ma, en yi dangu tonbon magaxuxin na ɛ dɛnaxan toxi. En yi ti kiraan xɔn siga Amori geyane ma, alo Alatala en ma Ala a yamari en ma kii naxan yi. En yi so Kadesi-Barineya yi. <verse eid="DEU 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 1:20"/>N yi a fala ɛ xa, n naxa, “Ɛ bata Amori geyane li, Alatala en ma Ala dɛnaxan fixi en ma. <verse eid="DEU 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 1:21"/>A mato, Alatala ɛ Ala bata bɔxɔni ito dɔxɔ en yɛɛ ra. Ɛ siga, ɛ xa na tongo alo Alatala ɛ benbane Ala a falaxi ɛ xa kii naxan yi. Ɛ nama gaxu, ɛ nama kuisan.”<verse eid="DEU 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 1:22"/>Na waxatini, ɛ birin yi fa n fɛma, ɛ yi a fala n xa, ɛ naxa, “En xa xɛrane rasiga, e xa sa bɔxɔni ito feene rakɔrɔsi. E fa dɛntɛgɛn sa en xa, en lan en xa sigan ti kiraan naxan xɔn e nun en sigama taan naxanye yi.” <verse eid="DEU 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 1:23"/>Ɛ miriyaan yi rafan n ma. Nanara, n yi xɛmɛ fu nun firin yɛba ɛ bɔnsɔn keden kedenne tagi. <verse eid="DEU 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 1:24"/>E yi siga geyane yi han e sa Esikoli lanbanna li. E yi na yirene rakɔrɔsi. <verse eid="DEU 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 1:25"/>E yi na bɔxɔn bogi seene ba, e yi fa e yita en na. E yi dɛntɛgɛn sa en xa, e naxa, “Alatala en ma Ala bɔxɔ faɲin nan fixi en ma.” <verse eid="DEU 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 1:26"/>Koni ɛ mi tinxi sigɛ, ɛ murutɛ nɛn Alatala ɛ Alaa yamarin bun ma. <verse eid="DEU 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 1:27"/>Ɛ yi lu tondi falane tiyɛ ɛ bubune kui. Ɛ naxa, “Alatala en naɲaxuxi, nanara a en naminixi Misiran yi alogo a xa en so Amorine yii e yi en halagi. <verse eid="DEU 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 1:28"/>En sigan minɛn? En ngaxakedenne bata en tunnaxɔlɔ, e naxa, ‘Mɛn kaane fangan gbo en xa! E mɔn kuya en xa. Na taane gbo. Yinna naxanye e rabilinni, ne texi han kore. Nxu bata Anakine yati to na yi.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 1:29"/>N yi a fala ɛ xa, n naxa, “Ɛ nama kuisan. Ɛ nama gaxu e yɛɛ ra de! <verse eid="DEU 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 1:30"/>Alatala ɛ Ala naxan tima ɛ yɛɛ ra, a tan nan yɛngɛn soma ɛ xa alo a a liga ɛ yɛɛ xɔri kii naxan yi Misiran yi han tonbonni. <verse eid="DEU 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 1:31"/>Ɛ bata a to nayi, Alatala ɛ Ala faxi ɛ ra nɛn alo muxuna a diin xalima kii naxan yi ɛ sigatiin birin yi han ɛ yi fa be li.” <verse eid="DEU 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 1:32"/>Koni na birin yi, ɛ mi yi laxi Alatala ɛ Ala ra. <verse eid="DEU 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 1:33"/>A tan nan yi tima ɛ yɛɛ ra kiraan xɔn, a daaxadene fen ɛ xa ɛ luma dɛnaxanye yi. Kɔɛɛn na, a kirani yalan tɛɛn na. Yanyin fan na, kundaan yi ti ɛ yɛɛ ra.<verse eid="DEU 1:33"/></para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="NUM 14:20-45">Yatɛne 14.20-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 1:34"/>Alatala to ɛ falan mɛ, a xɔlɔ, a yi a kɔlɔ, <verse eid="DEU 1:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 1:35"/>“Muxu kobini ito yo mi soɛ bɔxɔ faɲini ito yi, n naxan layirin tongo ɛ benbane xa <verse eid="DEU 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 1:36"/>fɔ Yefune a dii Kalebi, na nan a toma. N na bɔxɔn soma a yii nɛn a naxan yisigaxi e nun a bɔnsɔnna, bayo a lu nɛn Alatalaa kiraan xɔn ken!”<verse eid="DEU 1:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 1:37"/>Alatala bata xɔlɔ n fan ma ɛ tan ma fe ra. A yi a fala, a naxa, “I tan yɛtɛɛn mi soma bɔxɔni ito yi. <verse eid="DEU 1:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 1:38"/>Nunu a dii Yosuwe, i mali muxun nan fama sodeni. I xa a sɛnbɛ so, bayo a tan nan tima Isirayila yɛɛ ra, e bɔxɔni ito sɔtɔ e kɛɛn na. <verse eid="DEU 1:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 1:39"/>Ɛ diine, ɛ a falaxi naxanye ma a e findima nɛn muxu suxine ra, e tan naxanye munma fe kobi nun fe faɲin tagi rabaan kolon, e tan nan soma na bɔxɔni. N na fima e tan nan ma. E tan nan a sɔtɔma e kɛɛn na. <verse eid="DEU 1:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 1:40"/>Koni ɛ tan, ɛ mɔn xa xɛtɛ, ɛ siga tonbonni, siga Gbala Baan kiraan xɔn.”<verse eid="DEU 1:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 1:41"/>Ɛ yi a yabi, ɛ naxa, “Nxu bata findi yulubi kanne ra Alatala yɛɛ ra yi, koni iki nxu xa siga yɛngɛ sodeni, alo Alatala en ma Ala a yamarixi nxu ma kii naxan yi.” Ɛ birin yi ɛ yɛngɛso seene tongo, bayo ɛ a mirixi nɛn a geya bɔxɔni ito masɔtɔn mi xɔdɔxɔ. <verse eid="DEU 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 1:42"/>Koni Alatala yi a fala n xa, a naxa, “A fala e xa, i naxa, ‘Ɛ nama siga yɛngɛ sodeni de! N mi luma ɛ xɔn. Ɛ yaxune ɛ nɔma nɛn.’ ” <verse eid="DEU 1:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 1:43"/>N yi ɛ maxadi na kiini, koni ɛ mi ɛ tuli mati n na. Ɛ yi murutɛ Alatalaa yamarin ma, ɛ yi siga geya yireni wasoni. <verse eid="DEU 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 1:44"/>Amorin naxanye yi dɔxi geyane yi, ne yi mini ɛ yɛngɛdeni alo kumi ɲɛɲɛne dinma muxun na kii naxan yi. E yi ɛ kedi, e yi ɛ bɔnbɔ keli Seyiri han Xoroma. <verse eid="DEU 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 1:45"/>Ɛ to xɛtɛ, ɛ yi wuga Alatala yɛtagi han! Koni Alatala mi ɛ xuiin namɛ, a mi a tuli mati ɛ xuiin na. <verse eid="DEU 1:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 1:46"/>Ɛ mɔn yi lu Kadesi yi alo ɛ bu na kii naxan yi a singeni.<verse eid="DEU 1:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="DEU 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 2:1"/>Na xanbi ra, nxu yi xɛtɛ tonbonni nxu kiraan suxu naxan danguma Gbala Baani, alo Alatala a fala n xa kii naxan yi. Nxu yi Seyiri geyane mabilin xii wuyaxi bun.<verse eid="DEU 2:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isirayila kaane siga tiina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 2:2"/>Alatala yi a fala n xa, a naxa, <verse eid="DEU 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 2:3"/>“Ɛ bata bu geyani ito rabilinni. Ɛ firifiri kɔmɛnna ma.” <verse eid="DEU 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 2:4"/>A yi a fala n xa a n xa yamarini ito fi ɛ ma. Ɛ danguma nɛn Seyiri bɔxɔni, ɛ ngaxakedenne dɛnaxan yi, Esayu bɔnsɔnna. E gaxuma nɛn ɛ yɛɛ ra, koni ɛ xa a liga ɛ yeren ma, <verse eid="DEU 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 2:5"/>ɛ nama yɛngɛn gidi e ma, bayo n mi sese soma ɛ yii fata e bɔxɔn na, hali san tidena. N bata Seyiri geyane fi Esayu ma. <verse eid="DEU 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 2:6"/>Ɛ na donseen nun igen naxan tongo fɔ ɛ xa a saren fi nɛn gbetin na. <verse eid="DEU 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 2:7"/>Alatala ɛ Ala bata barakan sa ɛ kɛwanli. A yi a ɲɔxɔ lu ɛ sigatiin xɔn ma ɛ yi tonbonni ito yi waxatin naxan yi. Ɲɛɛ tonge naaninni ito bun ma, Alatala ɛ Ala nan yi ɛ xɔn. Sese mi dasaxi ɛ ma.<verse eid="DEU 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 2:8"/>Nanara, en yi dangu en ngaxakedenne bɔxɔn dɛxɔn Esayu bɔnsɔnna naxanye dɔxi Seyiri bɔxɔni. En mɔn yi Araba kiraan suxu, naxan kelima Elati nun Esiyon-Gebere yi. Na xanbi ra, en yi en maxɛtɛ, en yi dangu Moyaba tonbon kiraan xɔn.<verse eid="DEU 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 2:9"/>Alatala yi a fala n xa, a naxa, “Ɛ nama yɛngɛn gidi Moyaba kaane ma de! Ɛ nama e fen yɛngɛn na de, bayo n mi e bɔxɔ yo soma ɛ yii e konni. N bata Ari bɔxɔn fi Loti bɔnsɔnna ma. <verse eid="DEU 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 2:10"/>Emi kaane nan yi Ari bɔxɔni nun. Siya sɛnbɛmaan nan yi ne ra. E yi wuya, e kuya alo Anaki bɔnsɔnna muxune. <verse eid="DEU 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 2:11"/>Muxuna nde yi e yatɛma Refa kaane nan na, alo Anaki bɔnsɔnna muxune, koni Moyaba kaane yi a falama e ma nɛn a ‘Emi kaane.’ <verse eid="DEU 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 2:12"/>Xori kaane nan yi dɔxi Seyiri bɔxɔni a singeni. Koni Esayu bɔnsɔnna muxune yi e kedi, e yi e raxɔri. E tan yi dɔxɔ na yi, alo Isirayila kaane fan naxan liga na bɔxɔni Alatala dɛnaxan fi e ma. <verse eid="DEU 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 2:13"/>Iki, ɛ keli, ɛ yi Serede xuden gidi.” Nayi, en yi na gidi. <verse eid="DEU 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 2:14"/>Ɲɛɛ tonge saxan nun solomasɛxɛ nan dangu xabu en keli Kadesi-Barineya yi, han en Serede xuden gidi waxatin naxan yi. Na lixi, yɛngɛsoon naxanye birin yi na na waxati danguxini nun, ne birin bata yi faxa alo Alatala a kɔlɔ e xa kii naxan yi. <verse eid="DEU 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 2:15"/>Alatala yi keli e xili ma han e birin yi ɲan daaxadeni.<verse eid="DEU 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 2:16"/>Na yɛngɛsone to ɲan yamaan yɛ, e faxa, <verse eid="DEU 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 2:17"/>Alatala yi a fala n xa, a naxa, <verse eid="DEU 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 2:18"/>“To, ɛ danguma nɛn Moyaba danna ra, siga Ari bɔxɔni. <verse eid="DEU 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 2:19"/>Ɛ Amonine lima nɛn na. Ɛ nama yɛngɛn gidi e ma de! Ɛ nama e fen yɛngɛn na, bayo n mi e bɔxɔ yo soma ɛ yii. N na fixi Loti bɔnsɔnna nan ma.”<verse eid="DEU 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 2:20"/>Na bɔxɔn fan yi yatɛxi Refa kaane gbeen nan na, bayo Refa kaane yi dɔxi na nun. Amonine yi a falama e ma nɛn a “Samisumi kaane.” <verse eid="DEU 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 2:21"/>Siya sɛnbɛmaan nan yi e ra, e yi wuya, e kuya alo Anaki bɔnsɔnna muxune. Koni Alatala yi e halagi Amoni kaane xɔn. Amoni kaane yi e kedi, e yi dɔxɔ e bɔxɔni. <verse eid="DEU 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 2:22"/>Ala bata yi na fe sifan liga Esayu a diine xa naxanye yi dɔxi Seyiri bɔxɔni, a to yi Xori kaane halagima e xɔn. E e kedi nɛn e yi dɔxɔ e funfuni. E dɔxi mɛnni han iki. <verse eid="DEU 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 2:23"/>Awi kaane tan, naxanye yi dɔxi taane kui han Gasa, Kafatoro kaane nan ne halagi e to fa keli Kafatoro yi. E yi dɔxɔ e funfuni.<verse eid="DEU 2:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 2:24"/>Ala yi a fala en xa, a naxa, “Ɛ ti kiraan xɔn, ɛ xa Arinon xuden gidi. A mato, n bata Xɛsibɔn manga Sixɔn, Amorin so ɛ yii, e nun a bɔxɔna. Iki, ɛ xa na tongo. Ɛ xa na yɛngɛn nakeli. <verse eid="DEU 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 2:25"/>To, n na ɛ yɛɛragaxun luma nɛn dunuɲa siyane birin yi. E na ɛ xinla mɛ, e xuruxurunma nɛn gaxuni gbirigbiri!”<verse eid="DEU 2:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">E yi Manga Sixɔn nɔ</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="NUM 21:21-30">Yatɛne 21.21-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 2:26"/>N yi xɛrane rasiga bɔɲɛ xunbeli falane tideni Xɛsibɔn manga Sixɔn xa, keli Kedemoti tonbonni. N naxa, <verse eid="DEU 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 2:27"/>“Nxu wama i ya bɔxɔni gidi feni. Nxu sigama kira gbeen nan tun xɔn. Nxu mi sigɛ kɔmɛnna ma, nxu mi sigɛ yiifanna ma. <verse eid="DEU 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 2:28"/>Nxu na donseen nun igen naxan tongo, nxu a birin saren fima nɛn gbetin na. A lu nxu xa dangu nxu sanni i ya bɔxɔni. <verse eid="DEU 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 2:29"/>Esayu bɔnsɔnna naxanye dɔxi Seyiri bɔxɔni e nun Moyaba kaan naxanye dɔxi Ari bɔxɔni, ne bata yi nxu sago sa a nxu xa dangu e bɔxɔne yi. I fan xa n sago sa alogo nxu xa Yurudɛn baan gidi, nxu yi so bɔxɔni Alatala nxɔ Ala dɛnaxan fixi nxu ma.” <verse eid="DEU 2:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 2:30"/>Koni Xɛsibɔn manga Sixɔn yi tondi nxu dangu feen ma a bɔxɔni, bayo Alatala ɛ Ala bata yi a xaxinla xɔdɔxɔ ayi. A yi a bɔɲɛn balan alogo a xa a so ɛ yii alo a kii naxan yi to.<verse eid="DEU 2:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 2:31"/>Alatala yi a fala n xa, a naxa, “A mato, n bata Sixɔn nun a bɔxɔn so ɛ yii. Ɛ xa sa na tongo ɛ gbeen na.” <verse eid="DEU 2:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 2:32"/>Sixɔn nun a yamaan birin yi fa en yɛngɛdeni Yahasi yi. <verse eid="DEU 2:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 2:33"/>Alatala en ma Ala yi Sixɔn so en yii, en yi a nɔ, e nun a diine nun a yamaan birin. <verse eid="DEU 2:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 2:34"/>En yi na taane birin suxu, en yi e birin kala. En mɔn yi xɛmɛne nun ɲaxanle nun diine birin faxa. En mi muxu yo lu a nii ra. <verse eid="DEU 2:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 2:35"/>En mi sese tongo fɔ xuruseene nun se kɛndɛn naxanye yi na taane kui. <verse eid="DEU 2:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 2:36"/>Keli Aroyeri Arinon xuden dɛ, e nun taan naxan na mɛrɛmɛrɛni, siga han Galadi, taa yo mi nɔ sɔtɔ en ma. Alatala en ma Ala e birin so nɛn en yii. <verse eid="DEU 2:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 2:37"/>Koni ɛ mi ɛ masoxi Amonine bɔxɔn na, hanma Yaboko xuden dɛ, hanma taan naxanye na geyane ma alo Alatala a yamari ɛ ma kii naxan yi.<verse eid="DEU 2:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="DEU 3"/>
  <para style="s">E yi Basan yamanan masɔtɔ</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="NUM 21:31-35">Yatɛne 21.31-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 3:1"/>En yi en maxɛtɛ, en yi te Basan kiraan xɔn. Basan manga Ogo yi mini en yɛngɛdeni Edere yi, e nun a ganla birin. <verse eid="DEU 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 3:2"/>Alatala yi a fala n xa, a naxa, “I nama gaxu a yɛɛ ra, bayo n na soma i yii nɛn e nun a ganla birin e nun a bɔxɔna. I bata naxan liga Sixɔn na, Amorine mangana, naxan yi dɔxi Xɛsibɔn, i na nan ligama a fan na.” <verse eid="DEU 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 3:3"/>Alatala en ma Ala yi Basan manga Ogo so en yii, e nun a ganla birin. En yi e birin faxa, muxu ɲɛɲɛ yo mi lu. <verse eid="DEU 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 3:4"/>Na waxatini, en yi a taane birin suxu. Na taa yo mi lu en mi dɛnaxan suxu. Taa tonge sennin nan yi e ra naxanye yi Arigobi rabilinni Basan manga Ogo a mangayaan bun. <verse eid="DEU 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 3:5"/>Na taane birin yi rabilinxi yin matexine nan na. E yi balanxi dɛ wure daxine nan na. Banxidɛ wuyaxi fan yi na naxanye mi yi rabilinxi yinne ra. <verse eid="DEU 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 3:6"/>En yi na taane birin kala fefe, alo en na a liga Xɛsibɔn manga Sixɔn ma bɔxɔn na kii naxan yi. En yi xɛmɛne nun ɲaxanle nun diine birin faxa taane birin yi. <verse eid="DEU 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 3:7"/>En yi seene birin kala fɔ xuruseene nun se kɛndɛne, en naxanye tongo.<verse eid="DEU 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 3:8"/>Na waxatini, en yi bɔxɔne birin tongo Yurudɛn sogeteden binni, e ba Amorine manga firinne yii, keli Arinon xudeni han Xerimon geyana. <verse eid="DEU 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 3:9"/>Sidɔn kaane a falama na geyaan ma nɛn a “Siriyon.” Amorine tan naxa a “Seniri.” <verse eid="DEU 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 3:10"/>En yi na taane birin tongo na fiili yireni e nun Galadi bɔxɔna e nun Basan bɔxɔn birin, sa dɔxɔ Salaka nun Edere ra. Na taane birin yi Ogo a mangayaan nan bun Basan bɔxɔni. <verse eid="DEU 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 3:11"/>Basan manga Ogo nan keden mi faxa Refa kaane yɛ. A wure saden mɔn Rabaha yi, Amonine manga taana. A kuyana, nɔngɔnna yɛ solomanaanin, a yigbona nɔngɔnna yɛ naanin.<verse eid="DEU 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Galadi nun Basan bɔxɔ yitaxunna</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="NUM 32:1-42">Yatɛne 32.1-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 3:12"/>Na waxatini, en yi na bɔxɔn tongo. Keli Aroyeri yi, sa dɔxɔ Arinon xude dɛɛn na e nun Galadi geyaan fɔxɔ kedenna e nun na taane, n yi na birin so Rubɛn nun Gadi bɔnsɔnna yii. <verse eid="DEU 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 3:13"/>N yi Galadi fɔxɔ boden nun Basan manga Ogo bɔxɔn so Manase bɔnsɔnna fɔxɔ kedenna yii. Arigobi rabilinna bɔxɔn nun Basan bɔxɔn yi yatɛxi Refa kaane bɔxɔn nan na. <verse eid="DEU 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 3:14"/>Manase a dii Yayiri yi Arigobi bɔxɔn findi a gbeen na han Gesuri kaane nun Maka kaane bɔxɔne danne. E yi Yayiri xili sa Basan bɔxɔn xun ma. Han iki e a falama Basan bɔxɔn ma nɛn a “Yayiri taana.” <verse eid="DEU 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 3:15"/>N yi Galadi so Makiri yii. <verse eid="DEU 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 3:16"/>N yi Galadi fɔxɔ kedenna so Rubɛn bɔnsɔnna nun Gadi bɔnsɔnna yii han Arinon xudena. Xude wunla nan na danna ra, sa dɔxɔ Yaboko xuden na, Amonine bɔxɔn danna. <verse eid="DEU 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 3:17"/>N mɔn yi Araba bɔxɔn fan so e yii naxan danna lanxi Yurudɛn baan ma keli Kinɛrɛti Darani, sa dɔxɔ Araba Fɔxɔ Ige Daraan na, Pisiga geyaan lanbanni, sogeteden binni.<verse eid="DEU 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 3:18"/>Na waxatini n yi yamarini ito fi ɛ ma. N naxa, “Alatala ɛ Ala bata bɔxɔni ito fi ɛ ma alogo a xa findi ɛ gbeen na. Koni ɛ xɛmɛ kɛndɛne birin xa e yitɔn e siga e ngaxakedenne Isirayila kaane yɛɛ ra yɛngɛ sodeni. <verse eid="DEU 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 3:19"/>Ɛ ɲaxanle nun ɛ diine nun ɛ xuruseene nan tun luma taane kui n naxan soxi ɛ yii. N na a kolon xuruse wuyaxi ɛ yii. <verse eid="DEU 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 3:20"/>Ɛ luma nɛn sofayani han Alatala ɛ Ala yi matabun fi ɛ ngaxakedenne fan ma. Alatala ɛ Ala bɔxɔn fima e ma nɛn Yurudɛn kidi ma. Na waxatini, ɛ birin nɔɛ xɛtɛ nɛn ɛ gbee bɔxɔni n naxan soxi ɛ yii.”<verse eid="DEU 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 3:21"/>Na waxatini, n yi yamarin so Yosuwe yii. N yi a fala a xa, n naxa, “I bata feene birin to i yɛɛn na Alatala ɛ Ala naxan ligaxi manga firinni itoe ra. Alatala na ligama nɛn yamanan birin na, i na dangu dɛnaxan yi. <verse eid="DEU 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 3:22"/>I nama gaxu e yɛɛ ra, bayo Alatala ɛ Ala nan e yɛngɛma ɛ xa.”<verse eid="DEU 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nabi Musa mi soma Kanan bɔxɔni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 3:23"/>Na waxatini, n yi Alatala maxandi, n naxa, <verse eid="DEU 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 3:24"/>“Marigina Alatala, i bata i ya fisamantenyaan nun i sɛnbɛn yita i ya walikɛɛn na. Ala gbɛtɛ yo mi kore xɔnna ma hanma bɔxɔn ma naxan nɔɛ i ya wanle nun i ya kabanakone ligɛ. <verse eid="DEU 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 3:25"/>Yandi, tin n xa Yurudɛn baan gidi alogo n xa na bɔxɔ faɲin to naxan a kidi ma, e nun a geya yire faɲina, e nun Liban bɔxɔna.” <verse eid="DEU 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 3:26"/>Koni Alatala bata yi xɔlɔ n ma ɛ tan ma fe ra. A mi n xuiin namɛxi. Alatala yi a fala n xa, a naxa, “A lu na ki, i nama fa feni ito fala n xa sɔnɔn. <verse eid="DEU 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 3:27"/>Te Pisiga geyaan xuntagi, i yi sogegododen binna mato e nun kɔmɛn fɔxɔn binni, e nun yiifari fɔxɔn binni, e nun sogeteden binni. I xa a mato i yɛtɛ yɛɛn na. Koni i xa a kolon a faɲin na, i mi Yurudɛn baan gidima. <verse eid="DEU 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 3:28"/>Yamarin fi Yosuwe ma, i limaniyaan nun sɛnbɛn fi a ma, bayo a tan nan tima yamaan yɛɛ ra Yurudɛn baan gidideni. I bɔxɔn naxan toma, a tan nan a ligama Isirayila yi na bɔxɔn sɔtɔ e kɛɛ bɔxɔn na.” <verse eid="DEU 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 3:29"/>Nayi, en yi lu lanbanni Beti-Peyori yɛtagi.<verse eid="DEU 3:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="DEU 4"/>
  <para style="s">Alaa sariyan suxu fena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 4:1"/>Iki, Isirayila, ɛ tuli mati. Ɛ xa tɔnne nun sariyane suxu, n na ɛ xaranma naxanye ma iki, alogo ɛ xa siimayaan sɔtɔ, ɛ mɔn xa bɔxɔn sɔtɔ Alatala ɛ benbane Ala naxan fixi ɛ ma. <verse eid="DEU 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 4:2"/>Ɛ nama sese sa n ma yamarin fari, n naxan falaxi ɛ xa. Ɛ mɔn nama sese ba a ra. Ɛ xa Alatala ɛ Ala yamarine suxu alo n na falama ɛ xa kii naxan yi.<verse eid="DEU 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 4:3"/>Ɛ bata a to ɛ yɛɛne ra Alatala naxan ligaxi Baali-Peyori yi. Alatala ɛ Ala bata muxun birin faxa naxanye Baali suxuren batuxi Peyori yi. <verse eid="DEU 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 4:4"/>Koni ɛ tan naxanye biraxi Alatala ɛ Ala fɔxɔ ra, ɛ birin mɔn ɛ nii ra han to.<verse eid="DEU 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 4:5"/>Ɛ a kolon, n bata ɛ xaran tɔnne nun sariyane ma alo Alatala n ma Ala a yamarixi n ma kii naxan yi, alogo ɛ xa e suxu na bɔxɔni dɛnaxan findima ɛ gbeen na. <verse eid="DEU 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 4:6"/>Ɛ xa e suxu ki faɲi, alogo a xa findi lɔnnin na ɛ xa, e nun xaxili faɲin na siya gbɛtɛne yɛɛ ra yi. Siya gbɛtɛne na sariyani itoe e fe mɛ, e a falama nɛn, e naxa, “Siya gbeeni ito lɔnnixi, e xaxinla fan.” <verse eid="DEU 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 4:7"/>Siyaan mundun ma ala masoxi a ra alo Alatala en ma Ala masoxi en na kii naxan yi, en na a maxandi waxatin naxan yi? <verse eid="DEU 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 4:8"/>Siya gbeen mundun na alo en tan tɔnne nun sariya tinxinxine naxan yii alo n sariyan naxan soma ɛ yii to? <verse eid="DEU 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 4:9"/>Ɛ a liga ɛ yeren ma ɛ siimayaan birin yi, ɛ yi ɛ yɛtɛ ratanga alogo ɛ nama ɲinan na feene xɔn ɛ naxanye toxi. Ne nama ba ɛ bɔɲɛni. Ɛ xa ɛ diine xaran ne ma e nun e fan yixɛtɛne.<verse eid="DEU 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 4:10"/>Ɛ miri na lɔxɔn ma ɛ ti Alatala ɛ Ala yɛtagi waxatin naxan yi Horebe geyaan ma. Na lɔxɔni Alatala yi a fala n xa, a naxa, “Yamaan birin xa malan n yɛtagi. N xa n ma sariyan fala e xa alogo e xa gaxu n yɛɛ ra e dunuɲa yi gidini. E mɔn xa e diine fan xaran ne ma.” <verse eid="DEU 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 4:11"/>Ɛ yi ɛ maso ɛ ti geyaan san bun. Tɛɛn bata yi geyaan birin suxu, te han kore. Dimin nun tutin nun kundaan yi godo. <verse eid="DEU 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 4:12"/>Alatala yi falan ti ɛ xa tɛɛn tagi. Ɛ yi a xuiin mɛ falan tiyɛ, koni ɛ mi a gbindin to. Ɛ yi a xuiin nan tun mɛma. <verse eid="DEU 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 4:13"/>A yi a layirin nali ɛ ma, yamari fune, a naxanye yamarixi ɛ ma a ɛ xa e suxu. A yi ne sɛbɛ gɛmɛ walaxa firinne ma. <verse eid="DEU 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 4:14"/>Na waxatini, Alatala yi n yamari, a n xa ɛ xaran tɔnne nun sariyane ma, alogo ɛ xa e suxu bɔxɔni naxan findima ɛ gbeen na, ɛ na Yurudɛn baan gidi.<verse eid="DEU 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 4:15"/>Alatala falan ti ɛ xa waxatin naxan yi Horebe geyaan fari, tɛɛn tagi, ɛ mi a gbindin to. Nayi, ɛ xa ɛ yɛtɛ ratanga, <verse eid="DEU 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 4:16"/>ɛ nama findi fe kalane ra, ɛ suxuren nafala sena nde sawuran na naxan nun xɛmɛna hanma ɲaxanla maliga, <verse eid="DEU 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 4:17"/>hanma subena naxan bɔxɔn ma, hanma xɔliin naxan kore, <verse eid="DEU 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 4:18"/>hanma bubusena hanma yɛxɛne igeni. <verse eid="DEU 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 4:19"/>Ɛ nama ɛ yɛɛ rate kore ɛ sogen batu, hanma kikena, hanma sarene. Seen naxanye birin kore, ɛ nama ɛ yigodo ne xa, ɛ nama e batu. Alatala ɛ Ala nan ne soxi siyane birin yii naxanye dunuɲa yi. <verse eid="DEU 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 4:20"/>Koni ɛ tan, Alatala bata ɛ ramini Misiran yamanani alo wuren bama sulun tɛɛni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">4.20</char> <char style="fk">Sulun tɛɛn</char> mɔn falama yirena nde yi fa fala “<char style="fk">Furu tɛɛna</char>.”</note> kii naxan yi, alogo ɛ xa findi a gbee yamaan na, alo ɛ kii naxan yi to.<verse eid="DEU 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 4:21"/>Alatala yi xɔlɔ n ma ɛ fe ra. A yi a kɔlɔ, a n mi Yurudɛn baan gidima, n so bɔxɔ faɲini ito yi Alatala ɛ Ala naxan fi ɛ ma ɛ kɛɛn na. <verse eid="DEU 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 4:22"/>N tan, n faxama bɔxɔni ito nin. N mi Yurudɛn baan gidima. Koni ɛ tan a gidima nɛn, ɛ yi na bɔxɔ faɲin tongo ɛ gbeen na. <verse eid="DEU 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 4:23"/>Ɛ a liga ɛ yeren ma alogo ɛ nama ɲinan Alatala ɛ Alaa layirin xɔn a naxan tongoxi ɛ xa. Ɛ nama se maliga suxure yo rafala Alatala ɛ Ala tɔnna saxi naxan na, <verse eid="DEU 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 4:24"/>bayo Alatala ɛ Ala xɔxɔlɔn, a luxi nɛn alo tɛɛn naxan halagin tima.<verse eid="DEU 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 4:25"/>Ɛ na diine nun mamandenne sɔtɔ waxatin naxan yi, ɛ na bu na bɔxɔni, xa ɛ kalan ti, ɛ suxuren nafala sena nde maligan na, ɛ fe ɲaxin liga Alatala ɛ Ala yɛtagi naxan a raxɔlɔma, <verse eid="DEU 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 4:26"/>koren nun bɔxɔn nan en serene ra to, ɛ ɲanma nɛn bɔxɔni mafurɛn naxan findima ɛ gbeen na Yurudɛn kidima. Ɛ mi siimaya sɔtɔma. Ɛ halagima nɛn. <verse eid="DEU 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 4:27"/>Alatala ɛ raxuyama ayi nɛn siya gbɛtɛne tagi. Ɛ xurunɲɛ ayi ne yɛ Alatala na ɛ xali dɛnaxan yi. <verse eid="DEU 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 4:28"/>Ɛ suxurene batuma nɛn mɛnni, muxune naxanye rafalama wudin na, hanma gɛmɛn na, suxuren naxanye mi nɔɛ seen toɛ, e mi fe mɛma, e mi e dɛgema, e mi se xirin mɛma. <verse eid="DEU 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 4:29"/>Ɛ fama nɛn Alatala ɛ Ala fendeni mɛnni. Ɛ mɔn a toma nɛn, xa ɛ a fen ɛ bɔɲɛn birin na e nun ɛ niin birin yi. <verse eid="DEU 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 4:30"/>Ɛ tɔrɔma waxatin naxan yi, na feene birin ɛ lima nɛn. Na waxatini ɛ xɛtɛma nɛn Alatala ɛ Ala ma, ɛ yi a xuiin namɛ. <verse eid="DEU 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 4:31"/>Bayo Alatala ɛ Ala, Ala na a ra naxan kininkinin, naxan mi ɛ rabeɲinma, naxan mi ɛ halagima. A mi ɲinanɲɛ layirin xɔn, a a kɔlɔ naxan ma ɛ benbane xa.<verse eid="DEU 4:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 4:32"/>Ɛ miri fe fonne ma naxanye bata dangu, e nun naxanye bata liga xabu Ala Adama daxi bɔxɔn fari waxatin naxan yi. Ɛ miri bɔxɔn yiren birin ma. Fe gbɛtɛ bata liga naxan gbo ito xa ba? Ɛ bata na ɲɔxɔnna mɛ ba? <verse eid="DEU 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 4:33"/>Siya gbɛtɛn na ba naxan bata Ala fala xuiin mɛ tɛɛn tagi, a mɔn yi lu a nii ra alo ɛ tan? <verse eid="DEU 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 4:34"/>Ala mundun bata siyana nde ba siya gbɛtɛn yii misaale nun taxamasenne nun kabanakone nun yɛngɛne nun sɛnbɛ gbeen nun nɔɔn nun fe magaxuxine xɔn, alo Alatala ɛ Ala feen naxanye birin liga ɛ xa Misiran yamanani ɛ yɛɛ xɔri? <verse eid="DEU 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 4:35"/>Na bata fixa ɛ xa alogo ɛ xa la a ra, a Alatala keden peen nan Ala ra, gbɛtɛ mi na fɔ a tan. <verse eid="DEU 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 4:36"/>Ɛ bata a xuiin namɛ keli kore alogo a xa ɛ maxuru. A tɛɛ gbeen yita ɛ ra bɔxɔn ma, ɛ mɔn yi a xuiin namɛ tɛɛn tagi. <verse eid="DEU 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 4:37"/>A ɛ benbane xanu nɛn, a yi e bɔnsɔnna fan sugandi hali e dangu xanbini. Na nan a toxi a yi ɛ ramini sɛnbɛn na Misiran yamanani. <verse eid="DEU 4:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 4:38"/>A yi siyane kedi ɛ xa naxanye sɛnbɛn yi gbo ɛ tan xa. A yi e bɔxɔn so ɛ yii ɛ kɛɛn na alo a kii naxan yi to. <verse eid="DEU 4:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 4:39"/>Ɛ xa a kolon ɛ bɔɲɛni to, a Alatala keden peen nan Ala ra kore xɔnna ma e nun bɔxɔn ma. Gbɛtɛ mi na. <verse eid="DEU 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 4:40"/>Ɛ xa a tɔnne nun a yamarine suxu, n naxanye soma ɛ yii to, alogo ɛ xa hɛrin sɔtɔ ɛ tan nun ɛ yixɛtɛne hali ɛ dangu xanbini, alogo ɛ xa siimaya xunkuyen sɔtɔ bɔxɔni Alatala ɛ Ala dɛnaxan fima ɛ ma han habadan.<verse eid="DEU 4:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Marakisi taane</para>
  <para style="r">Yatɛne 35.6-34 nun Sariyane 19.1-13 nun Yosuwe 20.1-9</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 4:41"/>Nabi Musa yi taa saxan sugandi Yurudɛn sogeteden binni. <verse eid="DEU 4:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 4:42"/>Ne yi findi marakisi taane ra faxa tiine xa naxanye e boden faxama koni e mi a rakelixi a ma, e mi a yitɔnxi xɔnnantenyani. Na kanna nɔma ludeni taani itoe nde keden yi nɛn alogo a niin xa ratanga gbeeɲɔxɔyaan ma. <verse eid="DEU 4:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 4:43"/>Na taane ni i ra: Bɛsɛri taan naxan tonbonni fiili yireni Rubɛn bɔnsɔnna konni, Ramoti taan naxan Galadi bɔxɔni, Gadi bɔnsɔnna konni, e nun Golan taan naxan Basan bɔxɔni Manase bɔnsɔnna konni.<verse eid="DEU 4:43"/></para>
  <para style="s">Musaa kawandi baan firindena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 4:44"/>Alaa sariyan ni i ra, Nabi Musa naxan nali Isirayila kaane ma. <verse eid="DEU 4:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 4:45"/>Maxadi xuine nun tɔnne nun sariyane ni i ra, Nabi Musa naxan fala Isirayila kaane xa e yi minima Misiran yamanani waxatin naxan yi. <verse eid="DEU 4:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 4:46"/>E yi Yurudɛn kidima mɛrɛmɛrɛne yi Beti-Peyori yɛtagi, Manga Sixɔn ma bɔxɔn ma, Amorine mangana, naxan yi dɔxi Xɛsibɔn yi. Nabi Musa nun Isirayila kaane yi a nɔ e yi minima Misiran bɔxɔni waxatin naxan yi. <verse eid="DEU 4:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 4:47"/>E yi a bɔxɔn tongo, e nun Ogo a bɔxɔna, Basan mangana. Amorine manga firinne nan yi ne ra Yurudɛn kidima, a sogeteden binni. <verse eid="DEU 4:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 4:48"/>Na bɔxɔn danne ni i ra: Keli Aroyeri yi han Arinon xuden dɛ sa dɔxɔ Xerimon geyaan na, naxan xili Siyon, <verse eid="DEU 4:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 4:49"/>e nun Araba bɔxɔn birin Yurudɛn kidima a sogeteden binni, a sa dɔxɔ Fɔxɔ Ige Daraan na Pisiga geyaan san bun.<verse eid="DEU 4:49"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="DEU 5"/>
  <para style="s">Yamari fune fe</para>
  <para style="r">Xɔrɔyaan 20.1-17</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 5:1"/>Nabi Musa yi Isirayila yamaan maxili, a yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Isirayila kaane, ɛ tuli mati tɔnne nun sariyane ra, n naxanye falama ɛ xa to. Ɛ xa e xaran, ɛ yi e suxu ki faɲi. <verse eid="DEU 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 5:2"/>Alatala en ma Ala bata layirin tongo en xa Horebe geyaan ma. <verse eid="DEU 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 5:3"/>Alatala nun en benbane xa mi layirini ito xidixi. A xidixi en tan nan birin tagi en tan naxan mɔn en nii ra to. <verse eid="DEU 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 5:4"/>Alatala falan ti nɛn ɛ xa keli tɛɛn tagi geyaan ma yɛɛ nun yɛɛ. <verse eid="DEU 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 5:5"/>Na waxatini n tan nan yi tima ɛ nun Alatala tagi alogo n xa Alatalaa falane rali ɛ ma, bayo ɛ yi gaxuxi tɛɛn yɛɛ ra. Ɛ mi te geyaan fari.” A yi a fala, a naxa, <verse eid="DEU 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 5:6"/>“Alatala nan n tan na i ya Ala naxan i raminixi konyiyani Misiran yi.”<verse eid="DEU 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yamari singena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 5:7"/>“I nama ala gbɛtɛ batu fɔ n tan.”<verse eid="DEU 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yamari firindena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 5:8"/>“I nama suxuren nafala hanma sena nde sawurana, seen naxan kore, naxan bɔxɔn ma hanma naxan igeni. <verse eid="DEU 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 5:9"/>I nama i xinbi sin e xa. I nama e batu. Amasɔtɔ n tan, Alatala, i ya Ala, n xɔxɔlɔn. Naxanye na n naɲaxu, n ne hakɛne saranma e diine ra nɛn han mayixɛtɛ saxan hanma naanin. <verse eid="DEU 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 5:10"/>Koni naxanye na n xanu, e n ma yamarine suxu, n hinanma ne ra nɛn han mayixɛtɛ wuli keden.”<verse eid="DEU 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yamari saxandena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 5:11"/>“I nama Alatala i ya Ala xinla fala fuuni, amasɔtɔ Alatala na kanna ɲaxankatama nɛn.”<verse eid="DEU 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yamari naanindena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 5:12"/>“I xa Matabu Lɔxɔn binya, i yi a rasariɲan alo Alatala i ya Ala a yamarixi i ma kii naxan yi. <verse eid="DEU 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 5:13"/>I xa wali xii sennin bun ma, i yi i ya wanle birin kɛ. <verse eid="DEU 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 5:14"/>Koni xii soloferede lɔxɔni, Alatala i ya Alaa Matabu Lɔxɔn nan na ra. I nama wali yo kɛ, i tan ba, i ya dii xɛmɛn ba, i ya dii tɛmɛn ba, i ya konyin ba, i ya ɲingen ba, i ya sofanla ba, i ya xuruseen birin ba hanma hali xɔɲɛn naxan i konni, alogo i ya walikɛne fan xa e matabu alo i tan. <verse eid="DEU 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 5:15"/>I nama ɲinan a konyin nan yi i ra Misiran yi. Alatala i ya Ala yi i ramini konyiyani a sɛnbɛn nun nɔɔn na. Na nan a toxi n na falaxi i xa, i xa Matabu Lɔxɔn binya.”<verse eid="DEU 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yamari suulundena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 5:16"/>“I baba nun i nga binya alo Alatala i ya Ala a yamarixi i ma kii naxan yi, alogo i xa siimaya xunkuyen nun hɛrin sɔtɔ bɔxɔni Alatala i ya Ala naxan fima i ma.”<verse eid="DEU 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yamari sennindena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 5:17"/>“I nama faxan ti.”<verse eid="DEU 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yamari soloferedena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 5:18"/>“I nama yalunyaan liga.”<verse eid="DEU 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yamari solomasɛxɛdena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 5:19"/>“I nama muɲan ti.”<verse eid="DEU 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yamari solomanaanindena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 5:20"/>“I nama wule seren ba i adamadi boden xili ma.”<verse eid="DEU 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yamari fudena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 5:21"/>“I nama mila i bodena ɲaxanla xɔn hanma a banxina hanma a xɛɛna hanma a konyina hanma a ɲingena hanma a sofanla hanma i adamadi boden gbee seen naxan birin na.”<verse eid="DEU 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 5:22"/>Alatala na feene nan falaxi ɛ birin malanxin yɛɛ xɔri, a xui yitexin na, geyaan fari, keli tɛɛn nun dimin nun kundani. A mi sese sa a fari. A yi e sɛbɛ walaxa gɛmɛ daxi firin ma, a yi e so n yii.<verse eid="DEU 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="r">Xɔrɔyaan 20.18-21</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 5:23"/>Ɛ xuini ito mɛxi waxatin naxan yi keli dimini tɛɛn tagi geyaan fari, ɛ nun ɛ mangane nun fonne yi fa n fɛma. <verse eid="DEU 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 5:24"/>Ɛ yi a fala n xa, ɛ naxa, “Alatala en ma Ala bata a nɔrɔn yita en na e nun a gbona. En bata a xuiin namɛ falan tiyɛ tɛɛn tagi. Nxu bata a kolon to, a Ala nɔɛ falan tiyɛ nɛn muxun na, na kanna mɔn yi lu a nii ra. <verse eid="DEU 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 5:25"/>Iki, nanfera en na en masoma faxan na? Tɛɛni ito en faxama nɛn. Xa en mɔn en tuli mati Alatala en ma Ala xuiin na, en faxama nɛn. <verse eid="DEU 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 5:26"/>Adamadiin mundun luxi alo en tan naxan bata habadan Ala xuiin mɛ falan tiyɛ tɛɛn tagi, a mɔn yi lu a nii ra? <verse eid="DEU 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 5:27"/>I tan Musa, i maso Alatala en ma Ala ra, i yi i tuli mati a ra. A naxan falama, i xa na radangu nxu ma. Nxu nxu tuli matima i ra nɛn. Nxu mɔn yi a liga.”<verse eid="DEU 5:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 5:28"/>Alatala yi ɛ falan mɛ, ɛ naxan falaxi n xa. A yi a fala n xa, a naxa, “N bata yamaan xuiin mɛ, e naxan falaxi i xa. Ɲɔndin na a ra. <verse eid="DEU 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 5:29"/>A yi lan nun n yɛɛragaxun xa lu e bɔɲɛni waxatin birin, e yi n ma yamarine suxu, alogo e tan nun e bɔnsɔnna xa hɛrin sɔtɔ habadan! <verse eid="DEU 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 5:30"/>Siga, i xa sa a fala e xa, a e xa so e bubune kui. <verse eid="DEU 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 5:31"/>Koni i tan xa lu n fɛma be. N xa n ma yamarine nun tɔnne nun sariyane birin fala i xa, i lan i xa e xaran naxanye ma, alogo e xa ne suxu e na so bɔxɔni n dɛnaxan fima e ma.” <verse eid="DEU 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 5:32"/>Alatala ɛ Ala naxan yamarixi ɛ ma, ɛ xa na liga ki faɲi. Ɛ nama siga kɔmɛn ma, ɛ nama siga yiifanna ma. <verse eid="DEU 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 5:33"/>Ɛ xa bira kirani ito nan fɔxɔ ra Alatala en ma Ala naxan yamarixi, alogo ɛ xa lu ɛ nii ra, ɛ sabati, ɛ siimaya xunkuyen sɔtɔ bɔxɔni ɛ dɛnaxan sɔtɔma.<verse eid="DEU 5:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="DEU 6"/>
  <para style="s">I xa Ala xanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 6:1"/>Yamarine nun tɔnne nun sariyane ni i ra, Alatala ɛ Ala naxan yamarixi n ma alogo n xa ɛ xaran e ma, alogo ɛ xa e suxu bɔxɔni ɛ Yurudɛn gidima naxan sɔtɔdeni. <verse eid="DEU 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 6:2"/>Ɛ xa gaxu Alatala en ma Ala yɛɛ ra. Ɛ xa tɔnne nun yamarine birin suxu ɛ siimayaan birin yi, n naxanye soxi ɛ yii, ɛ tan, ɛ diine, e nun ɛ mamandenne, alogo ɛ xa siimaya xunkuyen sɔtɔ. <verse eid="DEU 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 6:3"/>Isirayila kaane, ɛ xa ɛ tuli mati falani itoe ra ɛ yi e suxu ki faɲi, alogo ɛ xa hɛrin sɔtɔ, ɛ yi wuya ayi na bɔxɔni nɔnɔn nun kumin gbo dɛnaxan yi, alo Alatala ɛ benbane Ala a falaxi ɛ xa kii naxan yi.<verse eid="DEU 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 6:4"/>Isirayila kaane, ɛ tuli mati. Alatala en ma Ala keden peen na a ra. <verse eid="DEU 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 6:5"/>I xa Alatala i ya Ala xanu i bɔɲɛn birin na e nun i niin birin na e nun i sɛnbɛn birin na. <verse eid="DEU 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 6:6"/>N yamarini itoe naxan fixi i ma iki, e xa lu i bɔɲɛni. <verse eid="DEU 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 6:7"/>I xa i ya diine xaran ne ma waxatin birin. I xa e fe fala i nɛma banxini, i nɛma sigatini, i nɛma i sɛ e nun i nɛma kelɛ. <verse eid="DEU 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 6:8"/>I xa na falane xidi i yiin na, e nun i tigi ra alogo i nama ɲinan e xɔn. <verse eid="DEU 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 6:9"/>I xa e sɛbɛ i ya banxin sɛnbɛtɛnne ma e nun dɛɛne ma.<verse eid="DEU 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 6:10"/>Alatala ɛ Ala na ɛ xali bɔxɔni a dɛnaxan soma ɛ yii, alo a a kɔlɔ ɛ benbane Iburahima nun Isiyaga nun Yaxuba xa kii naxan yi, taa belebele tofaɲine dɛnaxan yi ɛ mi naxanye tixi, <verse eid="DEU 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 6:11"/>e nun banxi rafexine hɛrisigɛn sifan birin na ɛ mi naxanye fenxi, e nun xɔɲinne ɛ mi naxanye gexi, e nun manpa bili langane nun oliwi bili langane ɛ mi naxanye sixi, <verse eid="DEU 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 6:12"/>ɛ na ɛ dɛge han ɛ yi wasa, ɛ nama ɲinan Alatala ɛ Ala xɔn de, naxan ɛ raminixi konyiyani Misiran yi. <verse eid="DEU 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 6:13"/>Ɛ xa Alatala binya ɛ Ala, ɛ yi a keden peen batu. Ɛ xa ɛ kɔlɔ a tan nin. <verse eid="DEU 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 6:14"/>Ɛ nama ala gbɛtɛye batu de, ɛ rabilinna muxune naxanye batuma, <verse eid="DEU 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 6:15"/>bayo Alatala ɛ Ala naxan ɛ tagi, na xɔxɔlɔn. Xa na mi a ra a xɔlɔma nɛn ɛ ma, a mɔn yi ɛ faxa. <verse eid="DEU 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 6:16"/>Ɛ nama Alatala ɛ Ala mato bunbani de, alo ɛ naxan liga Masa yi. <verse eid="DEU 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 6:17"/>Koni ɛ xa Alatala ɛ Alaa yamarine suxu ki faɲi, e nun a maxadi xuine e nun a tɔnne a naxanye yamarixi ɛ ma. <verse eid="DEU 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 6:18"/>Ɛ xa tinxinyaan nun fe faɲine liga Alatala yɛɛ ra yi, alogo ɛ xa hɛrin sɔtɔ, ɛ yi bɔxɔ faɲin sɔtɔ Alatala a kɔlɔ naxan na ɛ benbane xa. <verse eid="DEU 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 6:19"/>Ɛ ɛ yaxune kedima nɛn alo Alatala a fala kii naxan yi.<verse eid="DEU 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 6:20"/>Ɛ diine na ɛ maxɔdin waxatin naxan yi, e naxa, “Maxadi xuine nun tɔnne nun yamarini itoe bunna nanse ra, Alatala en ma Ala naxan yamarixi en ma?” <verse eid="DEU 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 6:21"/>Ɛ e yabima nɛn, ɛ naxa, “Nxu yi findixi Firawonaa konyine nan na Misiran yamanani, koni Alatala yi nxu ramini Misiran yi a sɛnbɛn xɔn. <verse eid="DEU 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 6:22"/>Alatala yi taxamasenne nun kabanako belebele magaxuxine liga nxu yɛɛ xɔri Misiran kaane ra, e nun Firawona nun a denbayaan birin. <verse eid="DEU 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 6:23"/>A yi nxu ramini Misiran yi alogo a xa nxu xali bɔxɔni, a a kɔlɔ dɛnaxan ma fe ra en benbane xa, a a soma en yii. <verse eid="DEU 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 6:24"/>Alatala yi nxu yamari, a nxu xa sariyani itoe birin suxu nxu yi gaxu Alatala en ma Ala yɛɛ ra alogo nxu xa hɛrin sɔtɔ waxatin birin, nxu yi siimaya faɲin sɔtɔ alo en kii naxan yi iki. <verse eid="DEU 6:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 6:25"/>Xa en yamarini itoe birin suxu ki faɲi Alatala en ma Ala naxanye yamarixi en ma, na findima en ma tinxinyaan nan na.”<verse eid="DEU 6:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="DEU 7"/>
  <para style="s">Isirayila nun Kanan kaane fe</para>
  <para style="r">Xɔrɔyaan 34.11-16</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 7:1"/>Alatala ɛ Ala na ɛ xali bɔxɔni waxatin naxan yi, a dɛnaxan fima ɛ ma, a siya solofere kedima nɛn: Xitine nun Girigasane nun Amorine nun Kanan kaane nun Perisine nun Xiwine, e nun Yebusune, siya solofere naxanye wuya ɛ xa, e sɛnbɛn mɔn gbo ɛ xa. <verse eid="DEU 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 7:2"/>Alatala ɛ Ala na e lu ɛ sagoni waxatin naxan yi, ɛ yi e nɔ, ɛ xa e halagi fefe! Ɛ nama layiri yo xidi, ɛ mɔn nama kininkinin e ma. <verse eid="DEU 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 7:3"/>Futun nama so ɛ tagi. Ɛ nama ɛ dii tɛmɛne fi e dii xɛmɛne ma. Ɛ nama ɲaxanle fen e yɛ ɛ dii xɛmɛne ɲaxanle ra. <verse eid="DEU 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 7:4"/>Xa na mi a ra xɔɲɛni itoe ɛ diine ratantanma nɛn, e yi se gbɛtɛye batu, Alatala yi xɔlɔ ɛ ma, a yi ɛ halagi mafurɛn! <verse eid="DEU 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 7:5"/>Ɛ xa ito nan liga e ra: Ɛ xa e saraxa gandene nun e kide gɛmɛne birin kala. Ɛ yi e Asera kide gbindonne sɛgɛ, ɛ yi e suxurene birin gan.<verse eid="DEU 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 7:6"/>Bayo ɛ bata findi yama rasariɲanxin na Alatala ɛ Ala xa. Alatala ɛ Ala bata ɛ tan nan sugandi bɔxɔn siyane birin yɛ alogo ɛ xa findi a gbee yamaan na. <verse eid="DEU 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 7:7"/>Alatala mi biraxi ɛ fɔxɔ ra, a yi ɛ sugandi, bayo ɛ tan gbo yamaan birin xa. Ɛ tan yi xurun yamaan birin xa. <verse eid="DEU 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 7:8"/>Koni Alatala ɛ tan nan xanuxi. A yi a layirin nakamali a naxan tongo, a a kɔlɔ naxan ma ɛ benbane xa. Na nan a toxi a ɛ ramini a sɛnbɛn na konyiyani. A yi ɛ xunba Firawona yii, Misiran mangana. <verse eid="DEU 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 7:9"/>Nanara, ɛ xa a kolon, a Alatala ɛ Ala, a tan keden peen nan Ala ra. A tinxin. Naxanye na a xanu, e a yamarin suxu, a a layirin nakamalima ne xa nɛn a hinanni han mayixɛtɛ wuli keden. <verse eid="DEU 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 7:10"/>Naxanye na a xɔnnantenya, a ne fan saranna fima nɛn, a yi e halagi. Ala na xɔnnantenyaan saranma nɛn keden na. <verse eid="DEU 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 7:11"/>Nayi, i xa n ma yamarine nun tɔnne nun sariyane suxu ki faɲi, n ni yamarixi naxan na to.<verse eid="DEU 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="DEU 28:1-14">Sariyane 28.1-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 7:12"/>Xa i yamarini itoe ramɛ, i yi e suxu ki faɲi, Alatala i ya Alaa layirin nakamalima i xa nɛn a hinanni, alo a a kɔlɔ i benbane xa kii naxan yi. <verse eid="DEU 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 7:13"/>A i xanuma nɛn, a barakan sa i ya fe yi, a mɔn yi i wuya ayi. A barakan sama nɛn i ya dii barini e nun i ya xɛɛne bogiseene, maala nun manpa nɛnɛn nun turena, e nun i ya ɲinge diin nun yɛxɛɛ diin naxanye xalin kuruni, na bɔxɔni, a a kɔlɔ naxan ma ɛ benbane xa, a a soma ɛ yii. <verse eid="DEU 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 7:14"/>A ɛ barakama nɛn dangu siyane birin na. Dii baritaren mi luyɛ ɛ tagi, xɛmɛn ba, ɲaxanla ba, hali xuruseene. <verse eid="DEU 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 7:15"/>Alatala ɛ ratangama nɛn furen sifan birin ma. A mi fitina fure yo ragidɛ ɛ ma alo ɛ naxanye toxi Misiran yi. Koni a ne rasanbama muxune ma nɛn naxanye na ɛ xɔn. <verse eid="DEU 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 7:16"/>Ɛ lan nɛn ɛ xa muxune birin faxa, Alatala ɛ Ala naxanye soma ɛ yii. Ɛ nama kininkinin e ma, ɛ mɔn nama e gbee alane batu, alogo e nama ɛ ratantan.<verse eid="DEU 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 7:17"/>Ɛ a mirima nɛn ɛ bɔɲɛni, “Siyani itoe gbo en tan xa. Nxu tan e nɔɔn di?” <verse eid="DEU 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 7:18"/>Koni, ɛ nama gaxu e yɛɛ ra. Alatala ɛ Ala naxan ligaxi Firawona nun Misiran bɔxɔn birin na, na xa rabira ɛ ma. <verse eid="DEU 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 7:19"/>Ɛ bata fe xɔdɛxɛne to naxanye dɔxi e ra, e nun taxamasenne nun kabanakoon naxanye ligaxi. Ɛ bata Alatala ɛ Ala sɛnbɛn nun nɔɔn to a ɛ ramini naxan na Misiran bɔxɔni. Alatala ɛ Ala na fe sifan ligama nɛn yamanane birin na ɛ gaxuxi naxanye yɛɛ ra. <verse eid="DEU 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 7:20"/>Alatala ɛ Ala ɛ luma nɛn alo ɲurun naxanye ɛ yaxune kedima han hali naxanye e luxunxi ɛ ma, ne fan yi halagi. <verse eid="DEU 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 7:21"/>Ɛ nama gaxu e yɛɛ ra, bayo Alatala ɛ Ala nan ɛ tagi, a gbo, a magaxu. <verse eid="DEU 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 7:22"/>Alatala ɛ Ala siyani itoe kedima nɛn ɛ yɛɛ ra xunxuri yɛɛn ma, ɛ mi nɔɛ e birin faxɛ sanɲa yi kedenni, alogo burunna subene nama wuya ayi, e ɛ tɔrɔ. <verse eid="DEU 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 7:23"/>Alatala ɛ Ala e soma nɛn ɛ yii. A yi e yifu han, e halagi. <verse eid="DEU 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 7:24"/>A e mangane soma nɛn ɛ yii, ɛ yi e xinle ralɔ ayi dunuɲa yi. Muxu yo mi nɔɛ tiyɛ ɛ kanke. Ɛ e birin halagima nɛn. <verse eid="DEU 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 7:25"/>Ɛ xa e ala sawurane gan. Ɛ nama mila xɛmaan nun gbetin xɔn naxan na suxurene ma. Ɛ nama ne tongo ɛ gbeen na alogo a nama findi luti ratixin na ɛ fan yɛɛ ra. Amasɔtɔ se xɔsixin nan na ra Alatala ɛ Ala yɛɛ ra yi. <verse eid="DEU 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 7:26"/>Ɛ nama na suxure sifan naso ɛ banxine yi de, alogo ɛ fan nama halagi alo e tan. Ɛ xa ne raɲaxu bayo e haramuxi.<verse eid="DEU 7:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="DEU 8"/>
  <para style="s">Ɛ nama ɲinan Alatala xɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 8:1"/>Ɛ xa yamarini itoe birin suxu n naxanye yamarima ɛ ma to alogo ɛ xa siimaya faɲin sɔtɔ, ɛ yi wuya ayi. Ɛ yi na bɔxɔn sɔtɔ Alatala a kɔlɔxi naxan ma fe ra, a a soma nɛn ɛ benbane yii. <verse eid="DEU 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 8:2"/>Ɛ ɛ miri sigati xunkuyen ma Alatala ɛ Ala naxan nagidi ɛ ma tonbonni ɲɛɛ tonge naanin bun alogo a xa ɛ findi muxu yɛtɛ magodoxine ra. A mɔn xa ɛ kɛɲaan fɛsɛfɛsɛ, alogo a xa a kolon feen naxan ɛ sɔndɔmɛni, xa ɛ a yamarine suxɛ, hanma xa ɛ mi e suxɛ. <verse eid="DEU 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 8:3"/>A ɛ findi muxu yɛtɛ magodoxine ra nɛn, a yi ɛ rakamɛ. A mɔn yi Manna donseen<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">8.3</char> <char style="fk">Manna donsena</char> a fe mato Xɔrɔyaan 16.13-15 nun 16.31 kui.</note> so ɛ yii, ɛ nun ɛ benbane mi yi donseen naxan kolon. Na birin alogo a xa a yita ɛ ra, a muxun mi balon donseen xan gbansan na, fɔ Alatala falan naxanye birin tima. <verse eid="DEU 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 8:4"/>Ɲɛɛ tonge naaninni itoe bun, ɛ domane mi kalaxi, ɛ sanne mi kusinxi. <verse eid="DEU 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 8:5"/>Ɛ xa a kolon a Alatala ɛ Ala ɛ maxuruma nɛn alo diin fafe a maxuruma kii naxan yi. <verse eid="DEU 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 8:6"/>Ɛ xa Alatala ɛ Alaa yamarine birin suxu, ɛ bira a kirane fɔxɔ ra, ɛ mɔn yi gaxu a yɛɛ ra.<verse eid="DEU 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 8:7"/>Alatala ɛ Ala ɛ xalima nɛn bɔxɔ faɲini xudene nun darane dɛnaxan yi. Tigi ige gbeen minima na bɔxɔn lanbanne nun a geyane yi. <verse eid="DEU 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 8:8"/>Murutun nun fundenna nun manpa binle<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wudi binla nde na yi, mɛn kaane naxanye sima, e yi naxanye bogi yitɔnma alo manpana e gbee kiini.</char></note> nun xɔdɛ binle nun girenada binle nun oliwi turene nun kumin gbo na bɔxɔni. <verse eid="DEU 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 8:9"/>Burun mi ɲanma na bɔxɔni, sese mi fa dasama ɛ ma. Ɛ nɔɛ wuren bɛ nɛn gɛmɛni, wure gbeela fan yi sɔtɔ geyane yi.<verse eid="DEU 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 8:10"/>Ɛ na ɛ dɛge han ɛ yi lugo, ɛ xa barika bira Alatala ɛ Ala xa bɔxɔ faɲini ito a fe ra. <verse eid="DEU 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 8:11"/>Ɛ a liga ɛ yeren ma de! Ɛ nama ɲinan Alatala ɛ Ala xɔn, ɛ yi tondi a yamarine nun sariyane nun tɔnne suxɛ, n naxanye yamarima ɛ ma to. <verse eid="DEU 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 8:12"/>Ɛ na ɛ dɛge han ɛ yi lugo, ɛ na banxi faɲine ti, ɛ yi dɔxɔ mɛnni, <verse eid="DEU 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 8:13"/>ɛ ɲingene nun siine nun yɛxɛɛne na wuya ayi, ɛ gbetin nun ɛ xɛmaan na gbo ayi, ɛ hɛrisigɛn birin na gbo, <verse eid="DEU 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 8:14"/>ɛ xa a liga ɛ yeren ma alogo ɛ nama waso han ɛ yi ɲinan Alatala ɛ Ala xɔn, naxan ɛ ramini konyiyani Misiran bɔxɔni. <verse eid="DEU 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 8:15"/>A bata ɛ radangu tonbon gbee magaxuxin na, saɲi xɔlɛne nun tanle dɛnaxan yi, igen mi bɔxɔn naxan yi. A yi igen namini fanyeni ɛ xa. <verse eid="DEU 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 8:16"/>A yi Manna donseen so ɛ yii tonbonni ɛ benbane mi yi donseen naxan kolon, alogo a xa ɛ findi muxu yɛtɛ magodoxine ra, a yi ɛ kɛɲaan fɛsɛfɛsɛ, a yi nɔ fe faɲi ligadeni ɛ xa. <verse eid="DEU 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 8:17"/>Ɛ nama a miri, a ɛ hɛrisigɛni ito sɔtɔxi ɛ sɛnbɛn nun ɛ fangan nan xɔn. <verse eid="DEU 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 8:18"/>Ɛ xaxili lu Alatala ɛ Ala xɔn, bayo a tan nan sɛnbɛni ito fima ɛ ma alogo ɛ xa na hɛrisigɛn birin sɔtɔ. A a layirin nakamalima iki alo a a kɔlɔ ɛ benbane xa kii naxan yi. <verse eid="DEU 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 8:19"/>Xa ɛ ɲinan Alatala ɛ Ala xɔn, xa ɛ bira ala gbɛtɛye fɔxɔ ra, xa ɛ ɛ xinbi sin e xa, ɛ yi e batu, n xa a fala ɛ xa to, ɛ halagima nɛn. <verse eid="DEU 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 8:20"/>Ɛ halagima nɛn alo Alatala siya gbɛtɛne halagima ɛ yɛɛ ra kii naxan yi iki, bayo ɛ mi ɛ tuli matixi Alatala ɛ Ala a xuiin na.<verse eid="DEU 8:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="DEU 9"/>
  <para style="s">Isirayila kaane Ala matandina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 9:1"/>Isirayila kaane, ɛ tuli mati. Iki, ɛ Yurudɛn baan gidima nɛn. Ɛ siyane kedima nɛn naxanye gbo ɛ xa, e sɛnbɛn dangu ɛ ra. Ɛ yi e taane tongo naxanye yinne mate han kore. <verse eid="DEU 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 9:2"/>Mɛn kaane gbo, e kuya. Anaki bɔnsɔnna muxune nan ne ra, ɛ naxanye fe kolon. Ɛ bata a mɛ, muxune naxa, “Nde nɔɛ tiyɛ Anaki bɔnsɔnna kanke?” <verse eid="DEU 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 9:3"/>Ɛ xa a kolon iki, a Alatala ɛ Ala nan tima ɛ yɛɛ ra, alo tɛɛn naxan seen birin ganma. A tan nan e halagima, a e yarabima nɛn ɛ xa. Ɛ yi e kedi, ɛ yi e ɲan mafurɛn alo Alatala ɛ Ala a fala ɛ xa kii naxan yi. <verse eid="DEU 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 9:4"/>Alatala ɛ Ala na e kedi ɛ yɛɛ ra waxatin naxan yi, ɛ nama ɛ yɛtɛ matɔxɔ fa fala, “Alatala n nafaxi be bɔxɔni ito masɔtɔden ni bayo n tinxin.” Na mi a ra. Alatala siya gbɛtɛne kedima ɛ yɛɛ ra e kɛwali ɲaxine nan ma fe ra. <verse eid="DEU 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 9:5"/>Ɛ nama a miri, a ɛ fama e bɔxɔn sɔtɔdeni ɛ tinxinna nun ɛ lannayaan nan ma. Alatala siyani itoe kedima ɛ yɛɛ ra e kɛwali ɲaxine nan ma, alogo a xa a kɔlɔ xuiin nakamali, a naxan fala ɛ benbane Iburahima nun Isiyaga nun Yaxuba xa. <verse eid="DEU 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 9:6"/>Ɛ xa a kolon, a Alatala ɛ Ala mi bɔxɔ faɲini ito soxi ɛ yii ɛ gbeen na ɛ tinxinna xan ma fe ra. Amasɔtɔ yama murutɛxin nan ɛ ra.<verse eid="DEU 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 9:7"/>Na feen xa rabira ɛ ma ɛ Alatala ɛ Ala raxɔlɔ kii naxan yi tonbonni. Ɛ nama ɲinan na xɔn de! Xabu ɛ keli Misiran yi, han ɛ so be, ɛ yi murutɛma Alatala ɛ Ala xili ma. <verse eid="DEU 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 9:8"/>Ɛ Alatala raxɔlɔ nɛn Horebe geyaan fari han a yi wa ɛ faxa feni. <verse eid="DEU 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 9:9"/>N to te geyaan fari alogo n xa walaxa gɛmɛ daxine tongo naxan findixi layirin na en nun Alatala tagi, n yi yanyi tonge naanin nun kɔɛ tonge naanin ti geyaan fari, n mi donseen don, n mi igen fan min. <verse eid="DEU 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 9:10"/>Alatala yi walaxa gɛmɛ daxi firin so n yii, a naxan sɛbɛ a yɛtɛ yiin na. Alatala yamarin naxanye fala ɛ xa tɛɛn tagi ɛ yi malanxi waxatin naxan yi geyaan fari, ne birin yi sɛbɛxi walaxane ma. <verse eid="DEU 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 9:11"/>Yanyi tonge naanin nun kɔɛ tonge naanin to dɛfe, Alatala yi walaxa gɛmɛ daxi firinne so n yii a layirin na. <verse eid="DEU 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 9:12"/>Alatala yi a fala n xa, a naxa, “Keli, i xa godo mafurɛn bayo i yamaan naxan naminixi Misiran yi, e bata findi fe kalane ra. E bata kiraan fata, n na e yamarixi naxan na, e wure raxulunxin nafala suxuren na.” <verse eid="DEU 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 9:13"/>Alatala mɔn yi a fala n xa, a naxa, “N bata a to, a yama murutɛxini ito ra. <verse eid="DEU 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 9:14"/>I masiga n na alogo n xa e halagi, n xa e xinla ralɔ ayi dunuɲa yi. N ni i tan nan bɔnsɔnna muxune findima siya gbeen na naxan sɛnbɛn gbo, e mɔn wuya dangu siyani ito ra.” <verse eid="DEU 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 9:15"/>N yi godo geyaan ma, tɛɛn yi naxan ma. Na layiri walaxa gɛmɛ daxi firinne yi suxi n yii. <verse eid="DEU 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 9:16"/>Na waxatini, n yi a to, a ɛ bata yulubin liga Alatala ɛ Ala ra. Ɛ bata wure raxulunxin nafala ɲinge sawuran na. Ɛ bata kiraan fata Alatala naxan yamari ɛ ma. <verse eid="DEU 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 9:17"/>N yi walaxa gɛmɛ daxi firinne tongo, n yi e woli ayi, e yi yibɔ ɛ yɛɛ xɔri. <verse eid="DEU 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 9:18"/>N mɔn yi bira bɔxɔni Alatala yɛtagi, n lu na yanyi tonge naanin nun kɔɛ tonge naanin. N mi donseen don, n mi igen fan min. N na birin liga ɛ yulubine nan ma fe ra, ɛ fe ɲaxin naxan nabaxi Alatala yɛɛ ra yi, a xɔlɔ. <verse eid="DEU 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 9:19"/>N yi gaxu Alatalaa xɔlɔn na bayo a xɔlɔxi ɛ ma han a yi wa ɛ halagi feni. Koni Alatala mɔn yi n ma maxandin namɛ. <verse eid="DEU 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 9:20"/>Alatala bɔɲɛn yi texi Haruna ma han a yi wa a halagi feni, koni n mɔn yi Ala maxandi Haruna fan xa. <verse eid="DEU 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 9:21"/>N mɔn yi ɲinge sawuran tongo ɛ naxan nafalaxi ɛ yulubine yi, n yi a woli tɛɛni, n yi a yiwuru han a findi a fuɲin na. N yi na fuɲin woli xudeni naxan kelima geyaan fari.<verse eid="DEU 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 9:22"/>Ɛ mɔn Alatala raxɔlɔ nɛn Tabɛra taan nun Masa nun Kibiroti-Hatawa yi. <verse eid="DEU 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 9:23"/>Alatala to ɛ xɛ keli Kadesi-Barineya yi, a yi a fala ɛ xa, a naxa, “Ɛ siga, ɛ xa bɔxɔn tongo n naxan soxi ɛ yii.” Koni ɛ yi Alatala ɛ Alaa yamarin matandi. Ɛ mi la a ra, ɛ mɔn mi a xuiin namɛ. <verse eid="DEU 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 9:24"/>Xabu n na ɛ kolon waxatin naxan yi, ɛ murutɛxin na a ra Alatala xili ma. <verse eid="DEU 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 9:25"/>Alatala to wa ɛ faxa feni, n yi bira bɔxɔni a yɛtagi, n yi lu na yanyi tonge naanin nun kɔɛ tonge naanin. <verse eid="DEU 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 9:26"/>N yi Alatala maxandi, n naxa, “Marigina Alatala, i nama i ya yamaan halagi i gbeen naxan na, i yamaan naxan xunba i fangan na, i naxan naminixi Misiran bɔxɔni i sɛnbɛn na. <verse eid="DEU 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 9:27"/>I ɲɔxɔ lu i ya walikɛne xɔn ma, Iburahima nun Isiyaga nun Yaxuba. I xa diɲa yamani ito a xaxili xɔdɛxɛn nun a fe ɲaxin nun a yulubin ma, <verse eid="DEU 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 9:28"/>alogo Misiran kaane nama a fala, e naxa, ‘Alatala mi nɔxi e xalideni bɔxɔni a naxan ma fe falaxi e xa. A e raɲaxuxi nɛn. A bata e ramini alogo a xa sa e faxa tonbonni.’ <verse eid="DEU 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 9:29"/>Koni Ala, i ya yamaan nan e ra, i gbee yamana, i naxan namini i sɛnbɛn nun i ya nɔɔn xɔn.”<verse eid="DEU 9:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="DEU 10"/>
  <para style="s">Alaa diɲana</para>
  <para style="r">Xɔrɔyaan 34.1-10</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 10:1"/>Na xanbi, Alatala yi yamarin fi n ma, a naxa, “Walaxa gɛmɛn daxi firin nafala alo a singene. I mɔn xa wudi kankiraan nafala. I yi te n fɛma geyaan fari. <verse eid="DEU 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 10:2"/>N mɔn xa yamarine sɛbɛ naxanye yi walaxan bonne ma i naxanye kalaxi. I xa e sa na kankiraan nan kui.” <verse eid="DEU 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 10:3"/>N yi kankiraan nafala kasiya wudin na. N yi walaxa gɛmɛ daxi firin fan nafala alo bonne. N yi te e ra geyaan fari. <verse eid="DEU 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 10:4"/>Alatala yi sɛbɛnla ti walaxa nɛnɛni itoe ma, alo naxan yi sɛbɛxi bonne ma, yamari fune, a naxan falaxi ɛ xa geyaan ma tɛɛn tagi ɛ yi malanxi waxatin naxan yi. Alatala yi e so n yii. <verse eid="DEU 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 10:5"/>N yi godo geyaan fari, n yi walaxane sa kankiraan kui, n naxan nafalaxi. E yi lu na alo Alatala a yamari n ma kii naxan yi.<verse eid="DEU 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 10:6"/>Isirayila kaane yi keli Yakani a diine xɔɲinne yireni, siga Mosera yi. Haruna faxa mɛnna nin, a yi maluxun na. A dii Eleyasari yi findi saraxaraliin na a funfuni. <verse eid="DEU 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 10:7"/>Na xanbi ra, Isirayila kaane yi siga Gudugoda yi. E to keli Gudugoda yi, e yi siga Yotobata yi, xude wuyaxi yi bɔxɔn naxan yi. <verse eid="DEU 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 10:8"/>Na waxatini, Alatala yi wanla taxu Lewi bɔnsɔnna ra, a e xa findi Alatalaa Layiri Kankiraan maxali muxune ra.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fk">10.8</char> <char style="fk">Layiri Kankirana</char> fe mɔn sɛbɛxi Xɔrɔyaan 25.10-22 kui.</note> E mɔn xa ti Alatala yɛtagi e a wanle kɛ. E yi duba yamaan xa Alatala xinli. Na nan ligama han to. <verse eid="DEU 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 10:9"/>Nanara, Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune mi kɛɛn sɔtɔxi e ngaxakedenne yɛ. Alatala nan luxi e xa alo e kɛɛna alo a a fala e xa kii naxan yi.<verse eid="DEU 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 10:10"/>N lu nɛn geyaan fari yanyi tonge naanin nun kɔɛ tonge naanin alo n naxan liga a fɔlɔni. Alatala mɔn yi n ma maxandin namɛ, bayo a mi ɛ faxa feen nagidixi. <verse eid="DEU 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 10:11"/>Alatala yi a fala n xa, a naxa, “Keli, i ti yamaan yɛɛ ra. E xa so bɔxɔni n na n kɔlɔxi naxan ma fe ra e benbane xa, a n na soma nɛn e yii.”<verse eid="DEU 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Alaa xanuntenyana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 10:12"/>Iki, Isirayila kaane, Alatala ɛ Ala wama ɛ xa nanse liga? A wama nɛn ɛ xa gaxu Alatala ɛ Ala yɛɛ ra alogo ɛ xa sigan ti a kiraan xɔn, ɛ yi a xanu, ɛ yi wali Alatala ɛ Ala xa ɛ bɔɲɛn birin na e nun ɛ niin birin na. <verse eid="DEU 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 10:13"/>Ɛ mɔn xa Alatalaa yamarine nun tɔnne suxu ɛ Ala, n naxan soxi ɛ yii to alogo ɛ siimayaan xa fan. <verse eid="DEU 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 10:14"/>Alatala ɛ Ala nan gbee kore xɔnna birin na. E nun bɔxɔ xɔnna nun a yi seene birin. <verse eid="DEU 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 10:15"/>Koni Alatala ɛ benbane nan xanu. Iki ɛ tan nan e bɔnsɔnna ra, a ɛ tan nan sugandixi siyaan bonne yɛ, alo ɛ kii naxan yi to.<verse eid="DEU 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 10:16"/>Nayi, ɛ xa ɛ bɔɲɛne rasariɲan, ɛ nama fa murutɛ sɔnɔn. <verse eid="DEU 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 10:17"/>Bayo Alatala ɛ Ala nan alane Ala ra e nun mangane mangana, Ala naxan sɛnbɛn gbo, a magaxu. A mi muxune rafisama e bode xa, a mi dimi yi seene rasuxuma kiti sadeni. <verse eid="DEU 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 10:18"/>A tan nan kiridine nun kaɲa gilɛne xun mayɛngɛn na. Xɔɲɛn nafan a ma, a donseen nun marabɛri baan soma e yii. <verse eid="DEU 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 10:19"/>Ɛ fan xa xɔɲɛne rafan naxanye ɛ tagi bayo xɔɲɛne nan yi ɛ tan fan na Misiran yi. <verse eid="DEU 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 10:20"/>Ɛ xa gaxu Alatala ɛ Ala yɛɛ ra, ɛ yi a batu. Ɛ xa kankan a ma, ɛ mɔn xa ɛ kɔlɔ a tan nan xili yi. <verse eid="DEU 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 10:21"/>Ɛ xa a tan nan tantun. A tan nan ɛ Ala ra, naxan kabanakone nun fe magaxuxine ligaxi ɛ yɛɛ xɔri. <verse eid="DEU 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 10:22"/>Ɛ benbane yi soma Misiran yi waxatin naxan yi, e mi yi danguxi muxu tonge solofere ra. Iki Alatala ɛ Ala bata ɛ rawuya ayi dangu sarene ra kore.<verse eid="DEU 10:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="DEU 11"/>
  <para style="s">Alaa wanle Isirayila xa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 11:1"/>Ɛ xa Alatala ɛ Ala xanu, ɛ yi a gelene nun tɔnne nun sariyane nun yamarine suxu waxatin birin. <verse eid="DEU 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 11:2"/>Ɛ xa a kolon to, a ɛ diine mi a toxi, Alatala ɛ Ala ɛ maxuru kii naxan yi a gboon nun a sɛnbɛn nun a nɔɔn nun <verse eid="DEU 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 11:3"/>a kabanakone nun a wanle xɔn, a naxanye ligaxi Misiran bɔxɔni Firawona ra e nun a bɔxɔn birin na. <verse eid="DEU 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 11:4"/>E mɔn mi a toxi a naxan ligaxi Misiran sofa ganla ra, e nun e soone nun e yɛngɛ so wontorone. E mi a kolon Ala Gbala Baa igen sa sofane xun ma kii naxan yi, e yi ɛ sagatanma waxatin naxan yi. Alatala yi e birin nalɔ ayi habadan! <verse eid="DEU 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 11:5"/>Ɛ diine mɔn mi a toxi a naxan ligaxi tonbonni benun ɛ xa be li. <verse eid="DEU 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 11:6"/>E nun a naxan liga Datan nun Abirami ra, Eliyabi a dii xɛmɛne, Rubɛn bɔnsɔnna. Bɔxɔn yi yibɔ Isirayila kaane birin yɛɛ xɔri, a yi a raxutu e nun e denbayane nun e bubune nun e fɔxɔrabirane birin ma. <verse eid="DEU 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 11:7"/>Ɛ tan nan fe gbeeni itoe to ɛ yɛɛn na Alatala naxanye ligaxi.<verse eid="DEU 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 11:8"/>Nanara, ɛ xa yamarini itoe birin suxu, n naxanye yamarima ɛ ma to, alogo ɛ xa sɛnbɛn sɔtɔ ɛ yi bɔxɔni ito masɔtɔ Yurudɛn baan kidi ma, ɛ sigama dɛnaxan yi. <verse eid="DEU 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 11:9"/>Ɛ xa e suxu alogo ɛ xa siimaya xunkuyen sɔtɔ bɔxɔni Alatala a kɔlɔxi naxan ma fe ra ɛ benbane xa e nun e bɔnsɔnna, nɔnɔn nun kumin gbo dɛnaxan yi. <verse eid="DEU 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 11:10"/>Ɛ bɔxɔn naxan sɔtɔma a mi luxi alo Misiran bɔxɔna, ɛ kelixi dɛnaxan yi. Mɛnni, xɛɛ biin na ɲan, fɔ ɛ xa igen maxali a ma nɛn ɛ sanni alo nakɔna. <verse eid="DEU 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 11:11"/>Ɛ bɔxɔn naxan sɔtɔma Yurudɛn baan kidi ma, geya yiren nun lanban yiren na a ra. Tule igen nan sama a ma. <verse eid="DEU 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 11:12"/>Bɔxɔn na a ra Alatala ɛ Ala a ɲɔxɔ luxi dɛnaxan xɔn. A tan nan a xun matoma a ra, keli ɲɛɛn fɔlɔn na han a raɲanna.<verse eid="DEU 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Alaa layirina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 11:13"/>Xa ɛ yamarini itoe suxu a faɲin na n naxanye yamarima ɛ ma to, xa ɛ Alatala ɛ Ala xanu, ɛ yi a batu ɛ bɔɲɛn birin na e nun ɛ niin birin na, <verse eid="DEU 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 11:14"/>n tulen nafama nɛn ɛ bɔxɔn ma a waxatini, ɲɛmɛn nun sogefuren na, alogo ɛ xa hɛrisigɛn sɔtɔ, murutuna, manpa nɛnɛna, e nun turena. <verse eid="DEU 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 11:15"/>N mɔn sɛxɛn fan nasabatima nɛn ɛ bɔxɔni ɛ xuruseene balon na. Ɛ ɛ dɛgema nɛn han ɛ wasa. <verse eid="DEU 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 11:16"/>Ɛ a liga ɛ yeren ma alogo sese nama ɛ rakunfa, ɛ yi ɛ xun xɛtɛ, ɛ yi ɛ xinbi sin ala gbɛtɛye bun, ɛ e batu. <verse eid="DEU 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 11:17"/>Xa ɛ na liga, Alatala xɔlɔma nɛn ɛ ma han! A yi tulen dan alogo sansi yo nama fa sabati bɔxɔni sɔnɔn, ɛ yi ɲan bɔxɔni ito yi mafurɛn Alatala naxan soma ɛ yii.<verse eid="DEU 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 11:18"/>Ɛ xa falani itoe lu ɛ niini e nun ɛ bɔɲɛni. Ɛ e xidi ɛ yiin na e nun ɛ tigi ra alogo ɛ nama ɲinan e xɔn. <verse eid="DEU 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 11:19"/>Ɛ xa ɛ diine xaran ne ma, ɛ xa e fe fala ɛ nɛma dɔxi banxini, ɛ nɛma sigatini, ɛ nɛma saxi, ɛ nɛma kelima. <verse eid="DEU 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 11:20"/>Ɛ xa e sɛbɛ ɛ banxine sɛnbɛtɛnne nun e dɛɛne ma, <verse eid="DEU 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 11:21"/>alogo Alatala a kɔlɔ bɔxɔn naxan ma fe ra, a a soma ɛ benbane yii nɛn, ɛ nun ɛ yixɛtɛne xa lu mɛnni, fanni kuyen mɔn bɔxɔn xun ma. <verse eid="DEU 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 11:22"/>Xa ɛ yamarini itoe suxu ki faɲi, n na ɛ yamarima naxanye ra, xa ɛ Alatala ɛ Ala xanu, xa ɛ sigan ti a kirane xɔn, xa ɛ kankan a ma, <verse eid="DEU 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 11:23"/>nayi Alatala siyani itoe birin kedima nɛn ɛ yɛɛ ra. Ɛ yi siyani itoe bɔxɔn findi ɛ gbeen na, hali e maxɔdɔxɔ ɛ xa, e sɛnbɛn gbo ɛ xa. <verse eid="DEU 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 11:24"/>Ɛ na ɛ sanna ti dɛnaxan birin yi, na findima ɛ gbeen nan na. Ɛ bɔxɔn danna kelima nɛn tonbonni sa dɔxɔ Liban bɔxɔn na, keli Efirati baan na sa dɔxɔ fɔxɔ igen na sogegododen binni. <verse eid="DEU 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 11:25"/>Muxu yo mi tiyɛ ɛ yɛɛ ra. Ɛ na siga dɛdɛ yi, Alatala ɛ Ala ɛ yɛɛragaxun sama nɛn mɛn kaane yi e kuisan, alo a a fala ɛ xa kii naxan yi.<verse eid="DEU 11:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 11:26"/>Ɛ a mato, n bata barakan nun dangan sa ɛ yɛtagi to. <verse eid="DEU 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 11:27"/>Xa ɛ Alatala ɛ Alaa yamarine suxu, n na ɛ yamarima naxanye ra to, ɛ barakan sɔtɔma nɛn. <verse eid="DEU 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 11:28"/>Koni xa ɛ mi Alatala ɛ Alaa yamarine suxu, xa ɛ kiraan fata n na ɛ yamarima naxan na to, ɛ bira ala gbɛtɛne fɔxɔ ra ɛ mi naxanye kolon, ɛ dangan nan sɔtɔma.<verse eid="DEU 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 11:29"/>Alatala ɛ Ala na ɛ xali bɔxɔni waxatin naxan yi a dɛnaxan soma ɛ yii, ɛ xa duba falani itoe ti Garisimi geyaan fari, ɛ yi danga falane ti Ebali geyaan fari. <verse eid="DEU 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 11:30"/>Na geyane nayi Yurudɛn kidi ma, sogegododen kiraan xanbi ra, Kanan kaane bɔxɔni, Araba yi, Giligali yɛtagi, Morɛ wudi gbeene dɛnaxan yi. <verse eid="DEU 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 11:31"/>Ɛ Yurudɛn baan gidima iki, siga na bɔxɔni Alatala ɛ Ala dɛnaxan soma ɛ yii, a findi ɛ gbeen na, ɛ mɔn yi dɔxɔ na. <verse eid="DEU 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 11:32"/>Nanara, ɛ xa tɔnne nun yamarine birin suxu ki faɲi, n naxanye soma ɛ yii to.<verse eid="DEU 11:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="DEU 12"/>
  <para style="s">Ala batu yire kedenna fe yi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 12:1"/>Ɛ xa tɔnni itoe nun yamarine suxu ki faɲi na bɔxɔni, Alatala ɛ benbane Ala dɛnaxan soma ɛ yii. <verse eid="DEU 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 12:2"/>Ɛ siyaan naxanye kedima, ɛ xa ne suxure batudene birin kala, geyane fari e nun fɔtɔnne bun. <verse eid="DEU 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 12:3"/>Ɛ xa e saraxa gandene kala, ɛ yi e kide gɛmɛne yibɔ, ɛ yi e Asera kide gbindonne gan, ɛ yi e ala sawurane rabira, ɛ yi e xinle ɲan na yirene yi.<verse eid="DEU 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 12:4"/>Ɛ nama Alatala ɛ Ala batu na kiini. <verse eid="DEU 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 12:5"/>Koni ɛ xa Alatala fen yire kedenni, a na dɛnaxan sugandi ɛ bɔnsɔnne tagi, alogo a xa lu mɛnni, a xinla matɔxɔma dɛnaxan yi. Ɛ xa siga mɛnna nin, <verse eid="DEU 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 12:6"/>ɛ yi ɛ saraxa gan daxine ba e nun ɛ saraxane nun ɛ yaganne nun ɛ kiseene nun ɛ dɛ tiin nakamali saraxane nun ɛ ɲɛnige ma saraxane, e nun ɛ xuruseene dii singene. <verse eid="DEU 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 12:7"/>Ɛ xa ɛ saraxane don mɛnni Alatala ɛ Ala yɛtagi, ɛ tan nun ɛ denbayane. Ɛ xa sɛwa hɛrin na Alatala ɛ Ala naxan fixi ɛ ma.<verse eid="DEU 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 12:8"/>Na bɔxɔni, ɛ nama Ala batu alo en naxan nabama iki, birin nun a rafan fe. <verse eid="DEU 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 12:9"/>En na rabama bayo ɛ munma so ɛ matabu yireni singen, Alatala ɛ Ala dɛnaxan fima ɛ ma. <verse eid="DEU 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 12:10"/>Koni ɛ Yurudɛn baan gidima nɛn, ɛ yi dɔxɔ na bɔxɔni Alatala dɛnaxan soma ɛ yii. A ɛ ratangama nɛn ɛ yaxune birin ma naxanye ɛ rabilinni alogo ɛ xa dɔxɔ bɔɲɛ xunbenli. <verse eid="DEU 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 12:11"/>Alatala ɛ Ala yirena nde sugandima nɛn mɛnni, a xinla matɔxɔn dɛnaxan yi. Ɛ xa fa ɛ kiseene ra mɛnni n naxanye yamarixi ɛ ma: ɛ saraxa gan daxine, ɛ saraxane, ɛ yaganne, ɛ kiseene, e nun ɛ se faɲin naxanye fima Ala ma dɛ tiini. <verse eid="DEU 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 12:12"/>Ɛ sɛwama nɛn mɛnni Alatala ɛ Ala yɛtagi, ɛ tan, ɛ diine, ɛ konyine, e nun Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxun naxanye ɛ konni bayo bɔxɔn mi soma e yii e kɛɛ bɔxɔn na.<verse eid="DEU 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 12:13"/>Ɛ nama ɛ saraxa gan daxine ba ɛ waxɔn yirene yi de! <verse eid="DEU 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 12:14"/>Ɛ xa e ba Alatala ɛ Alaa yire sugandixin nin Isirayila bɔnsɔn keden konni. N naxan birin yamarixi ɛ ma, ɛ xa na birin liga mɛnni. <verse eid="DEU 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 12:15"/>Koni i nɔɛ nɛn suben don daxin faxɛ yiren birin yi, Alatala naxan fixi i ma, i na dɔxɔ dɛnaxan yi. Muxu sariɲanxin nun a sariɲantaren nɔɛ a donɲɛ nɛn, alo xɛnla hanma bolena. <verse eid="DEU 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 12:16"/>Koni ɛ nama suben don e nun a wunla, ɛ xa a wunla bɔxɔn alo igena.<verse eid="DEU 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 12:17"/>Ɛ mi lan ɛ murutun hanma manpa nɛnɛn hanma turen don ɛ konni naxan findɛ yaganna ra, hanma ɛ xuruseene dii singene hanma ɛ saraxan naxanye bama dɛ tiin ma, hanma ɛ ɲɛnige ma saraxane hanma ɛ kiseene. <verse eid="DEU 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 12:18"/>Ɛ xa ne don Alatala ɛ Ala yɛtagi, a dɛnaxan sugandima, ɛ tan nun ɛ diine nun ɛ konyine, e nun Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxun naxanye ɛ konni. Ɛ xa sɛwa hɛrin na Alatala ɛ Ala yɛtagi, a naxan fixi ɛ ma. <verse eid="DEU 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 12:19"/>Ɛ a liga ɛ yeren ma, ɛ nama ɲinan Lewine xɔn ɛ nɛma na bɔxɔni.<verse eid="DEU 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 12:20"/>Alatala ɛ Ala na ɛ bɔxɔn nagbo ayi waxatin naxan yi, alo a falaxi ɛ xa kii naxan yi, xa suben xɔnla ɛ suxu, ɛ xa na don alo ɛ wama a xɔn kii naxan yi. <verse eid="DEU 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 12:21"/>Xa ɛ dɔxɔden makuya Alatala ɛ Alaa yire sugandixin na, ɛ nɔɛ xuruseene faxɛ nɛn Alatala naxanye fixi ɛ ma alo n na a yamarixi ɛ ma kii naxan yi. Ɛ nɔɛ na subene donɲɛ nɛn ɛ taane yi alo ɛ wama a xɔn kii naxan yi. <verse eid="DEU 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 12:22"/>Muxu sariɲanxin nun a sariɲantaren nɔɛ a donɲɛ nɛn alo xɛnla hanma bolena. <verse eid="DEU 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 12:23"/>Koni ɛ nama suben don e nun a wunla, bayo wunla luxi nɛn alo a niina. A mi lan ɛ xa suben nun a niin don. <verse eid="DEU 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 12:24"/>Ɛ nama suben don e nun a wunla, ɛ xa a bɔxɔn alo igena. <verse eid="DEU 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 12:25"/>Ɛ nama a don alogo ɛ xa hɛrin sɔtɔ, ɛ tan, e nun ɛ diine hali ɛ dangu xanbini. Amasɔtɔ ɛ fe tinxinxine ligama Alatala yɛɛ ra yi.<verse eid="DEU 12:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 12:26"/>Koni naxan yo rasariɲanxi Ala xa hanma i dɛ ti naxan ma fe ra, a i a soma Ala yii nɛn, i xa ne xali Alatalaa yire sugandixini. <verse eid="DEU 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 12:27"/>Ɛ xa ɛ saraxa gan daxine ba Alatala ɛ Alaa saraxa ganden fari, suben nun a wunla. Ɛ xa saraxa gbɛtɛne wunla bɔxɔn Alatala ɛ Ala a saraxa ganden fari, ɛ yi a suben don.<verse eid="DEU 12:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 12:28"/>Ɛ xa feni itoe birin namɛ ɛ yi e liga n naxanye yamarima ɛ ma, alogo ɛ xa hɛrin sɔtɔ, ɛ tan nun ɛ diine hali ɛ dangu xanbini, han habadan. Amasɔtɔ fe faɲin na a ra naxan nafan Alatala ɛ Ala ma.<verse eid="DEU 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 12:29"/>Alatala ɛ Ala na siyane halagi ɛ yɛɛ ra, ɛ naxanye bɔxɔn masɔtɔma, ɛ na dɔxɔ e bɔxɔni, <verse eid="DEU 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 12:30"/>ɛ xa ɛ yɛtɛ ratanga e fe ɲaxi ligan ma e halagi xanbini. Ɛ nama e alane feen maxɔdin, ɛ naxa, “Siyani itoe yi e alane batuma di? En fan xa na nan liga.” <verse eid="DEU 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 12:31"/>Ɛ nama na fe sifan liga Alatala ɛ Ala ra, bayo e yi fe xɔsixin sifan birin ligama e alane xa naxanye raɲaxu Alatala ma. E yi e dii xɛmɛne nun dii tɛmɛne nan ganma e suxurene kideni.<verse eid="DEU 12:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="DEU 13"/>
  <para style="s">Suxure batuna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 13:1"/>Ɛ xa feni itoe birin liga n naxanye yamarima ɛ ma. Ɛ nama sese ba a ra, ɛ mɔn nama sese sa a fari. <verse eid="DEU 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 13:2"/>Xa nabina nde hanma sayibana nde keli ɛ tagi, a yi taxamasenna hanma kabanako fe famatɔɔn fala ɛ xa, <verse eid="DEU 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 13:3"/>na yi rakamali, a mɔn yi a fala ɛ xa, a naxa, “En bira suxurene batu feen fɔxɔ ra,” ɛ tan mi alan naxanye kolon, <verse eid="DEU 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 13:4"/>ɛ nama ɛ tuli mati na nabiin na hanma na sayibana. Alatala ɛ Ala nan ɛ kɛɲaan fɛsɛfɛsɛma alogo a xa a kolon xa ɛ a xanuxi ɛ bɔɲɛn birin na e nun ɛ niin birin yi. <verse eid="DEU 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 13:5"/>Ɛ xa bira Alatala ɛ Ala nan keden fɔxɔ ra, ɛ yi gaxu a yɛɛ ra. Ɛ yi a yamarine nun a falane suxu, ɛ yi a keden peen batu, ɛ yi kankan a ma. <verse eid="DEU 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 13:6"/>Koni ɛ xa nabiin hanma sayiban tan faxa, bayo a yi wama ɛ ramurutɛ feni Alatala ɛ Ala xili ma naxan ɛ raminixi Misiran yi a ɛ xunba konyiyani. A bata kata a xa ɛ ba kiraan xɔn Alatala ɛ yamarixi naxan na. Fɔ ɛ xa fe ɲaxin birin ba ɛ tagi. <verse eid="DEU 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 13:7"/>I ngaxakedenna hanma i ya diina hanma i ya ɲaxanla i naxan xanuxi hanma i lanfaan naxan nafan i ma alo i yɛtɛna, xa na nde i rakunfa wundoni alogo ɛ xa alana nde batu, i mi naxan kolon, ɛ benbane fan mi yi naxan kolon, <verse eid="DEU 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 13:8"/>ɛ rabilinna siyana ndee suxurena, naxanye makuya ɛ ra hanma naxanye maso, keli bɔxɔn danna boden ma sa ti boden na, <verse eid="DEU 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 13:9"/>i nama tin a falan ma. I nama i tuli mati a ra. I nama kininkinin a ma. I nama a ratanga. I nama a luxun. <verse eid="DEU 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 13:10"/>I xa na kanna faxa, i tan nan singe xa a gɔlɔn gɛmɛn na, yamaan fan yi a magɔlɔn. <verse eid="DEU 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 13:11"/>Ɛ xa a magɔlɔn han a yi faxa, bayo a bata kata a xa i raxɛtɛ Alatala i ya Ala fɔxɔ ra naxan i raminixi konyiyani Misiran bɔxɔni. <verse eid="DEU 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 13:12"/>Isirayila kaane birin na feen mɛma nɛn, e yi gaxu. Nayi, na fe ɲaxi sifan mi fa ligama ɛ tagi sɔnɔn.<verse eid="DEU 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 13:13"/>Xa ɛ falana nde mɛ taana nde a fe ra, Alatala ɛ Ala dɛnaxan soma ɛ yii, <verse eid="DEU 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 13:14"/>fa fala muxu ɲaxina nde bata keli mɛnni naxan a falama bonne xa, a naxa, “En xa suxurena ndee batu, ɛ mi naxanye kolon,” <verse eid="DEU 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 13:15"/>nayi ɛ xa na feen xɔnfen ki faɲi ɛ yi ɲɔndin fen. Ɛ xa a kolon xa na fe ɲaxin ligaxi ɛ tagi. <verse eid="DEU 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 13:16"/>Ɛ xa na taa kaane birin faxa silanfanna ra.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">13.16</char> <char style="fk">Silanfanna:</char> Sofane yɛngɛso dɛgɛmana.</note> Ɛ xa na taan nun a muxune nun a xuruseene birin naxɔri. <verse eid="DEU 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 13:17"/>Ɛ xa e hɛrisigɛn birin malan taa tagini, ɛ tɛɛn sa a ra, ɛ taan birin gan Alatala ɛ Ala yɛtagi. Na findima bɔxɔ rabeɲinxin nan na habadan. A mi fa tima sɔnɔn. <verse eid="DEU 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 13:18"/>Ɛ nama na sena ndee findi ɛ gbeen na ɛ naxanye ganma alogo Alatala nama xɔlɔ ɛ ma. A kininkininma ɛ ma nɛn, a yi ɛ rawuya ayi alo a a kɔlɔ kii naxan yi ɛ benbane xa. <verse eid="DEU 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 13:19"/>Na ma, ɛ xa Alatala ɛ Ala xuiin namɛ, ɛ yi a yamarine suxu, n naxanye yamarima ɛ ma to, ɛ yi fe tinxinxin liga Alatala ɛ Ala yɛɛ ra yi.<verse eid="DEU 13:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="DEU 14"/>
  <para style="s">Namun natɔnxine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 14:1"/>Alatala ɛ Alaa diine nan ɛ tan na. Xa sayaan ti, ɛ nama ɛ yɛtɛ maxaba. Ɛ nama ɛ xunna dɛ bi. <verse eid="DEU 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 14:2"/>Yama rasariɲanxin nan ɛ tan na Alatala ɛ Ala xa. A ɛ tan nan sugandixi bɔxɔn siyane birin tagi, a ɛ xa findi a gbeen na.<verse eid="DEU 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sube radaxaxine</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LEV 11:1-23">Saraxaraline 11.1-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 14:3"/>Ɛ nama se xɔsixi yo don. <verse eid="DEU 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 14:4"/>Subene ni i ra, ɛ nɔɛ naxanye donɲɛ: ɲingen nun yɛxɛɛn nun siin <verse eid="DEU 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 14:5"/>nun xɛnla nun tɔkɛn nun bolen nun geya ma siin nun wonden nun yaleen e nun burunna yɛxɛɛna. <verse eid="DEU 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 14:6"/>Sube toro kanna naxan toro bɔxi ɲaxi ra, a mɔn donseen laxunma, ɛ nɔɛ ne donɲɛ nɛn.<verse eid="DEU 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 14:7"/>Koni na subene tagi, naxanye toro bɔxi ɲaxi ra, hanma naxanye donseen laxunma, ndee e yɛ ɛ nama ne don alo ɲɔgɔmɛna hanma ɲerena hanma fanyerasina. E findixi sube haramuxine nan na ɛ xa, bayo e donseen laxunma, koni e toro mi bɔxi ɲaxi ra. <verse eid="DEU 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 14:8"/>Xɔsɛn toron bɔxi, koni a mi donse laxunma, a haramuxin na a ra ɛ tan xa. Ɛ nama na suben don, ɛ mɔn nama ɛ yiin din a faxaxin na.<verse eid="DEU 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 14:9"/>Niimaseen naxanye igeni, ɛ lan ɛ xa xali yɛxɛne don naxanye e bama. <verse eid="DEU 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 14:10"/>Koni naxanye mi e bama, e xali mi e ma, ɛ nama ne don. E mi sariɲan ɛ xa.<verse eid="DEU 14:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 14:11"/>Ɛ nɔɛ xɔli radaxaxine birin donɲɛ nɛn. <verse eid="DEU 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 14:12"/>Koni ɛ nama itoe don: singbinna nun dugana e nun xɔlimangan <verse eid="DEU 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 14:13"/>nun bangaan nun sɛgɛn siyaan birin, <verse eid="DEU 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 14:14"/>e nun xaxaan siyaan birin <verse eid="DEU 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 14:15"/>nun dangaranfulen nun kutunxunban nun fɔxɔ ige ma xɔlina, e nun tɔxɛdi tongon siyaan birin, <verse eid="DEU 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 14:16"/>e nun kunkutunna nun fɔtɔnbunsamuran nun toxoroon <verse eid="DEU 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 14:17"/>nun yɛxɛ suxu kankon nun kankanna nun ɲinɲaxan <verse eid="DEU 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 14:18"/>nun yaya xɔnla nun saɲi xɔnla siyaan birin, e nun sarasima xɔnla nun tuyɛna. <verse eid="DEU 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 14:19"/>Niimase xunxuri gabutɛ kanna birin haramuxin na a ra ɛ xa. Ɛ nama e don. <verse eid="DEU 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 14:20"/>Koni ɛ nɔɛ niimase xunxuri gabutɛ kanna ndee donɲɛ nɛn naxanye radaxaxi.<verse eid="DEU 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 14:21"/>Ɛ nama suben don naxan faxaxi a yɛtɛ ma. Ɛ nɔɛ a soɛ xɔɲɛn yii nɛn naxan dɔxi ɛ konni, a yi a don, hanma ɛ a sara xɔɲɛ gbɛtɛne ma. Koni yama rasariɲanxin nan ɛ tan na Alatala ɛ Ala xa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 14:21">I nama sii diin ɲin a nga xiɲɛ igen na.<verse eid="DEU 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yaganna fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 14:22"/>Ɛ na naxan birin sɔtɔ xɛɛn ma, ɛ xa na yaganna ba a ra ɲɛɛ yo ɲɛɛ. <verse eid="DEU 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 14:23"/>Ɛ xa ɛ murutun nun ɛ manpa nɛnɛn nun ɛ turen yaganna don Alatala ɛ Ala yɛtagi a na dɛnaxan sugandi a xinla matɔxɔden na alogo ɛ xa gaxu Alatala ɛ Ala yɛɛ ra waxatin birin. <verse eid="DEU 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 14:24"/>Xa na yiren makuya i ra ɲaxi ra, xa Ala bata i baraka han i mi nɔɛ na yaganna maxalɛ bayo Alatala a yire sugandixi makuya i ra a xinla matɔxɔma dɛnaxan yi, <verse eid="DEU 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 14:25"/>nayi i xa i ya yaganna masara gbetin na. I na gbetin xali Alatala i ya Ala yire sugandixini. <verse eid="DEU 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 14:26"/>Mɛnni i xa na gbetin masara sena ndee ra naxan na i kɛnɛn, ɲingene hanma yɛxɛɛne hanma manpana, naxanye birin nafan i ma. Ɛ nun i ya denbayaan yi ɛ dɛge Alatala ɛ Ala yɛtagi, ɛ yi sɛwa. <verse eid="DEU 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 14:27"/>Ɛ nama ɲinan Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune xɔn naxanye dɔxi ɛ konne yi, bayo e mi kɛɛ bɔxɔn sɔtɔxi e gbeen na.<verse eid="DEU 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 14:28"/>Ɲɛɛ saxan yo ɲɛɛ saxan ɛ xa ɛ yaganna birin namara ɛ taane yi. <verse eid="DEU 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 14:29"/>Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune kɛɛn mi na naxanye xa e nun xɔɲɛne nun kiridine nun kaɲa gilɛn naxanye ɛ tagi, ne birin xa fa e dɛgedeni han e yi lugo. Nayi, Alatala ɛ Ala barakan sama nɛn ɛ kɛwanle yi ɛ naxanye birin ligama.<verse eid="DEU 14:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="DEU 15"/>
  <para style="s">Xɔrɔya ɲɛɛna</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LEV 25:8-38">Saraxaraline 25.8-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 15:1"/>Ɲɛɛ solofere yo ɲɛɛ solofere ɛ xa diɲa donle ma. <verse eid="DEU 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 15:2"/>A xa liga ikiini: muxun naxanye birin bata e ngaxakedenna Isirayila kaana nde doli, e xa diɲa na donla ma. Ɛ nama ɛ ngaxakedenna Isirayila kaane karahan doli fi feen na bayo Alatalaa waxati saxin na a ra alogo yamaan yi diɲa donle ma. <verse eid="DEU 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 15:3"/>Ɛ nɔɛ xɔɲɛn tan karahanɲɛ nɛn, a yi ɛ donla fi, koni ɛ naxan dolixi ɛ ngaxakedenna ma, ɛ xa diɲa na ma. <verse eid="DEU 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 15:4"/>Anu, tɔrɔ muxun mi luma ɛ yɛ, bayo Alatala baraka gbeen sama nɛn ɛ fe yi na bɔxɔni Alatala ɛ Ala dɛnaxan soma ɛ yii ɛ kɛɛn na. <verse eid="DEU 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 15:5"/>A na ligama nɛn xa ɛ Alatala ɛ Ala xuiin namɛ ɛ yi a yamarine birin suxu ki faɲi, n naxan falama ɛ xa to. <verse eid="DEU 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 15:6"/>Alatala, ɛ Ala barakan sama nɛn ɛ fe yi alo a a fala ɛ xa kii naxan yi. Siya wuyaxine fama nɛn ɛ dolideni, koni ɛ tan mi donla tongoma. Ɛ nɔɔn sɔtɔma nɛn siya wuyaxine xun na, koni muxe mi nɔɔn sɔtɔma ɛ tan xun na.<verse eid="DEU 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 15:7"/>Xa tɔrɔ muxuna nde i ngaxakedenne yɛ i konni Alatala i ya Ala dɛnaxan fima i ma, i nama ɲɛnige ɲaxiyaan liga a ra, i tondi a dolɛ. <verse eid="DEU 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 15:8"/>A makoon naxan ma, i xa na doli a ma fonisireyani. <verse eid="DEU 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 15:9"/>I xa i yɛtɛ ratanga miriya ɲaxini ito ma, i naxa, “A gbee mi luxi ɲɛɛ soloferen xa a li, yamaan diɲama donle ma ɲɛɛn naxan na.” I nama yɛ xɔdɔxɔ ayi i ngaxakeden tɔrɔ muxune ma i tondi seen soɛ e yii. Nayi, a a mawugama nɛn Alatala xa i xili ma, i yi findi yulubi tongon na. <verse eid="DEU 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 15:10"/>I xa a ki fonisireyani hali i mi nimisa i bɔɲɛni. Nayi, Alatala ɛ Ala barakan sama nɛn ɛ kɛwanle birin yi. <verse eid="DEU 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 15:11"/>Yiigelitɔɔn mi ɲanma ɛ yamanani habadan, nanara, n na a yamarixi ɛ ma ɛ xa hinan ɛ ngaxakedenne ra, tɔrɔ muxun nun yiigelitɔɔn naxanye ɛ konni.<verse eid="DEU 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Konyine xɔrɔya fena</para>
  <para style="r">Xɔrɔyaan 21.2-6 nun Saraxaraline 25.38-55</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 15:12"/>Xa ɛ ngaxakedenna Heburu xɛmɛna nde hanma ɲaxanla a yɛtɛ mati ɛ ma konyin na, a walima nɛn ɛ xa ɲɛɛ sennin. A ɲɛɛ soloferedeni ɛ xa a xɔrɔya. <verse eid="DEU 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 15:13"/>Koni ɛ nama a yii genla yiba. <verse eid="DEU 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 15:14"/>Alatala, ɛ Ala seen naxanye birin fixi ɛ ma barakani alo yɛxɛɛn nun siin nun murutuna, e nun manpana, ɛ xa a ki na nde yi. <verse eid="DEU 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 15:15"/>Ɛ nama ɲinan a konyine nan yi ɛ ra Misiran yi. Alatala ɛ Ala nan ɛ xunbaxi. Nanara, n yamarini ito soma ɛ yii to.<verse eid="DEU 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 15:16"/>Xa i ya konyina a fala i xa, a a mi kelima i konni bayo ɛ nun i ya denbayaan nafan a ma, a a lan i konni, <verse eid="DEU 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 15:17"/>nayi, i xa sɔxɔn seen tongo, i yi a tunla maso banxin dɛɛ wudin na, i yi a tunla sɔxɔn. Nayi, a findima nɛn i ya konyin na a siin birin yi. I na nan ligama i ya konyi gilɛn fan na. <verse eid="DEU 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 15:18"/>Ɛ nama sunu konyin xɔrɔya feen na. Amasɔtɔ a ɲɛɛ sennin wanla tɔnɔn gbo dangu walikɛɛn gbeen na dɔxɔ firin. Na ma, Alatala, ɛ Ala barakan sama nɛn ɛ kɛwanle birin yi.<verse eid="DEU 15:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Xuruseene dii singene fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 15:19"/>Ɛ ɲingen nun yɛxɛɛn nun siin dii xɛmɛ singene birin naxanye xalima, ne birin findima Alatala ɛ Ala nan gbee ra. Ɛ mi lan ɛ turaan nawali xa dii singen na a ra, hanma ɛ yɛxɛɛ diin xaben maxaba a ma xa dii singen na a ra. <verse eid="DEU 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 15:20"/>Ɲɛɛ yo ɲɛɛ ɛ tan nun ɛ denbayaan xa ne don Alatala ɛ Ala yɛtagi a yire sugandixini. <verse eid="DEU 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 15:21"/>Xa fɛɛn xuruseen na, xa a yɛɛn kalaxi hanma a sanna, hanma fɛ gbɛtɛ, ɛ nama na ba saraxan na Alatala ɛ Ala xa. <verse eid="DEU 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 15:22"/>Ɛ a donma ɛ konni nɛn, ɛ nun muxu sariɲanxin nun muxu sariɲantarene. E birin lan nɛn e xa a don alo ɛ xɛnla nun bolen donma kii naxan yi. <verse eid="DEU 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 15:23"/>Koni ɛ nama suben wunla don de! Ɛ xa a rabɔxɔn alo igena.<verse eid="DEU 15:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="DEU 16"/>
  <para style="s">Halagi Tiin Dangu Lɔxɔn Sanla</para>
  <para style="r">Xɔrɔyaan 12.14-20 nun Saraxaraline 23.4-8 nun Yatɛne 28.16-25</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 16:1"/>Abiba kiken na, ɛ xa Halagi Tiin Dangu Lɔxɔn Sanla raba Alatala ɛ Ala binya feen na, bayo Alatala, ɛ Ala ɛ ramini na kiken nan na Misiran yi kɔɛɛn na. <verse eid="DEU 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 16:2"/>Ɛ xa yɛxɛɛn hanma siin hanma ɲingen ba saraxan na Alatala ɛ Ala xa Halagi Tiin Dangu Lɔxɔn Sali lɔxɔni. Ɛ na saraxan bama Alatalaa yire sugandixini a xinla binyama dɛnaxan yi. <verse eid="DEU 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 16:3"/>Sali lɔxɔni, ɛ nama burun don buru rate seen<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">16.3</char> <char style="fk">burun nate sena:</char> Lɛbɛnna na a ra naxan burun nagboma ayi. </note> saxi naxan yi. Ɛ xa buru ratetaren don xii solofere naxan findixi sunun taxamaseri burun na. Na nan a rabirama ɛ ma a ɛ mafuraxin nan keli Misiran yi. Na ma, ɛ mi ɲinanɲɛ ɛ mini lɔxɔn xɔn ɛ siin birin yi Misiran bɔxɔni. <verse eid="DEU 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 16:4"/>Na xii soloferen bun, a mi lan buru ratese yo xa to ɛ konne yi, ɛ bɔxɔn birin yi. Ɛ saraxan naxan bama xii singe lɔxɔn ɲinbanna ra, na sese nama lu han xɔtɔnni. <verse eid="DEU 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 16:5"/>Na Halagi Tiin Dangu Lɔxɔn Sanla saraxan mi lan a xa ba yiren birin yi, Alatala ɛ Ala naxan fima ɛ ma. <verse eid="DEU 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 16:6"/>Ɛ a bama yire keden peen nin, Alatala ɛ Ala na dɛnaxan sugandi a xinla binyama dɛnaxan yi. Na saraxan bama ɲinbanna nan na sogen godo waxatini, ɛ mini waxatin naxan yi Misiran yi. <verse eid="DEU 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 16:7"/>Ɛ suben ɲinma nɛn, ɛ yi a don na yireni Alatala ɛ Ala dɛnaxan sugandima. Na kuye yibani, ɛ yi siga ɛ konne yi. <verse eid="DEU 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 16:8"/>Ɛ xa buru ratetaren don xii sennin. A xii soloferede lɔxɔni, ɛ malanna ti Alatala ɛ Ala xa. Ɛ nama wali yo kɛ na lɔxɔni.<verse eid="DEU 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Xunsagine sanla</para>
  <para style="r">Saraxaraline 23.15-22 nun Yatɛne 28.26-31</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 16:9"/>Ɛ na murutu xaban fɔlɔ, ɛ xa xunsagi solofere tɛngɛ, <verse eid="DEU 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 16:10"/>ɛ yi Xunsagine Sanla raba Alatala ɛ Ala xa. Ɛ yi ɲɛnige ma saraxan ba naxan na lan hɛrisigɛn yatɛn ma Alatala ɛ Ala naxan fixi ɛ ma. <verse eid="DEU 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 16:11"/>Ɛ sɛwama nɛn Alatala ɛ Ala ra na yireni a dɛnaxan sugandima a xinla binyan dɛnaxan yi, ɛ tan nun ɛ diine nun ɛ konyine, e nun Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxun naxanye ɛ konni e nun xɔɲɛne nun kiridine nun kaɲa gilɛne. <verse eid="DEU 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 16:12"/>Ɛ nama ɲinan a konyine nan yi ɛ ra Misiran yi. Ɛ xa yamarini itoe suxu ki faɲi.<verse eid="DEU 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bubu Kui Sanla</para>
  <para style="r">Saraxaraline 23.33-43 nun Yatɛne 29.12-39</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 16:13"/>Ɛ na yelin ɛ sansine bɔnbɔdeni lonne ma ɛ yi e malan, ɛ yi ɛ wudi bogi igene fan ba, ɛ xa Bubu Kui Sanla raba xii solofere. <verse eid="DEU 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 16:14"/>Ɛ xa sɛwa na sanli, ɛ tan nun ɛ diine nun ɛ konyine nun Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune nun xɔɲɛne nun kiridine nun kaɲa gilɛn naxanye ɛ konni. <verse eid="DEU 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 16:15"/>Ɛ sanli ito rabama nɛn xii solofere Alatala ɛ Ala xa, a na dɛnaxan sugandi. Amasɔtɔ Alatala ɛ Ala barakan sama nɛn ɛ se xaban nun ɛ wanla birin yi. Ɛ yi sɛwa han!<verse eid="DEU 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 16:16"/>Ɲɛɛ yo ɲɛɛ, Isirayila xɛmɛne birin xa ti Alatala ɛ Ala yɛtagi sanɲa ma saxan a na dɛnaxan sugandi: Buru Tetaren Sanla nun Xunsagine sanla nun Bubu Kui Sanla. Ɛ mi lan ɛ xa siga Alatala yɛtagi ɛ yii genla ra. <verse eid="DEU 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 16:17"/>Ɛ birin xa fa a kiseen na ɛ nɔɛ naxan na, naxan na lan hɛrisigɛn ma Alatala ɛ Ala naxan fixi ɛ ma.<verse eid="DEU 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sariyan sa kiina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 16:18"/>Taane birin kui, Alatala ɛ Ala dɛnaxan fima ɛ ma, bɔnsɔn yo bɔnsɔn, ɛ xa kitisane sugandi, e yamaan makiti tinxinni. <verse eid="DEU 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 16:19"/>Ɛ nama kitin sa tɔɲɛgɛni de! Ɛ mɔn nama muxune rafisa e bode xa. Ɛ nama dimi yi seene rasuxu mayifuni, bayo kiseene nɔɛ fe kolonna yɛɛne raxiyɛ nɛn, a tinxin muxuna falane yifu. <verse eid="DEU 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 16:20"/>Ɛ lu tinxinna fɔxɔ ra, alogo ɛ xa siimaya faɲin sɔtɔ, ɛ mɔn yi nɔ bɔxɔn sɔtɛ Alatala ɛ Ala dɛnaxan fima ɛ ma.<verse eid="DEU 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Suxure batuna fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 16:21"/>Ɛ nama Asera kide gbindonna ti saraxa ganden dɛxɔn ma, ɛ naxan nafala Alatala ɛ Ala xa. <verse eid="DEU 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 16:22"/>Ɛ nama suxure gɛmɛn ti, bayo Alatala ɛ Ala na fe sifan naɲaxuxi.<verse eid="DEU 16:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="DEU 17"/>
  <para style="s">Sariyana saraxana fe yi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 17:1"/>Ɛ nama ɲingen hanma yɛxɛɛn ba saraxan na Alatala ɛ Ala xa, fɛ naxan na, hanma naxan madɔnxi, bayo Alatala ɛ Ala na fe sifan naɲaxuxi.<verse eid="DEU 17:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 17:2"/>Xa xɛmɛna nde hanma ɲaxanla nde dɔxi ɛ taana nde yi Alatala ɛ Ala naxan fima ɛ ma, a fa fe ɲaxin liga naxan mi rafan Alatala ɛ Ala ma, nayi, a bata Alaa layirin matandi. <verse eid="DEU 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 17:3"/>Xa a mi n ma yamarin suxu, a ala gbɛtɛne batu, hanma sogena hanma kikena hanma sarene, <verse eid="DEU 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 17:4"/>ɛ yi na mɛ, ɛ xa a feen xɔnfen ki faɲi. Ɛ na a kolon na fe ɲaxin bata liga Isirayila yi, <verse eid="DEU 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 17:5"/>a na findi xɛmɛn na hanma ɲaxanla, ɛ xa na kanna xali taan so dɛɛn na, ɛ yi a magɔlɔn han a faxa.<verse eid="DEU 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 17:6"/>Muxun naxan lan a xa faxa, a mi faxɛ singen fɔ muxu firin hanma saxan na sereyaan ba. A mi lan a xa faxa sereya kedenna gbansanna xuiin ma. <verse eid="DEU 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 17:7"/>Naxanye sereyaan baxi, ne nan singe xa gɛmɛn woli a ma a faxa feen na. Yama dɔnxɛn fan yi a magɔlɔn. Ɛ fe ɲaxin ɲanma ɛ tagi na kiini nɛn.<verse eid="DEU 17:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kitine fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 17:8"/>Xa faxa kitin bata fa hanma matandina hanma maxɔlɔna naxan findixi kiti xɔdɛxɛn na ɛ taani, ɛ xa siga na yireni Alatala ɛ Ala dɛnaxan sugandima. <verse eid="DEU 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 17:9"/>Ɛ sigama Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune nan fɛma, saraxaraline, e nun kitisaan naxan dɔxi na waxatini, ɛ a yɛba e xa. Nayi, e a falama nɛn ɛ xa, a lan kitin xa sa kii naxan yi. <verse eid="DEU 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 17:10"/>E na naxan fala ɛ xa na yireni Alatala ɛ Ala dɛnaxan sugandima, ɛ kitin bolonma na nan ma. E na naxan fala ɛ xa, ɛ xa na suxu ki faɲi. <verse eid="DEU 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 17:11"/>E na sariyan naxan birin fala ɛ xa, ɛ xa na liga. Ɛ nama fata a ma yiifanna ma, hanma kɔmɛnna ma. <verse eid="DEU 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 17:12"/>Xa muxuna nde waso, a mi a tuli mati saraxaraliin na naxan bata dɔxɔ Alatala ɛ Alaa wanla xun na hanma kitisana, na kanna lanma nɛn a xa faxa. Ɛ fe ɲaxin ɲanma na kii nin Isirayila yi. <verse eid="DEU 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 17:13"/>Yamaan na na feen mɛ, e gaxuma nɛn e wason yiba.<verse eid="DEU 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mangayana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 17:14"/>Ɛ na so bɔxɔni waxatin naxan yi, Alatala ɛ Ala dɛnaxan fima ɛ ma, ɛ na dɔxɔ na, yanyina nde ɛ a mirima nɛn, a ɛ fan xa ɛ gbee mangan sɔtɔ alo ɛ rabilinna siyane. <verse eid="DEU 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 17:15"/>Alatala ɛ Ala na muxun naxan sugandi, na nan findima ɛ mangan na. Ɛ nama tin xɔɲɛn xa findi ɛ mangan na, naxan mi findixi ɛ ngaxakeden Isirayila kaana nde ra. <verse eid="DEU 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 17:16"/>A mi lan ɛ mangan xa soo wuyaxi sɔtɔ. A mi lan a xa muxune rasiga Misiran yi soone saradeni, bayo Alatala a falaxi nɛn ɛ xa, a ɛ nama siga na bɔxɔni sɔnɔn. <verse eid="DEU 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 17:17"/>A mi lan a yi ɲaxalan wuyaxi dɔxɔ. Na feene nan a bɔɲɛn naxɛtɛma Ala fɔxɔ ra. A mi lan a yi gbeti gbeen nun xɛma wuyaxi sɔtɔ. <verse eid="DEU 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 17:18"/>Mangan na dɔxɔ a manga gbɛdɛni waxatin naxan yi, sariya kitabun naxan namaraxi Lewine yii, saraxaraline, a xa na sɛbɛ a yɛtɛ xa. <verse eid="DEU 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 17:19"/>Na kitabun luma nɛn a dɛxɔn. A xa a xaran lɔxɔn birin a siimayani, alogo a xa gaxu Alatala a Ala yɛɛ ra, a mɔn yi nɔ a sariyan nun a tɔnne suxudeni naxanye sɛbɛxi a kui. <verse eid="DEU 17:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 17:20"/>Na nan a ligama, a mi a yɛtɛ rafisama a ngaxakedenne xa, a fata sariyan ma yiifanna ma hanma kɔmɛnna ma. Nayi, a mangaya xunkuyen sɔtɔma nɛn, a tan nun a diine Isirayila yamaan tagi.<verse eid="DEU 17:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="DEU 18"/>
  <para style="s">Saraxaraline wanla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 18:1"/>Saraxaraline, Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune, ne mi bɔxɔ yitaxun daxin sɔtɔma e kɛɛn na alo Isirayila muxu gbɛtɛye. E baloma saraxane nan na naxan nalima Alatala ma tɛɛn na. Na nan findixi e kɛɛn na. <verse eid="DEU 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 18:2"/>E mi kɛɛ sɔtɔma e ngaxakedenne tagi. Alatala nan findima e kɛɛn na alo a a fala e xa kii naxan yi. <verse eid="DEU 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 18:3"/>Isirayila kaane na fa ɲingen na hanma yɛxɛɛna saraxa badeni, ito nan findima Lewi kaa saraxaraline gbeen na: suben balaxana, a gbɛgbɛna, e nun a buru subene. <verse eid="DEU 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 18:4"/>Ɛ mɔn xa ɛ bogise singe saraxane so e yii: murutuna, manpa nɛnɛna, turena, e nun ɛ yɛxɛɛ xaben naxan singe maxabaxi. <verse eid="DEU 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 18:5"/>Alatala ɛ Ala Lewi bɔnsɔnna nan sugandixi bɔnsɔnna birin tagi alogo e tan nun e diine xa wali Alatala xinla binyadeni waxatin birin.<verse eid="DEU 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 18:6"/>Xa Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxuna nde keli Isirayila taana nde yi a dɔxi dɛnaxan yi, a siga na yireni Alatala dɛnaxan sugandima, <verse eid="DEU 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 18:7"/>mɛnni, a lanma a xa wali Alatala a Ala xinla a fe ra, a ngaxakeden Lewine dɛxɔn naxanye walima Alatala yɛtagi. <verse eid="DEU 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 18:8"/>A lan nɛn a yi balon sɔtɔ alo saraxaraliin bonne, hali a to a yii seene matixi, a gbeti sɔtɔ.<verse eid="DEU 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yiimatone nun kɔɛramuxune fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 18:9"/>Ɛ na so bɔxɔni Alatala ɛ Ala dɛnaxan fima ɛ ma, ɛ nama so kɛwali xɔsixine yi mɛn kaane naxanye ligama. <verse eid="DEU 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 18:10"/>Muxun nama lu ɛ yɛ naxan a diin ganma saraxan na hanma yiimatona hanma koron bɔnbɔna hanma seri kanna hanma kɔɛramuxuna, <verse eid="DEU 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 18:11"/>hanma tirin tiina hanma naxan barinne maxɔdinma hanma ɲinan kanne, hanma barin kiine. <verse eid="DEU 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 18:12"/>Na muxu sifan mi rafan Alatala ɛ Ala ma. Alatala ɛ Ala siyani itoe kedima nɛn ɛ yɛɛ ra na kɛwali xɔsixine fe ra. <verse eid="DEU 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 18:13"/>Ɛ kɛwanle xa kamali Alatala ɛ Ala yɛɛ ra yi. <verse eid="DEU 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 18:14"/>Ɛ siyaan naxanye kedima, ne biraxi yiimatoon nun koron bɔnbɔn xuiin nan fɔxɔ ra, koni Alatala ɛ Ala mi tinɲɛ ɛ tan yi na liga.<verse eid="DEU 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ala nabine rafama nɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 18:15"/>Alatala ɛ Ala nabina nde raminima nɛn ɛ yɛ naxan luma alo n tan. Ɛ xa ɛ tuli mati a ra. <verse eid="DEU 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 18:16"/>Ɛ naxan maxɔdin Alatala ɛ Ala ma, ɛ yi malanxi lɔxɔn naxan yi Horebe geyaan fari. Ɛ yi a fala, ɛ naxa, “N mi waxi Alatala n ma Ala xuiin namɛ feni sɔnɔn. N mi waxi tɛɛ gbeeni ito fan to feni sɔnɔn alogo n nama faxa.” <verse eid="DEU 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 18:17"/>Alatala yi a fala n xa, a naxa, “E naxan falaxi, na fan. <verse eid="DEU 18:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 18:18"/>N nabiin naminima nɛn e yɛ, naxan luxi alo i tan. N nan n ma falan nalima a ma nɛn, a yi na yɛba e xa, n na a yamarin naxan na. <verse eid="DEU 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 18:19"/>Xa muxu yo mi a tuli mati falan na nabiin naxan nalima n xinli, n tan yɛtɛɛn na kanna makitima nɛn. <verse eid="DEU 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 18:20"/>Koni xa nabina nde susu, a falan ti n xinli, n mi naxan yamarixi a ma, hanma a yi falan ti ala gbɛtɛye xinli, ɛ xa na kanna faxa.” <verse eid="DEU 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 18:21"/>Yanyina nde, ɛ ɛ yɛtɛ maxɔdinma nɛn, ɛ naxa, “En nɔɛ a kolonɲɛ di, a Alatala a falan mi a ra?” <verse eid="DEU 18:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 18:22"/>Xa nabiin falan ti Alatala xinli, a falan mi kamali, Alatala mi na falaxi. Nabiin nan na falaxi a wasoni. Hali ɛ mi gaxu a yɛɛ ra.<verse eid="DEU 18:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="DEU 19"/>
  <para style="s">Marakisi taane</para>
  <para style="r">Yatɛne 35.6-34 nun Sariyane 4.40-43 nun Yosuwe 20.1-9</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 19:1"/>Alatala ɛ Ala na siyane halagi, a naxanye bɔxɔn soma ɛ yii, ɛ e kedima nɛn, ɛ yi dɔxɔ e taane nun e banxine kui. <verse eid="DEU 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 19:2"/>Na na dangu, ɛ xa taa saxan sugandi bɔxɔni, Alatala ɛ Ala naxan fi ɛ ma. <verse eid="DEU 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 19:3"/>Ɛ xa kirane rafala siga mɛnne yi, ɛ yi yamanani taxun dɔxɔde saxan, Alatala ɛ Ala naxan fima ɛ ma ɛ kɛɛn na, alogo, faxa tiine birin xa siga na taane yi, e niin yi rakisi. <verse eid="DEU 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 19:4"/>Naxan na faxan ti, a li, a mi a rakelixi a ma, a mi a yitɔnxi xɔnnantenyani, na kanna nɔɛ sigɛ nɛn na taana nde yi, a niin yi ratanga. Misaala ra, muxun naxan siga fɔtɔnni wudi sɛgɛdeni e nun a lanfana, <verse eid="DEU 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 19:5"/>a wudin sɛgɛma, bunbin yi koren, a yi a lanfaan li, na yi faxa. Na faxa tiin sifan nɔɛ luyɛ nɛn na taana nde yi alogo a niin xa rakisi. <verse eid="DEU 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 19:6"/>Xa kirani kuya, faxa muxun gbeeɲɔxɔ muxun faxa tiin sagatanma nɛn a xɔlɔni han a yi a li, a yi a faxa, hali a mi yi lan a yi faxa bayo a mi a lanfaan faxa feni tɔnxi xɔnnantenyani. <verse eid="DEU 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 19:7"/>N yamarini ito fixi ɛ ma na nan ma. Ɛ xa taa saxan sugandi marakisi taane ra. <verse eid="DEU 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 19:8"/>Xa Alatala ɛ Ala ɛ bɔxɔn nagbo ayi alo a a kɔlɔ ɛ benbane xa kii naxan yi, xa a bɔxɔni ito birin so ɛ yii a ɛ benbane tuli sa naxan na, <verse eid="DEU 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 19:9"/>xa ɛ yamarini itoe birin suxu a faɲin na, n naxanye falama ɛ xa to, a ɛ xa Alatala ɛ Ala xanu, ɛ yi bira a kirane fɔxɔ ra, nayi ɛ mɔn xa taa saxan sugandi, ɛ yi e sa taa saxanna bonne fari. <verse eid="DEU 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 19:10"/>Nayi, Alatala ɛ Ala dɛnaxan fima ɛ ma ɛ kɛɛn na, ɛ mi tɔɲɛgɛtɔɔn faxɛ na bɔxɔni.<verse eid="DEU 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 19:11"/>Koni xa muxuna nde a boden naɲaxuxi, a a mɛlɛn, a yi a faxa, xa na kanna siga na taana nde yi, <verse eid="DEU 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 19:12"/>na taan fonne lan nɛn e xa a suxu, e yi a xali faxa muxun gbeeɲɔxɔ muxun fɛma alogo a xa a faxa. <verse eid="DEU 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 19:13"/>Ɛ nama kininkinin na kanna ma de! Ɛ xa na faxa ti sifan ɲan Isirayila bɔxɔni, ɛ yi hɛrin sɔtɔ.<verse eid="DEU 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bɔxɔne danne nun wule sereyane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 19:14"/>Ɛ na dɔxɔ bɔxɔni Alatala ɛ Ala naxan fima ɛ ma ɛ kɛɛn na, ɛ nama ɛ lanfana bɔxɔn danna taxamasenne masiga ɛ benbane naxanye dɔxɔ. <verse eid="DEU 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 19:15"/>Muxun naxan bata hakɛn liga hanma gbalona hanma yulubina, na kanna mi lan a xa kiti muxu kedenna sereya baxin xɔn. Na fe sifan makitima sereya firin hanma saxan fala xuiin nan xɔn.<verse eid="DEU 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 19:16"/>Xa sere ɲaxin sereyaan ba, a yi muxun tɔɲɛgɛ gbalona nde a fe ma, <verse eid="DEU 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 19:17"/>yɛngɛ fa firinni itoe lan nɛn e xa siga Alatala batu yireni saraxaraline nun kitisane fɛma naxanye walima na waxatini. <verse eid="DEU 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 19:18"/>Kitisane a feen fɛsɛfɛsɛma nɛn. E na a kolon a seren bata wule sereyaan ba, a a ngaxakedenna tɔɲɛgɛ, <verse eid="DEU 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 19:19"/>nayi ɛ xa a liga na kanna ra alo a tan yi a ligama a ngaxakedenna ra kii naxan yi nun. Ɛ xa fe ɲaxin ɲan ɛ tagi. <verse eid="DEU 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 19:20"/>Muxu gbɛtɛne na feen mɛma nɛn, e yi gaxu. Nayi, e mi fa susuɛ na fe ɲaxin sifan ligadeni sɔnɔn. <verse eid="DEU 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 19:21"/>Ɛ nama kininkinin na muxu sifan ma: Niin ɲɔxɔn xa fi niin na, yɛɛn yi ɲɔxɔ yɛɛn na, ɲinna yi ɲɔxɔ ɲinna ra, yiin yi ɲɔxɔ yiin na, sanna yi ɲɔxɔ sanna ra.<verse eid="DEU 19:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="DEU 20"/>
  <para style="s">Yɛngɛn sariyana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 20:1"/>Ɛ na siga ɛ yaxune yɛngɛdeni, ɛ na soo wuyaxi to e nun yɛngɛso seene nun sofa wuyaxi naxanye wuya dangu ɛ ra, hali ɛ mi gaxu. Alatala ɛ Ala naxan ɛ raminixi Misiran bɔxɔni, na luma nɛn ɛ xɔn. <verse eid="DEU 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 20:2"/>Ɛ nɛma ɛ yitɔnma waxatin naxan yi yɛngɛ so xinla ma, saraxaraliin xa ti, a falan ti yamaan xa, a naxa, <verse eid="DEU 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 20:3"/>“Isirayila kaane, ɛ tuli mati! To, ɛ sigama ɛ yaxune nan yɛngɛdeyi. Ɛ nama tunnaxɔlɔ ɛ ma, ɛ nama gaxu, ɛ nama kuisan, ɛ bɔɲɛn nama mini, <verse eid="DEU 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 20:4"/>bayo Alatala ɛ Ala luma nɛn ɛ xɔn ɛ yaxune yɛngɛdeni. A e yɛngɛma nɛn ɛ xa, a yi ɛ rakisi.”<verse eid="DEU 20:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 20:5"/>Na waxatini sofa kuntigine fan falan tima nɛn ganla xa. E naxa, “Muxuna nde ɛ yɛ be ba, naxan bata yelin banxi tideni koni a munma so a kui singen? Na kanna xa xɛtɛ a konni, xa na mi a ra waxatina nde a nɔɛ faxɛ nɛn, muxu gbɛtɛ yi so a banxini. <verse eid="DEU 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 20:6"/>Muxuna nde ɛ yɛ be ba, naxan bata manpa binle si, koni a munma e bogine bolon singen? Na kanna xa xɛtɛ a konni, xa na mi a ra waxatina nde a nɔɛ faxɛ nɛn, muxu gbɛtɛ yi a tɔnɔn sɔtɔ. <verse eid="DEU 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 20:7"/>Muxuna nde ɛ yɛ be ba, naxan bata ɲaxalandina nde masuxu, koni ɲaxanla munma siga a konni singen? Na kanna xa xɛtɛ a konni, xa na mi a ra waxatina nde a nɔɛ faxɛ nɛn yɛngɛni, muxu gbɛtɛ yi a ɲaxanla dɔxɔ.” <verse eid="DEU 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 20:8"/>Sofa kuntigine mɔn sofane maxɔdinma nɛn, e naxa, “Muxuna nde ɛ yɛ be ba, naxan mi fa susuɛ, a gaxuxi? Na kanna xa xɛtɛ a konni alogo a lanfane fan nama tunnaxɔlɔ e ma.” <verse eid="DEU 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 20:9"/>Sofa kuntigini itoe na yelin falan tiyɛ yamaan xa, e yi sofana ndee findi gali mangane ra.<verse eid="DEU 20:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 20:10"/>Ɛ na siga taana nde yi yɛngɛ sodeni, ɛ xa mɛn kaane maxɔdin singen, a e xa e yɛtɛ raxɛtɛ ɛ ma. <verse eid="DEU 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 20:11"/>Xa e tin na ma, e yi taan nabilin yinna rabi ɛ xa, e birin luma nɛn ɛ yamarin bun, e yi mudun fi. <verse eid="DEU 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 20:12"/>Koni xa e mi tin na ma, e yi ɛ yɛngɛ, nayi ɛ xa na taan bilin. <verse eid="DEU 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 20:13"/>Alatala ɛ Ala na taan soma nɛn ɛ yii, ɛ xɛmɛne birin faxa silanfanna ra. <verse eid="DEU 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 20:14"/>Koni ɲaxanle nun diine nun xuruseene nun nafunla naxanye birin na taan kui, ne birin findima nɛn ɛ gbeen na. Ɛ yi ɛ yaxune hɛrisigɛn birin don, Alatala ɛ Ala naxan fixi ɛ ma.<verse eid="DEU 20:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 20:15"/>Ɛ na nan ligama taane ra naxanye makuya, naxanye mi na taane yɛ ɛ dɔxɔma naxanye yi. <verse eid="DEU 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 20:16"/>Koni a na findi taane ra Alatala ɛ Ala dɛnaxanye fima ɛ ma ɛ kɛɛn na, ɛ mi sese luma a nii ra mɛnni. <verse eid="DEU 20:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 20:17"/>Ɛ Xitine nun Amorine nun Kanan kaane nun Perisine nun Xiwine nun Yebusune birin halagima nɛn alo Alatala ɛ Ala a yamarixi ɛ ma kii naxan yi, <verse eid="DEU 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 20:18"/>alogo e nama ɛ xaran na fe ɲaxine ma e naxanye ligama e suxure batudeni. Ɛ yi Alatala ɛ Ala yulubin tongo.<verse eid="DEU 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 20:19"/>Xa ɛ bata taana nde bilin mɛn kaane yɛngɛ xinla ma, ɛ mi lan ɛ yi na wudine sɛgɛ naxanye bogima. E bogine findima ɛ balon nan na. Na wudi sixine mi findixi ɛ yɛngɛfane ra. <verse eid="DEU 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 20:20"/>Koni wudi binla naxanye bogin mi donma, ɛ nɔɛ ne sɛgɛ nɛn alogo e xa findi yɛngɛso seene ra ɛ xa, ɛ ne rawali na taan yɛngɛdeni han ɛ yi a masɔtɔ.<verse eid="DEU 20:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="DEU 21"/>
  <para style="s">Faxan naxan kari mi kolonxi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 21:1"/>Ɛ na so bɔxɔni Alatala ɛ Ala dɛnaxan fima ɛ ma, xa ɛ muxu faxaxina nde to burunna ra, a a li a faxa muxun mi kolonxi, <verse eid="DEU 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 21:2"/>ɛ fonne nun ɛ kitisane sigama nɛn. Keli binbin yireni han taan naxanye mɛnna rabilinni, e ne yikuyene maliga. <verse eid="DEU 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 21:3"/>E na a kolon taan naxan maso na ra, na taan fonne ɲinge gilɛn nan tongoma naxan munma wali, xun xidi yegen munma xidi naxan xunna ma. <verse eid="DEU 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 21:4"/>Na taan fonne ɲinge gilɛn xalima nɛn xudeni naxan mi xɔrima, sansiin munma rawali dɛnaxan yi. E yi a kɔɛɛn gira mɛnni, a faxa. <verse eid="DEU 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 21:5"/>Lewi yixɛtɛne, saraxaraline fan fama nɛn, bayo Alatala ɛ Ala ne nan sugandixi a e xa wali a xa, e mɔn yi dubane ti Alatala xinli, e mɔn yi matandi feene nun muxu maxɔlɔne makiti. <verse eid="DEU 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 21:6"/>Taan naxan maso binbin yiren na, na fonne xa e yiine raxa ɲinge gilɛn xun ma, e naxan faxaxi xudeni. <verse eid="DEU 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 21:7"/>E yi a fala, e naxa, “Nxu tan xa mi faxan tixi, nxu mi a toxi ligɛ. <verse eid="DEU 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 21:8"/>Alatala, i xa ito rasuxu i solona seen na Isirayila yamaan xa, i naxan xunbaxi. Yandi, i nama i ya yamaan yatɛ sɔnmane ra na faxa tixina fe yi.” Nayi, Alatala na solona seen nasuxuma nɛn faxa tixina fe yi. <verse eid="DEU 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 21:9"/>Ɛ na yulubi tongoxin bama yamaan ma, bayo ɛ bata na feen liga naxan tinxin Alatala yɛɛ ra yi.<verse eid="DEU 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Muxu suxine yɛngɛni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 21:10"/>Ɛ na siga ɛ yaxune yɛngɛdeni, xa Alatala ɛ Ala e sa ɛ sagoni, ɛ yi e findi ɛ muxu suxine ra, <verse eid="DEU 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 21:11"/>yanyina nde muxuna nde a yɛɛn tima nɛn suxu muxu ɲaxalan tofaɲina nde ra. Xa na kanna wama a dɔxɔ feni a ɲaxanla ra, <verse eid="DEU 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 21:12"/>nayi a nɔɛ a xalɛ nɛn a konni. Na ɲaxanla a xunna bima nɛn, a yi a yii xanle fan maxaba, <verse eid="DEU 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 21:13"/>a yi a domaan fan masara. A luma nɛn banxin kui, a yi a fafe nun a nga ɲan feen liga kike keden. Na xanbi ra, xɛmɛn nɔɛ a findɛ a gbeen na nɛn, a findi a ɲaxanla ra. <verse eid="DEU 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 21:14"/>Xa a fe raɲaxu xɛmɛn ma, a nɔɛ a beɲinɲɛ nɛn, a siga dɛnaxan na a kɛnɛn. A mi lan sɔnɔn a xa a mati gbetin na, a mɔn mi nɔɛ a findɛ a konyin na sɔnɔn bayo a bata yi a kolon a ɲaxanla ra.<verse eid="DEU 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Dii forimaan tidena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 21:15"/>Xa ɲaxalan firin xɛmɛna nde yii, keden yi rafan a ma dangu boden na, na ɲaxalan firinne yi dii xɛmɛn keden keden bari, koni dii singen yi findi ɲaxanla diin na naxan mi rafan xɛmɛn ma, <verse eid="DEU 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 21:16"/>a na wa a kɛɛni taxun feni a diine ra, diin forimaan lan a xa kɛɛn naxan sɔtɔ, a mi lan xɛmɛn xa na so a batɛna diin yii, a dii singen yi fula a tiden na. <verse eid="DEU 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 21:17"/>A xa a kolon ɲaxanla naxan naɲaxuxi a ma, na nan ma dii findixi a dii singen na. A hɛrisigɛn dɔxɔde firin nan soma dii forimaan yii, bayo na nan singen xɛmɛn sɛnbɛn yitaxi. A tan nan lan a dii forimaan tiden sɔtɔ.<verse eid="DEU 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Dii murutɛxina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 21:18"/>Xa xɛmɛna nde dii xɛmɛ xalabanten murutɛxin sɔtɔ, a yi a li a mi a tuli matima a fafe nun a nga xuiin na, e bata kata e xa a xuru koni a mi e xuiin suxi, <verse eid="DEU 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 21:19"/>a fafe nun a nga xa a suxu, e yi a xali taan fonne fɛma taan so dɛɛn na. <verse eid="DEU 21:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 21:20"/>E yi a fala e xa, e naxa, “Nxɔ diini i ra, a xalabanten, a mɔn murutɛxi. A mi nxu xuiin suxuma. Sabaan nun dɔlɔn nan nafan a ma.” <verse eid="DEU 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 21:21"/>Nayi, taan xɛmɛne birin a magɔlɔnma nɛn han a faxa. Ɛ xa fe ɲaxin ɲan ɛ tagi. Isirayila kaane na feen mɛma nɛn, e gaxu.<verse eid="DEU 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Muxu binbin singanxina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 21:22"/>Xa ɛ muxun faxa, naxan bata gbalo feen liga, a lan a xa faxa naxan ma, ɛ mɔn yi a binbin singan wudin na, <verse eid="DEU 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 21:23"/>a binbin mi lan a xa xi singanxi han xɔtɔnni. A lan nɛn a xa maluxun na lɔxɔni, bayo Ala bata na muxu singanxin danga. Ɛ nama na binbi singanxina dangan lu yamanani, Alatala ɛ Ala dɛnaxan fima ɛ ma ɛ kɛɛn na.<verse eid="DEU 21:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="DEU 22"/>
  <para style="s">I muxu boden yii seene masuxu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 22:1"/>Ɛ na ɛ ngaxakedenna ɲingen hanma a yɛxɛɛn to, a sigama burunna xun xɔn, ɛ nama ɛ xun xanbi so a yi. Ɛ lan nɛn ɛ xa a xali a kanna fɛma. <verse eid="DEU 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 22:2"/>Xa ɛ ngaxakedenna konna makuya, hanma ɛ mi a yire kolon, ɛ xa xuruseen xali ɛ konni. Ɛ yi a ramara han ɛ a kanna to waxatin naxan yi, ɛ yi a so a yii. <verse eid="DEU 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 22:3"/>Ɛ na nan ligama a sofanla fan na, a domana, e nun a seen naxan birin lɔxi ayi. Ɛ mi lan ɛ xa ɛ xun xanbi so ne yi. <verse eid="DEU 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 22:4"/>Xa ɛ ngaxakedenna sofanla hanma a ɲingen to biraxi kiraan xɔn, ɛ nama ɛ xun xanbi so a yi. Ɛ lan nɛn, ɛ xa a mali a rakelɛ.<verse eid="DEU 22:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Xɛmɛn nun ɲaxalan domane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 22:5"/>Ɲaxanla mi lan a yi xɛmɛ domaan nagodo a ma. Xɛmɛn fan mi lan a ɲaxalan domaan nagodo a ma. Muxun naxanye na fe sifan ligama, na kanne mi rafan Alatala ɛ Ala ma.<verse eid="DEU 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Daliseen masuxu kiina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 22:6"/>Ɛ na a to kiraan xɔn ma, xɔliin bata a tɛɛn sa wudin kɔɛ ra, xa na mi a ra bɔxɔn ma, a nga felenxi a xɛlɛne ma, xa na mi a ra a diine ma, ɛ mi lan ɛ xa a nga nun a diine tongo e bode xɔn. <verse eid="DEU 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 22:7"/>Ɛ xa a nga beɲin, a xa siga. Ɛ yi a diine tan tongo. Nayi, ɛ siimaya xunkuyen nun hɛrin sɔtɔma nɛn.<verse eid="DEU 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Muxune xa ratanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 22:8"/>Xa i banxi nɛnɛn ti, i yi foye suxudeni tɔn banxin kɔɛ ra alo kore banxina, i xa a rabilin sansandin na alogo muxuna nde nama bira lɔxɔna nde, a faxa, fata i ya banxin ti kiin na.<verse eid="DEU 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fe yibasanna fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 22:9"/>I nama sansi siya firinna si i ya manpa bili nakɔni, xa na mi a ra a bogin findima se haramuxin nan na. <verse eid="DEU 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 22:10"/>I nama xun xidi yegen xidi ɲingen nun sofanla xunne ma e bode xɔn i yi xɛɛn bi. <verse eid="DEU 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 22:11"/>I nama domaan nagodo i ma naxan sɔxɔnxi yɛxɛɛ xabe garin nun gɛsɛ futu garin basanxin na.<verse eid="DEU 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gubana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 22:12"/>I xa luti dɛnbɛxine singan i ya gubaan tongon naaninne ra.<verse eid="DEU 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kiti xɔdɛxɛne ɲaxanla fe yi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 22:13"/>Xa xɛmɛna nde ɲaxanla dɔxɔ, e yi kafu, a feen yi raɲaxu xɛmɛn ma, <verse eid="DEU 22:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 22:14"/>a yi a xili kala fɔlɔ, a naxa, “N bata ɲaxanli ito dɔxɔ, koni nxu to kafu, n yi a li, a mi yi Alaa kiraan xɔn.” <verse eid="DEU 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 22:15"/>Na na liga, sungutunna fafe nun a nga sereya seen xalima nɛn taan fonne fɛma taan so dɛɛn na, naxan a yitama a sungutun nasɔlɔnxin nan yi a ra. <verse eid="DEU 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 22:16"/>A fafe ito nan falama, a naxa, “N bata n ma dii tɛmɛn fi xɛmɛni ito ma, koni a mi rafan a ma sɔnɔn. <verse eid="DEU 22:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 22:17"/>A bata wulen sa a xun ma, a sungutun nasɔlɔnxin mi yi a ra.” Sungutunna sɔtɔ muxune xa na futun nasɔnɔya sereya dugin sa taan fonne yɛtagi. <verse eid="DEU 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 22:18"/>Taan fonne na xɛmɛn suxuma nɛn, e yi a fe ɲaxin saran a ra. <verse eid="DEU 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 22:19"/>E na a makiti, e xa a yangin, a gbeti gbanan kɛmɛ so sungutunna fafe yii, bayo a bata Isirayila ɲaxanla nde xili kala. Na xanbi a lanma nɛn ɲaxanla mɔn xa xɛtɛ xɛmɛn konni. A nɛma a siimayani, a mi nɔɛ a mɛ na ɲaxanla ra.<verse eid="DEU 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 22:20"/>Koni, xa ɲɔndin nan na feen na, sereya se yo mi na naxan a yitama a bata futun nasɔnɔya, <verse eid="DEU 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 22:21"/>na ɲaxanla xalima nɛn a fafe a banxin dɛɛn na. Taa yi kaane yi a magɔlɔn han a faxa, bayo a bata yagi feen liga, ɲaxanla mi lan a xa naxan liga Isirayila bɔxɔni. A bata xɛmɛ feen kolon a a fafe konni waxatin naxan yi. Ɛ xa fe ɲaxin ɲan ɛ tagi.<verse eid="DEU 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 22:22"/>Xa ɛ xɛmɛn nun ɲaxanla suxu naxan findixi xɛmɛ gbɛtɛ a ɲaxanla ra, e saxi, na fe ɲaxi raba firinne lan nɛn e xa faxa, ɲaxanla nun xɛmɛna. Ɛ xa fe ɲaxin ɲan Isirayila bɔxɔni.<verse eid="DEU 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 22:23"/>Xa xɛmɛn naralan sungutunna nde ra taan kui, naxan bata masuxu, e yi kafu, <verse eid="DEU 22:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 22:24"/>ɛ xa na muxu firinne xali taan so dɛɛn na, ɛ yi e magɔlɔn han e faxa. Sungutunna faxama nɛn bayo a mi sɔnxɔn natexi taan kui. Xɛmɛn fan faxama nɛn bayo a bata ɲaxalan masuxin futun kala. Ɛ xa fe ɲaxin ɲan ɛ tagi.<verse eid="DEU 22:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 22:25"/>Koni xa xɛmɛn naralan sungutunna ra burunna ra, naxan bata masuxu, a yi fu a ma, na xɛmɛ nan gbansan faxama. <verse eid="DEU 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 22:26"/>Ɛ nama fefe liga sungutunna ra bayo a mi fe ɲaxi yo ligaxi a lan a xa faxa naxan ma. Na feen luxi nɛn alo xɛmɛn naxan fu a boden ma alogo a xa a faxa. <verse eid="DEU 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 22:27"/>Amasɔtɔ xɛmɛn naralanxi sungutunna ra burunna nan na. Hali sungutunna xɛmɛ kanni ito sɔnxɔn nate, muxu yo mi yi na naxan yi a ratangɛ.<verse eid="DEU 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 22:28"/>Xa xɛmɛn naralan sungutunna ra naxan munma masuxu, a yi fu a ma, muxuna nde yi e to na feen xun na, <verse eid="DEU 22:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 22:29"/>na xɛmɛn xa gbeti gbanan tonge suulun so sungutunna fafe yii, a yi sungutunna dɔxɔ a ɲaxanla ra, bayo a bata a futun kala. A nɛma a siimayani, a mi nɔɛ a mɛ na ɲaxanla ra.<verse eid="DEU 22:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="DEU 23"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 23:1"/>Xɛmɛn nun a fafe a ɲaxanla nama kafu, alogo a nama a fafe rayagi.<verse eid="DEU 23:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Muxun naxanye mi lan Alaa yamaan malanni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 23:2"/>Muxun naxan tɛgɛnxi, hanma a bari seen bolonxi, na kanna mi lan a siga Alatalaa yamaan malanni. <verse eid="DEU 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 23:3"/>Naxanye na kafu sariyatareyani, e diin bari, na diin fan mi daxa a siga Alatalaa yamaan malanni han a yixɛtɛ fudena.<verse eid="DEU 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 23:4"/>Amonine nun Moyaba kaane mi sigɛ Alatalaa yamaan malanni hali e yixɛtɛ fudena. <verse eid="DEU 23:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 23:5"/>A ligama na kiini habadan bayo siyani itoe mi faxi ɛ ralandeni burun nun igen na e yii, ɛ yi kelima Misiran yi waxatin naxan yi. E Beyori a dii Balami saren fi nɛn ɛ xili ma keli Petori taani Mesopotamiya yamanani alogo a xa ɛ danga. <verse eid="DEU 23:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 23:6"/>Koni Alatala ɛ Ala mi tin a tuli matiyɛ Balami ra. A bata dangan masara barakan na bayo ɛ rafan Alatala ɛ Ala ma. <verse eid="DEU 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 23:7"/>Ɛ nama e mali bɔɲɛ xunbenla nun hɛrin sɔtɔ feen na ɛ siin birin yi.<verse eid="DEU 23:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 23:8"/>Ɛ nama Edɔn kaane raɲaxu bayo ɛ ngaxakedenna nan e ra. Ɛ nama Misiran kaane raɲaxu bayo ɛ waxatina nde ti nɛn e bɔxɔni. <verse eid="DEU 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 23:9"/>E yixɛtɛ saxanden nɔɛ soɛ nɛn Alatalaa yamaan malanni.<verse eid="DEU 23:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Daaxaden sariɲanna fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 23:10"/>Ɛ na siga ɛ yaxune yɛngɛdeni, ɛ yi daaxa yirena nde yi, ɛ lan nɛn ɛ xa ɛ yɛtɛ ratanga fe ɲaxin birin ma. <verse eid="DEU 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 23:11"/>Xa xɛmɛna nde ɛ yɛ naxan mi sariɲanxi, igen bata mini a xɛmɛyani kɔɛɛn na, a xa mini daaxaden fari ma. <verse eid="DEU 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 23:12"/>Ɲinbanna ra, a xa a maxa. Sogen na godo waxatin naxan yi a nɔɛ soɛ nɛn daaxadeni.<verse eid="DEU 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 23:13"/>Ɛ xa yirena nde sugandi daaxaden fari ma, na yi findi xandaan na. <verse eid="DEU 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 23:14"/>Wali sena nde xa lu ɛ goronne yɛ, alogo ɛ na siga xandani, ɛ xa yinla ge, ɛ yi ɛ makoon naba, ɛ bɛndɛn naxɛtɛ a yɛ ma. <verse eid="DEU 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 23:15"/>Ɛ daaxaden lan nɛn a xa sariɲan, bayo Alatala ɛ Ala masiga tiden na a ra ɛ kantan feen na, a yi ɛ yaxune sa ɛ sagoni. Xa a fe ɲaxin li daaxadeni, a a makuyama ɛ ra nɛn.<verse eid="DEU 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Konyi sariyana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 23:16"/>Xa konyina nde a gi a kanna ma, a yi a yigiya ɛ konni, ɛ nama a xali a kanna fɛma de! <verse eid="DEU 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 23:17"/>A lan nɛn a xa dɔxɔ ɛ dɛxɔn taani, a na wa lu feni dɛnaxan yi. Ɛ nama ɲaxu a ra.<verse eid="DEU 23:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yalunyana fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 23:18"/>Isirayila xɛmɛna hanma ɲaxanla nama findi yalunden na. <verse eid="DEU 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 23:19"/>Yalunde gilɛn sarena, hanma yalunde xɛmɛn sarena, na mi lan a xa so Alatala ɛ Ala banxini ɛ dɛ xui yo rakamali feen na, bayo Alatala ɛ Ala na fe sifan naɲaxuxi.<verse eid="DEU 23:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Donla nun dɛ xuina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 23:20"/>Ɛ na sena nde doli ɛ ngaxakedenna ma, gbetina, donsena, xa na mi a ra se gbɛtɛ, ɛ nama tɔnɔ yo sa a fari. <verse eid="DEU 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 23:21"/>Ɛ nɔɛ tɔnɔn fenɲɛ nɛn xɔɲɛn na, koni ɛ ngaxakedenna tan mi a ra de. Ɛ xa na sariyan suxu ɛ bɔxɔni, ɛ dɛnaxan sɔtɔma, alogo Alatala ɛ Ala xa barakan sa ɛ kɛwanle birin yi.<verse eid="DEU 23:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 23:22"/>I na dɛ xuiin tongo Alatala i ya Ala xa, i nama i madigan a rakamali feen na, xanamu Alatala i ya Ala a maxɔdinma nɛn i ma, i yi findi yulubi tongon na. <verse eid="DEU 23:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 23:23"/>Xa i mi dɛ xui tongo, yulubi fe mi a ra. <verse eid="DEU 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 23:24"/>Koni xa i dɛ xuiin tongo Alatala i ya Ala xa, i lan nɛn i xa a rakamali ki faɲi alo i a ɲɛnige kii naxan yi.<verse eid="DEU 23:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 23:25"/>I nɔɛ manpa bogina nde bɛ nɛn i gbeen mi naxan na, i yi a don, han i lugo, koni i nama nde sa i ya goronni. <verse eid="DEU 23:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 23:26"/>I na so murutu xɛɛn na, i gbee mi naxan na, i nɔɛ tɔnsɔnna ndee bolonɲɛ nɛn i yiin na, koni i nama i ngaxakedenna a murutun xaba wɔlitɛn na.<verse eid="DEU 23:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="DEU 24"/>
  <para style="s">Futu kalana fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 24:1"/>Xa xɛmɛna nde ɲaxanla dɔxɔ, a fe yi raɲaxu a ma, nayi, a e futu kala kɛdin nan sɛbɛma, a a so a yii, a yi a rasiga a konni. <verse eid="DEU 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 24:2"/>Ɲaxanla to bata keli xɛmɛn konni, a nɔɛ dɔxɛ nɛn xɛmɛ gbɛtɛ xɔn. <verse eid="DEU 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 24:3"/>Xa a fe sa raɲaxu na xɛmɛn fan ma, a e taxun kɛdin sɛbɛ, a yi a so a yii, a yi a rasiga a konni, hanma xa na xɛmɛn sa faxa, <verse eid="DEU 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 24:4"/>xɛmɛ singen naxan a mɛxi a ra, na mi lan a yi a tongo sɔnɔn, a findi a ɲaxanla ra, bayo a bata haramuya a ma. Alatala na fe sifan naɲaxuxi. Ɛ mi lan ɛ xa na yulubi sifan liga bɔxɔni Alatala ɛ Ala dɛnaxan soma ɛ yii ɛ kɛɛn na.<verse eid="DEU 24:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Muxu feen sariyana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 24:5"/>Xɛmɛn naxan baxi ɲaxanla dɔxɔdeni, a mi lan a xa so sofayani. Kɔntɔfili gbɛtɛ yo mi lan a xa lu a ma han ɲɛɛ keden alogo a xa a ɲaxanla masuxu a naxan dɔxi, a a rasɛwa.<verse eid="DEU 24:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 24:6"/>Ɛ mi lan ɛ xa wuli ngaan nun wuli diin dɔxɔ tolimani, xa na mi a ra wulin diin gbansanna, bayo na findima balotareyaan nan na.<verse eid="DEU 24:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 24:7"/>Xa Isirayila kaana nde a ngaxakedenna suxu nɔɔni, a yi a findi konyin na, hanma a a mati, a lan nɛn na kanna xa faxa. Ɛ fe ɲaxin ɲanma ɛ tagi na kiini.<verse eid="DEU 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 24:8"/>Xa fure ɲaxin bata mini muxuna nde fatin ma ɛ xa a liga alo Lewi yixɛtɛn saraxaraline a fala ɛ xa kii naxan yi. N na e yamari naxan na, ɛ xa na birin suxu ki faɲi. <verse eid="DEU 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 24:9"/>Alatala ɛ Ala naxan ligaxi Mariyama ra ɛ keli xanbini Misiran yi, ɛ xa ɛ miri na ma.<verse eid="DEU 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 24:10"/>Xa ɛ ngaxakedenna nde sena nde dɔxɔ ɛ ma tolimani, ɛ nama so a banxini na tolima seen tongodeni. <verse eid="DEU 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 24:11"/>Ɛ xa lu tanden ma, na kanna xa mini na tolima seen na. <verse eid="DEU 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 24:12"/>Xa yiigelitɔɔn na a ra, a yi a gubaan so i yii tolimaan na, i nama a ramara han kɔɛɛn na. <verse eid="DEU 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 24:13"/>I xa a raxɛtɛ a ma sogen godo waxatini, alogo a xa xi a yi, a barikan bira i xa. Na yatɛma nɛn tinxinna ra Alatala i ya Ala yɛɛ ra yi.<verse eid="DEU 24:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 24:14"/>I nama ɲaxu yiigelitɔ walikɛ tɔrɔxine ra, a na findi i ngaxakeden Isirayila kaan na hanma xɔɲɛn na naxan dɔxi i konni. <verse eid="DEU 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 24:15"/>I xa a wanla saranna so a yii lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ benun sogen xa godo, bayo yiigelitɔɔn nan a ra, a xaxili tixi a saranna nan na. Xa a mawuga Alatala xa i ya fe yi, i findima nɛn yulubi tongon na.<verse eid="DEU 24:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 24:16"/>Fafane mi faxama diine funfuni, diine fan mi faxama fafane funfuni, koni birin faxama a yɛtɛ yulubin nan ma fe ra.<verse eid="DEU 24:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 24:17"/>I nama kiti kobin sa xɔɲɛn ma hanma kiridina. I nama kaɲa gilɛna a gubaan nasuxu tolimaan na. <verse eid="DEU 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 24:18"/>I nama ɲinan, a i findi nɛn konyin na Misiran yi, Alatala i ya Ala nan i xunba. Na feen na a toxi n yamarini ito fixi i ma. I xa a suxu.<verse eid="DEU 24:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 24:19"/>I na seen xaba xɛɛn ma, tɔnsɔnna naxanye na lu e xɔri ma, i nama ne matongo. I xa e lu na xɔɲɛne nun kiridine nun kaɲa gilɛne xa. Nanara, Alatala i ya Ala i barakama nɛn i ya wanle birin yi. <verse eid="DEU 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 24:20"/>I na i ya oliwi binle bogine malan, e bogin naxanye na lu e kɔɛ ra, i mi lan i xa xɛtɛ ne badeni. I xa e lu na xɔɲɛne nun kiridine nun kaɲa gilɛne xa. <verse eid="DEU 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 24:21"/>I na i ya manpa bogine fan ba, e bogin naxanye na lu e ra, i mi lan i xa xɛtɛ ne badeni. I xa e lu na xɔɲɛne nun kiridine nun kaɲa gilɛne xa. <verse eid="DEU 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 24:22"/>I nama ɲinan, a i findi nɛn konyin na Misiran yi. Na feen na a toxi n yamarini ito fixi i ma. I xa a suxu.<verse eid="DEU 24:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="DEU 25"/>
  <para style="s">Bosa rabɔnbɔna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 25:1"/>Xa xɛmɛ firin yɛngɛ, e na siga kitisane fɛma alogo e xa e makiti, kitisane xa yoon fi ɲɔndi kanna ma, wule falana kala tixin yi saran a ra. <verse eid="DEU 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 25:2"/>Xa wule falan lanma a xa bɔnbɔ, kitisaan xa a rasa bɔxɔni, e yi a bɔnbɔ a yɛɛ xɔri bosaan yɛ yatɛn na a lan a xa naxan sɔtɔ fata sariyan na. <verse eid="DEU 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 25:3"/>Na kui, ɛ mi lan ɛ xa dangu bosaan yɛ tonge naanin na. Xa ɛ nde sa na fari, ɛ bata ɛ ngaxakedenna rayagi.<verse eid="DEU 25:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɲingena wanla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 25:4"/>I na ɲingen ti malo bodonna ra, i nama a dɛɛn xidi.<verse eid="DEU 25:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kaɲa gilɛ diitare kanna fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 25:5"/>Xa ngaxakeden ma xɛmɛ firinne dɔxi yire kedenni, keden yi faxa a mi dii bari, na ɲaxanla mi lan a xa dɔxɔ xɛmɛ gbɛtɛ xɔn ma denbayaan fari ma. A lan a xa dɔxɔ a xɛmɛna ngaxakedenna nde nan xɔn, a findi a ɲaxanla ra. <verse eid="DEU 25:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 25:6"/>A dii singen naxan barima, na lan a xili sa faxa muxun xun ma, alogo a xinla nama lɔ ayi Isirayila bɔxɔni. <verse eid="DEU 25:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 25:7"/>Xa xɛmɛn tondi a ngaxakedenna a ɲaxanla dɔxɛ, kaɲa gilɛn xa siga taan so dɛɛn na taan fonne dɛnaxan yi, a a yɛba e xa, a naxa, “N ma xɛmɛna ngaxakedenna mi tinxi n ma fe ma. A bata tondi dii fideni a ngaxakedenna ma Isirayila bɔnsɔnne yɛ, naxan lan a xili sa a xun ma.” <verse eid="DEU 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 25:8"/>Taan fonne xɛmɛn xilima nɛn, e yi a maxɔdin. Xa a tondi a ngaxakedenna a ɲaxanla dɔxɛ, <verse eid="DEU 25:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 25:9"/>kaɲa gilɛna a masoma nɛn a ra taan fonne yɛɛ xɔri, a sankidin ba a xɛmɛna ngaxakedenna sanni, a yi a dɛ igen puru a yɛtagi. A yi a fala, a naxa, “Ito nan ligama xɛmɛn na naxan tondima mayixɛtɛn fideni a ngaxakedenna ma.” <verse eid="DEU 25:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 25:10"/>Nayi, na xɛmɛna a denbayaan xili bama Isirayila yi ikiini, “Sankidi ba denbayana.”<verse eid="DEU 25:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Naxan mi daxa yɛngɛni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 25:11"/>Xa xɛmɛ firin yɛngɛma, na nde keden ma ɲaxanla yi siga a xɛmɛn badeni boden yii, xa a boden xɛmɛya yiren suxu, <verse eid="DEU 25:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 25:12"/>ɛ nama kininkinin na ɲaxanla ma. Ɛ xa a yiin bolon a ra.<verse eid="DEU 25:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tinxinna yulayani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 25:13"/>Ɛ nama kilo firin xali ɛ sagbaan kui naxan mi kamalixi, keden binya, boden yelefu. <verse eid="DEU 25:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 25:14"/>Ɛ nama liga se firin fan lu ɛ konni naxan mi kamalixi, keden xungbo, boden xurun. <verse eid="DEU 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 25:15"/>Kilo kamalixin nun liga se kamalixin nan lan a xa lu ɛ yii. Nayi, ɛ siimaya xunkuyen sɔtɔma nɛn bɔxɔni Alatala ɛ Ala dɛnaxan soma ɛ yii. <verse eid="DEU 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 25:16"/>Naxan yo na na liga, a mayifuun ti, na muxu sifan mi rafan Alatala ɛ Ala ma.<verse eid="DEU 25:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Amalɛkine yaxuya fena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 25:17"/>Ɛ nama ɲinan Amalɛkine naxan liga ɛ ra ɛ to yi keli Misiran yi. <verse eid="DEU 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 25:18"/>E mini nɛn ɛ ma kiraan xɔn, e yi xanbiralune yɛɛ rasa. Na waxatini, ɛ yi xadanxi han! Ala yɛɛ ragaxu yo mi yi e yi. <verse eid="DEU 25:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 25:19"/>Iki, Alatala ɛ Ala na ɛ rasabati ɛ rabilinna yaxune yɛɛ xɔri na bɔxɔni a dɛnaxan soma ɛ yii, ɛ xa Amalɛkine raxɔri han e xinla yi tunun dunuɲa yi. Ɛ nama ɲinan na xɔn!<verse eid="DEU 25:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="DEU 26"/>
  <para style="s">Bogi se singene nun yaganna fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 26:1"/>Ɛ na so bɔxɔni Alatala ɛ Ala naxan fima ɛ ma ɛ kɛɛn na, a yi findi ɛ gbeen na, ɛ na dɔxɔ mɛnni waxatin naxan yi, <verse eid="DEU 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 26:2"/>ɛ birin nde bama nɛn ɛ bɔxɔn bogi se singene ra, na bɔxɔni Alatala ɛ Ala dɛnaxan fima ɛ ma. Ɛ xa a sa deben kui, ɛ yi a xali na yireni Alatala ɛ Ala dɛnaxan sugandima a xinla matɔxɔn dɛnaxan yi. <verse eid="DEU 26:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 26:3"/>Ɛ sigan saraxaraline nan fɛma naxanye walima na waxatini. Ɛ yi a fala e xa, ɛ naxa, “N na a falama to Alatala en ma Ala xa, a n bata so na bɔxɔni, a a kɔlɔ naxan ma fe ra a a soma en benbane yii.”<verse eid="DEU 26:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 26:4"/>Saraxaraliin deben nasuxuma nɛn ɛ yii, a a dɔxɔ Alatala ɛ Alaa saraxa ganden yɛtagi. <verse eid="DEU 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 26:5"/>Ɛ falani ito nan tima Alatala ɛ Ala xa, ɛ naxa, “N benban findixi Arami kaan nan na, sigatiina. A siga nɛn Misiran yi, e nun a muxune. E yi dɔxɔ na. E yi findi siya gbee sɛnbɛmaan na, muxu wuyaxi. <verse eid="DEU 26:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 26:6"/>Koni Misiran kaane nxu ɲaxankata nɛn, e nxu tɔrɔ, e konyiya xɔdɛxɛn sa nxu ma. <verse eid="DEU 26:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 26:7"/>Nxu yi Alatala maxandi, nxu benbane Ala. A yi nxɔ maxandi xuiin namɛ, a mɔn yi nxɔ mantɔrɔne to, e yi fe ɲaxine nun fe xɔdɛxɛn naxanye dɔxɔma nxu ra. <verse eid="DEU 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 26:8"/>Alatala yi nxu ramini a sɛnbɛn nun nɔɔn nun fe magaxuxine nun taxamasenne nun kabanakone ra Misiran yi. <verse eid="DEU 26:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 26:9"/>A yi fa nxu ra han be, a yi bɔxɔni ito so nxu yii, nɔnɔn nun kumin gbo dɛnaxan yi. <verse eid="DEU 26:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 26:10"/>Na nan a toxi, iki, Alatala, n faxi bɔxɔn bogi se singeni itoe ra i tan fɛma, i naxanye fixi n ma.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 26:10">Ɛ deben dɔxɔma nɛn Alatala ɛ Ala yɛtagi, ɛ yi ɛ xinbi sin a xa. <verse eid="DEU 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 26:11"/>Ɛ tan nun Lewine nun xɔɲɛn naxanye ɛ tagi, ɛ birin yi sɛwa ɛ bode xɔn ma se faɲine fe ra Alatala ɛ Ala naxan fixi ɛ ma e nun ɛ denbayana.<verse eid="DEU 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 26:12"/>Ɲɛɛ saxandene findixi yagan ɲɛɛne nan na. Ɛ na yelin yaganna malanɲɛ, ɛ xa a so Lewine nun xɔɲɛne nun kiridine nun kaɲa gilɛne nan yii naxanye ɛ taane yi. Ne fan yi e dɛge, e yi lugo. <verse eid="DEU 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 26:13"/>Na waxatini, ɛ falani ito nan tima Alatala ɛ Ala xa, ɛ naxa, “Naxan findixi i gbeen na, n bata a birin namini n konni. N bata a so Lewine nun xɔɲɛne nun kiridine nun kaɲa gilɛne yii alo i a yamarixi kii naxan yi. N mi i ya yamari yo matandixi hanma n ɲinan a xɔn. <verse eid="DEU 26:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 26:14"/>Hali sayaan to so n ma n mi i ya yaganna siyadin don, hanma n yi a xunnakala fe haramuxini, hanma n yi barinne ki nde ra. N bata i xuiin suxu, Alatala n ma Ala. I naxan yamarixi n ma, n bata na birin liga. <verse eid="DEU 26:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 26:15"/>I xa i miri nxu ma ariyanna yi, i dɔxɔde sariɲanxini. I yi Isirayila baraka, i ya yamana e nun i bɔxɔn naxan fixi nxu ma, i i kɔlɔ naxan ma fe ra nxu benbane xa, nɔnɔn nun kumin gbo dɛnaxan yi.”<verse eid="DEU 26:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fala raɲanna sariyana fe yi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 26:16"/>Alatala ɛ Ala bata ɛ yamari to, a ɛ xa a tɔnne nun a sariyane suxu ki faɲi! Ɛ xa ɛ ɲɔxɔ lu e xɔn ma ɛ bɔɲɛn birin na e nun ɛ niin birin yi. <verse eid="DEU 26:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 26:17"/>Ɛ bata ɛ dɛ ti Alatala xa to, a a tan nan ɛ Ala ra, a ɛ birama nɛn a kirane fɔxɔ ra, a ɛ a tɔnne nun a yamarine nun a sariyane suxuma nɛn. <verse eid="DEU 26:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 26:18"/>Alatala fan bata a dɛ ti, a ɛ tan findima a gbee yamaan na, alo a a falaxi ɛ xa kii naxan yi. Ɛ xa a yamarine suxu, <verse eid="DEU 26:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 26:19"/>alogo a xa ɛ rafisa a siya daxine birin xa. Ɛ nɔrɔn nun ɛ xinla nun ɛ sɛnbɛn danguma nɛn e birin na. Ɛ mɔn yi findi yama rasariɲanxin na Alatala ɛ Ala xa, alo a a fala kii naxan yi.<verse eid="DEU 26:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="DEU 27"/>
  <para style="s">Duban nun dangana fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 27:1"/>Nabi Musa yi yamarini ito fi Isirayila kaane ma fonne yɛɛ xɔri, a naxa, “Ɛ xa yamarini itoe birin suxu n naxanye fiin to. <verse eid="DEU 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 27:2"/>Ɛ nɛma Yurudɛn baan gidin waxatin naxan yi, siga na bɔxɔni Alatala ɛ Ala naxan soxi ɛ yii, ɛ xa gɛmɛ gbeene ti, ɛ e mafixa. <verse eid="DEU 27:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 27:3"/>Ɛ yi sariya falani itoe birin sɛbɛ e ma, ɛ na gidi waxatin naxan yi, ɛ so na bɔxɔni Alatala ɛ Ala naxan soma ɛ yii, nɔnɔn nun kumin gbo dɛnaxan yi alo Alatala ɛ benbane Ala a fala ɛ xa kii naxan yi. <verse eid="DEU 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 27:4"/>Ɛ na yelin Yurudɛn baan gidɛ, ɛ xa gɛmɛni itoe ti Ebali geyaan fari, ɛ yi e mafixa, alo n na yamarima ɛ ma kii naxan yi to. <verse eid="DEU 27:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 27:5"/>Ɛ xa gɛmɛne malan Alatala ɛ Ala xa saraxa ganden na mɛnni, wure walise mi dinxi gɛmɛn naxanye ra. <verse eid="DEU 27:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 27:6"/>Ɛ gɛmɛne nan matongoma, ɛ yi Alatala ɛ Alaa saraxa ganden nafala. Ɛ yi saraxa gan daxine ba Alatala ɛ Ala xa na fari. <verse eid="DEU 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 27:7"/>Ɛ mɔn xa bɔɲɛ xunbeli saraxane fan ba mɛnni, ɛ e don, ɛ sɛwa Alatala ɛ Ala yɛtagi. <verse eid="DEU 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 27:8"/>Ɛ gɛmɛn naxanye tixi, ɛ xa Alaa sariya falane sɛbɛ ne ma, ɛ yi e kɛrɛndɛn ki faɲi.”<verse eid="DEU 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 27:9"/>Musa nun saraxaraline, Lewine mɔn yi falan ti yamaan xa, e naxa, “Isirayila yamana, ɛ sabari. Ɛ yi ɛ tuli mati. Ɛ bata findi Alatala ɛ Alaa yamaan na to. <verse eid="DEU 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 27:10"/>Ɛ xa Alatala ɛ Alaa falan namɛ. Ɛ xa a yamarine nun a tɔnne suxu, n naxanye yamarima ɛ ma to.”<verse eid="DEU 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 27:11"/>Na lɔxɔ kedenni, Musa mɔn yi yamarini ito so yamaan yii, a naxa, <verse eid="DEU 27:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 27:12"/>“Ɛ na Yurudɛn baan gidi waxatin naxan yi, bɔnsɔnni itoe xa ti Garisimi geyaan fari, e duba yamaan xa: Simeyɔn nun Lewi nun Yuda nun Isakari nun Yusufu e nun Bunyamin. <verse eid="DEU 27:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 27:13"/>Bɔnsɔnni itoe xa ti Ebali geyaan nan fari, e dangan ti: Rubɛn nun Gadi nun Aseri nun Sabulon nun Dan e nun Nafatali. <verse eid="DEU 27:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 27:14"/>Lewine falan tima nɛn Isirayila birin xa e xui yitexin na.”<verse eid="DEU 27:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 27:15"/>E naxa, “Ala xa na kanna danga naxan na suxuren nafala, hanma se gbɛtɛ rafalaxi wure raxulunxin na, a yi a batu wundoni. Na se sifan naɲaxu Alatala ma.” Yamaan birin xa a ratin, e naxa, “Amina.”<verse eid="DEU 27:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 27:16"/>“Ala xa na kanna danga naxan na a fafe nun a nga rayagi.” Yamaan birin xa a ratin, e naxa, “Amina.”<verse eid="DEU 27:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 27:17"/>“Ala xa na kanna danga naxan na a bodena bɔxɔn danne taxamasenne masiga.” Yamaan birin xa a ratin, e naxa, “Amina.”<verse eid="DEU 27:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 27:18"/>“Ala xa na kanna danga naxan na danxutɔɔn ti kira ɲaxin xɔn.” Yamaan birin xa a ratin, e naxa, “Amina.”<verse eid="DEU 27:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 27:19"/>“Ala xa na kanna danga naxan na kiti ɲaxin sa xɔɲɛn ma hanma kiridina hanma kaɲa gilɛna.” Yamaan birin xa a ratin, e naxa, “Amina.”<verse eid="DEU 27:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 27:20"/>“Ala xa na kanna danga naxan nun a fafe a ɲaxanla kafuma, bayo a bata a fafe rayagi.” Yamaan birin xa a ratin, e naxa, “Amina.”<verse eid="DEU 27:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 27:21"/>“Ala xa na kanna danga naxan na yɛnɛyaan liga suben xɔn.” Yamaan birin xa a ratin, e naxa, “Amina.”<verse eid="DEU 27:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 27:22"/>“Ala xa na kanna danga naxan nun a magilɛn kafuma, a fafe a dii tɛmɛna, hanma a nga a dii tɛmɛna.” Yamaan birin xa a ratin, e naxa, “Amina.”<verse eid="DEU 27:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 27:23"/>“Ala xa na kanna danga naxan nun a bitan ɲaxanla kafuma.” Yamaan birin xa a ratin, e naxa, “Amina.”<verse eid="DEU 27:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 27:24"/>“Ala xa na kanna danga naxan na a boden faxa wundoni.” Yamaan birin xa a ratin, e naxa, “Amina.”<verse eid="DEU 27:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 27:25"/>“Ala xa na kanna danga naxan na dimi yi seene rasuxu tɔɲɛgɛden faxa feen na.” Yamaan birin xa a ratin, e naxa, “Amina.”<verse eid="DEU 27:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 27:26"/>“Naxan mi sariya falani itoe suxuma a yi e liga, Ala xa na kanna danga.” Yamaan birin xa a ratin, e naxa, “Amina.”<verse eid="DEU 27:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="DEU 28"/>
  <para style="s">Dubane fe</para>
  <para style="r">Saraxaraline 26.3-13 nun Sariyane 7.12-24</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 28:1"/>Xa ɛ Alatala ɛ Ala xuiin suxu ki faɲi, ɛ yi yamarini itoe suxu n naxanye soxi ɛ yii to, nayi Alatala ɛ rafisama nɛn bɔxɔn siyane birin xa. <verse eid="DEU 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 28:2"/>Ɛ baraka feni itoe nan sɔtɔma, xa ɛ Alatala ɛ Ala xuiin suxu:<verse eid="DEU 28:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 28:3"/>A barakan sama nɛn ɛ fe yi taan kui e nun xɛɛne ma. <verse eid="DEU 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 28:4"/>A barakan sa ɛ dii barin nun ɛ bɔxɔn bogi seene nun ɛ xuruse kurune nun ɲingene nun yɛxɛɛne yi. <verse eid="DEU 28:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 28:5"/>A yi barakan sa ɛ donse sagane nun ɛ donse rafaladene yi.<verse eid="DEU 28:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 28:6"/>A yi ɛ baraka ɛ somatɔɔn nun ɛ minimatɔɔn na. <verse eid="DEU 28:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 28:7"/>Ɛ yaxune na keli ɛ yɛngɛdeni, Alatala e kedima nɛn ɛ yɛɛ ra. Xa e so kira keden nan xɔn, e e gima nɛn ɛ yɛɛ ra kira solofere xɔn. <verse eid="DEU 28:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 28:8"/>Alatala ɛ Ala barakan sama nɛn ɛ gbengbene yi, e nun ɛ wanle birin yi. A barakan sama ɛ fe yi na bɔxɔni a dɛnaxan fima ɛ ma. <verse eid="DEU 28:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 28:9"/>Xa ɛ Alatala ɛ Ala yamarine suxu, ɛ mɔn yi bira a kirane fɔxɔ ra, a ɛ findima a yamaan na nɛn alo a a kɔlɔ ɛ xa kii naxan yi. <verse eid="DEU 28:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 28:10"/>Bɔxɔn siyane birin a kolonma nɛn nayi, a Alatala xinla bata fala ɛ xun ma, e gaxu ɛ yɛɛ ra.<verse eid="DEU 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 28:11"/>Alatala ɛ hɛrisigɛn fari sama nɛn na bɔxɔni a a kɔlɔ ɛ benbane xa naxan ma fe ra a a soma ɛ yii. Ɛ dii wuyaxi barima nɛn, ɛ xuruseene dii wuyaxi xalima nɛn, a mɔn yi barikan sa ɛ bɔxɔn bogi seene yi. <verse eid="DEU 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 28:12"/>Alatala koren nabima nɛn ɛ xa, a igen namaraxi dɛnaxan yi, alogo a xa tulen nafa ɛ bɔxɔne ma a waxatini, a ɛ wanle birin nasɔnɔya. Siya wuyaxine fama ɛ dolideni nɛn, koni ɛ tan mi donla tongoma. <verse eid="DEU 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 28:13"/>Alatala ɛ tima nɛn yɛɛn na. Ɛ mi luyɛ dɔnxɛn na mumɛ! Xa ɛ Alatala ɛ Ala yamarine suxu, n naxanye falama ɛ xa to, a ɛ yitema nɛn bonne xa, ɛ mi luyɛ e bun mumɛ! <verse eid="DEU 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 28:14"/>Ɛ nama yamarini itoe beɲin n naxanye falaxi ɛ xa, ɛ siga yiifanna ma hanma kɔmɛnna ma, ɛ yi bira ala gbɛtɛne fɔxɔ ra, ɛ yi e batu.<verse eid="DEU 28:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Dangane fe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LEV 26:14-46">Saraxaraline 26.14-46</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 28:15"/>Xa ɛ tondi Alatala ɛ Ala xuiin suxɛ, xa ɛ tondi a yamarine nun a tɔnne suxɛ, n naxanye falama ɛ xa to, nayi dangani itoe nan fama ɛ ma, e yi ɛ suxu. <verse eid="DEU 28:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 28:16"/>Ala ɛ dangama nɛn taani e nun xɛɛne ma. <verse eid="DEU 28:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 28:17"/>A dangan sama nɛn ɛ donse sagane nun ɛ donse rafaladene yi. <verse eid="DEU 28:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 28:18"/>A dangan sa ɛ dii barin nun ɛ bɔxɔn bogi seene nun ɛ xuruse kurune nun ɲingene nun yɛxɛɛne yi. <verse eid="DEU 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 28:19"/>A yi ɛ danga ɛ somatɔɔn nun ɛ minimatɔɔn na.<verse eid="DEU 28:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 28:20"/>Alatala dangan nun mayifuun nun fe magaxuxin nafama ɛ ma nɛn ɛ wanle birin yi han ɛ sa halagi, bayo ɛ bata fe ɲaxin liga, ɛ to xɛtɛ a fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="DEU 28:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 28:21"/>Alatala fitina furen nadinma ɛ ma nɛn han ɛ birin yi ɲan na bɔxɔni ɛ sigama dɛnaxan masɔtɔdeni. <verse eid="DEU 28:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 28:22"/>Alatala ɛ doyenma nɛn furen na, e nun fati mawolonna nun fati makusinna. A fama nɛn kuye wolonna ra, e nun furuna, sansine funduma nɛn hanma e kun. Feni itoe ɛ tɔrɔma nɛn han ɛ halagi. <verse eid="DEU 28:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 28:23"/>Kuyen xarama nɛn, bɔxɔn fan yi xɔdɔxɔ ayi alo wurena. <verse eid="DEU 28:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 28:24"/>Alatala yi ɛ tulen masara gbangbanna ra keli kore, godo xɛɛne ma, han ɛ birin yi halagi. <verse eid="DEU 28:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 28:25"/>Alatala a ligama nɛn, ɛ yi halagi ɛ yaxune yɛtagi. Xa ɛ siga e yɛngɛdeni kira keden nan xɔn, ɛ gima nɛn e yɛɛ ra kira solofere xɔn. Dunuɲa muxune birin kabɛma nɛn ɛ kalana fe ra. <verse eid="DEU 28:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 28:26"/>Xɔline nun burunna subene ɛ binbine donma nɛn. Muxu yo mi e kedi.<verse eid="DEU 28:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 28:27"/>Alatala ɛ tɔrɔma nɛn setene ra alo a naxan liga Misiran kaane ra. A ɛ tɔrɔ bontenbandunna nun gasine ra, e nun maxɛnxɛnna naxan mi danma. <verse eid="DEU 28:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 28:28"/>Alatala ɛ findima nɛn danxutɔne ra, a faan naso ɛ yi, ɛ yi findi fatɔne ra. <verse eid="DEU 28:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 28:29"/>Yanyin na ɛ sigati kiin yi ɛ yifu alo danxutɔne. Ɛ wali yo mi lanɲɛ. Ɛ lu tɔrɛ, e yi ɛ yii geli. Muxu yo mi nɔɛ ɛ bɛ e yii. <verse eid="DEU 28:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 28:30"/>Ɛ na ɲaxalandin masuxu, xɛmɛ gbɛtɛ fuma a ma nɛn. Ɛ na banxin ti, ɛ mi soɛ a kui. Ɛ na manpa binle si, ɛ mi nɔɛ e bogine donɲɛ. <verse eid="DEU 28:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 28:31"/>Ɛ ɲingene kɔɛ raxabama nɛn ɛ yɛɛ xɔri, ɛ mi e suben donɲɛ. E ɛ sofanla bama nɛn ɛ yii, ɛ mi a masɔtɛ. Ɛ yɛxɛɛne soma nɛn ɛ yaxune yii, muxu yo mi ɛ maliyɛ. <verse eid="DEU 28:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 28:32"/>Ɛ dii xɛmɛne nun dii tɛmɛne soma nɛn siya gbɛtɛn yii alo konyine ɛ yɛɛ xɔri. Ɛ xadanma nɛn e yɛɛ ra kira yitodeni, koni fɛrɛ yo mi luyɛ ɛ xa, ɛ yi e mali. <verse eid="DEU 28:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 28:33"/>Xɔɲɛne baloma ɛ sansine nan na. Ɛ wanla naxan birin kɛma, a tɔnɔn findima e gbeen nan na. E ɛ rayarabima nɛn, e yi ɛ ɲaxankata ɛ siin birin yi. <verse eid="DEU 28:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 28:34"/>Ɛ na feni itoe birin to, ɛ luma nɛn alo fatɔne.<verse eid="DEU 28:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 28:35"/>Alatala sete ɲaxine ratema nɛn ɛ sanne nun ɛ xinbine ma naxan mi yalanɲɛ. E yi din ɛ fatin birin na, keli ɛ xunna ma han ɛ sanne. <verse eid="DEU 28:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 28:36"/>Alatala ɛ nun ɛ mangan kedima nɛn, ɛ na naxan dɔxɔ ɛ xun na, siga bɔxɔni ɛ tan nun ɛ benbane mi naxan kolon. Mɛnni ɛ ala xɔɲɛne batuma nɛn naxanye rafalaxi wudin na, hanma gɛmɛna. <verse eid="DEU 28:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 28:37"/>Alatala ɛ xalima siyaan naxanye konni, ne kabɛma nɛn ɛ fe ma, e yi ɛ magele, e yi ɛ rayelefu.<verse eid="DEU 28:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 28:38"/>Ɛ sansi gbegbe wolima nɛn ɛ xɛɛne ma, koni ɛ ndedi nan tun xabama, bayo tuguminne dinma nɛn a birin na. <verse eid="DEU 28:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 28:39"/>Ɛ manpa binle sima nɛn, ɛ yi e masuxu ki faɲi, koni ɛ mi e igen minɲɛ, ɛ mi e bogine malanɲɛ bayo kunle soma e yi nɛn. <verse eid="DEU 28:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 28:40"/>Oliwi binle luma nɛn bɔxɔn birin yi, koni ɛ mi e turen soma ɛ ma, bayo oliwi bogine yolonma nɛn. <verse eid="DEU 28:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 28:41"/>Ɛ diine barima nɛn, koni e mi luyɛ ɛ yii, bayo ɛ yaxune e xalima nɛn. <verse eid="DEU 28:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 28:42"/>Ɛ wudine nun bɔxɔn bogi seene findima tuguminne nan gbee ra. <verse eid="DEU 28:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 28:43"/>Xɔɲɛn naxanye dɔxi ɛ yɛ, ne fe matema nɛn ɛ xa pon! Koni ɛ tan ma fe magodoma nɛn han! <verse eid="DEU 28:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 28:44"/>Ɛ sigama nɛn e dolideni, koni e tan mi fɛ ɛ dolɛ mumɛ! Ala e tima nɛn yɛɛn na. Ɛ yi lu dɔnxɛn na. <verse eid="DEU 28:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 28:45"/>Dangani itoe birin fama nɛn ɛ fɔxɔ ra, e yi ɛ sagatan, e yi ɛ suxu han ɛ birin yi halagi, bayo ɛ bata tondi Alatala ɛ Ala xuiin suxɛ. Ɛ mi a yamarine nun a tɔnne suxi a naxanye soxi ɛ yii. <verse eid="DEU 28:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 28:46"/>Na findima taxamasenna nun kabanakoon nan na ɛ tan nun ɛ yixɛtɛne xa habadan!<verse eid="DEU 28:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 28:47"/>Bayo ɛ mi tin walɛ Alatala ɛ Ala xa sɛwan nun ɲɛnige faɲini, ɛ yi hɛrini waxatin naxan yi, <verse eid="DEU 28:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 28:48"/>nayi ɛ walima nɛn ɛ yaxune xa Alatala naxanye rafama ɛ xili ma. Kamɛn nun min xɔnla ɛ suxuma nɛn. Ɛ magenla luma nɛn tɔrɔni. E yi wuren xidi ɛ kɔɛ xanbi ra ɛ goronna tongo, han ɛ yi halagi. <verse eid="DEU 28:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 28:49"/>Alatala fama nɛn siyana nde ra, keli yire makuyeni bɔxɔn danna ra. A godoma nɛn ɛ ma alo singbinna. Ɛ mi a xuiin mɛma. <verse eid="DEU 28:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="DEU 28:50"/>E findima muxu yɛ xɔdɛxɛne nan na, naxanye mi xɛmɛ fonne binyama, e mɔn mi kininkininɲɛ diine ma. <verse eid="DEU 28:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="DEU 28:51"/>E ɛ xuruseene nun ɛ bɔxɔn bogi seene tongoma nɛn, ɛ yi halagi. E mi ɛ murutun hanma manpana hanma turen naluma ɛ yii. E ɛ ɲinge diine nun yɛxɛɛ diine nun siine xalima nɛn han ɛ yi halagi.<verse eid="DEU 28:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="DEU 28:52"/>E ɛ taane birin nabilinma nɛn yɛngɛni, na bɔxɔni Alatala ɛ Ala dɛnaxan soma ɛ yii. E ɛ yɛngɛma nɛn han ɛ taan yinna naxanye mate, ɛ laxi naxanye ra, ne yi bira. <verse eid="DEU 28:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="DEU 28:53"/>Yɛngɛni ito yi, ɛ yaxune ɛ rakamɛma nɛn han ɛ yi ɛ diine don, Alatala ɛ Ala naxanye fixi ɛ ma. <verse eid="DEU 28:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="DEU 28:54"/>Hali xɛmɛ faɲi hinantɔna ɛ tagi, a mi kininkininɲɛ a ngaxakedenne ma hanma a ɲaxanla hanma a dii ɲɛɲɛne. <verse eid="DEU 28:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="DEU 28:55"/>A mi tinɲɛ a diin subeni taxunɲɛ e ra, bayo na findixi a balo dɔnxɛn nan na. Ɛ yaxune ɛ rayarabima na kii nin ɛ taan birin yi. <verse eid="DEU 28:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="DEU 28:56"/>Hali ɲaxalan faɲi hinantɔna ɛ tagi, naxan mi susuɛ a sanna tiyɛ bɔxɔn ma, a tan fan mi kininkininɲɛ a rafan xɛmɛn ma hanma a diina. <verse eid="DEU 28:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="DEU 28:57"/>A mi tinɲɛ a dii barixin subeni taxunɲɛ e ra e nun a diin xunyɛna, bayo a wama ne don feni wundoni. Ɛ yaxune na ɛ rabilin yɛngɛni e fama nɛn na tɔrɔ sifan na ɛ konni.<verse eid="DEU 28:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="DEU 28:58"/>Xa ɛ mi sariya falani itoe suxu a faɲin na naxanye sɛbɛxi kitabuni ito kui, xa ɛ mi gaxu Alatala ɛ Ala xili gbee magaxuxin yɛɛ ra, <verse eid="DEU 28:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="DEU 28:59"/>Alatala fitina furene nun fure ɲaxine dɔxɔma nɛn ɛ tan nun ɛ yixɛtɛne ma naxan magaxu, e mɔn mi yalanɲɛ xulɛn. <verse eid="DEU 28:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="DEU 28:60"/>A fitina furene birin nafama nɛn ɛ ma, ɛ yi gaxuxi naxanye yɛɛ ra Misiran bɔxɔni. Na furene yi ɛ suxu, e yi ɛ nɔ. <verse eid="DEU 28:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="DEU 28:61"/>Alatala furen sifan birin sanbama ɛ ma nɛn e nun yihadin birin hali ba naxanye sɛbɛxi kitabuni ito kui, han ɛ birin yi halagi. <verse eid="DEU 28:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="DEU 28:62"/>Ɛ tan naxanye yi wuya dangu sarene ra kore, ɛ yatɛn xurunma ayi nɛn bayo ɛ bata Alatala ɛ Ala xuiin matandi. <verse eid="DEU 28:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="DEU 28:63"/>Alatala fe faɲin ligaxi ɛ xa kii naxan yi, a ɛ rawuya ayi kii naxan yi, a mɔn ɛ halagima na kii nin, a yi ɛ faxa. A ɛ bama nɛn na bɔxɔni ɛ fama naxan masɔtɔdeni. <verse eid="DEU 28:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="DEU 28:64"/>Alatala yi ɛ raxuya ayi siyane birin yɛ, keli dunuɲa fɔlɔn ma han a danna. Ɛ ala gbɛtɛne batuma nɛn, naxanye rafalaxi wudin nun gɛmɛn na, ɛ tan nun ɛ benbane mi naxanye kolon. <verse eid="DEU 28:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="DEU 28:65"/>Na siyane tagi, ɛ mi matabu yo sɔtɔma, ɛ mi yire yo sɔtɔma ɛ dɔxɔma dɛnaxan yi. Alatala ɛ bɔɲɛne wolonma nɛn, a ɛ yɛɛne raxadan xi xɔnla ra, a ɛ niine yiɲaxu ɛ ma. <verse eid="DEU 28:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="DEU 28:66"/>Ɛ siimayaan findima kɔntɔfinle nan na, gaxuna ɛ raxuruxurunma nɛn kɔɛɛn nun yanyin na. Ɛ sikɛma nɛn ɛ niin yɛtɛna fe ra. <verse eid="DEU 28:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="DEU 28:67"/>Ɛ na na feene to waxatin naxan yi naxanye ligama, gaxun soma nɛn ɛ bɔɲɛni. Xɔtɔnni, ɛ yi a fala, ɛ naxa, “Xa ɲinbanna nan yi a ra nun!” Ɲinbanna ra, ɛ yi a fala, ɛ naxa, “Xa xɔtɔnna nan yi a ra nun!”<verse eid="DEU 28:67"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="DEU 28:68"/>Alatala ɛ xalima nɛn kunkine kui Misiran yi, n na a fala dɛnaxan ma, a ɛ mi mɛnna toma sɔnɔn. Mɛnni, xɛmɛne nun ɲaxanle, ɛ katama nɛn ɛ xa ɛ yɛtɛ mati ɛ yaxune ma konyine ra, koni muxu yo mi ɛ sarama.<verse eid="DEU 28:68"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="DEU 28:69"/>Alatala falani itoe nan ti a layirin na a naxan yamari Musa ma, a xa a xidi e nun Isirayila kaane tagi, Moyaba bɔxɔni, ba layirin na e naxan xidi Horebe geyaan fari.<verse eid="DEU 28:69"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 28"/>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="DEU 29"/>
  <para style="s">Nabi Musaa kawandi dɔnxɛna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 29:1"/>Nabi Musa yi Isirayila yamaan birin maxili, a yi a fala e xa, a naxa:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 29:1">Ɛ yi Misiran yi waxatin naxan yi, ɛ a to nɛn Alatala naxan liga Firawona nun a kuntigine nun a yamanan birin na. <verse eid="DEU 29:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 29:2"/>Ɛ bata fe xɔdɛxɛne to, e nun taxamasenne nun kabanakone a naxanye liga e ra, <verse eid="DEU 29:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 29:3"/>koni han to Alatala munma xaxinla fi ɛ ma naxan nɔɛ feni itoe kolonɲɛ. Ɛ yɛɛne mi a toma, ɛ tunle fan mi a mɛma. <verse eid="DEU 29:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 29:4"/>N ti nɛn ɛ yɛɛ ra tonbonni ɲɛɛ tonge naanin. Ɛ domane nun ɛ sankidine mi kala, <verse eid="DEU 29:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 29:5"/>ɛ mi burun don, ɛ mi manpaan min. Alatala na liga nɛn alogo ɛ xa a kolon, a a tan nan ɛ Ala ra. <verse eid="DEU 29:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 29:6"/>Ɛ to so be, Sixɔn, Xɛsibɔn mangana, e nun Ogo, Basan mangana, ne yi fa en yɛngɛdeni, koni en yi e nɔ. <verse eid="DEU 29:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 29:7"/>Ɛ yi e bɔxɔne tongo, ɛ e yitaxun Rubɛn bɔnsɔnna nun Gadi bɔnsɔnna muxune ra, e nun Manase bɔnsɔnna fɔxɔ kedenna. <verse eid="DEU 29:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 29:8"/>Nanara, ɛ lanma ɛ xa layiri falani itoe suxu ki faɲi, alogo ɛ wanle birin xa sɔnɔya.<verse eid="DEU 29:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 29:9"/>Isirayila kaane, ɛ malanxi to Alatala ɛ Ala yɛtagi. Ɛ birin be, ɛ mangane nun ɛ yɛɛratine nun ɛ fonne nun ɛ kuntigine, <verse eid="DEU 29:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 29:10"/>e nun ɛ ɲaxanle nun ɛ diine nun xɔɲɛn naxanye wudin sɛgɛma e nun naxanye igen bama ɛ xa. <verse eid="DEU 29:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 29:11"/>Ɛ be to alogo Alatala ɛ Ala xa layirin xidi e nun ɛ tan tagi, a yi a kɔlɔ. <verse eid="DEU 29:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 29:12"/>A ɛ tan nan a yamaan na, a a tan nan ɛ Ala ra, alo a a fala ɛ xa kii naxan yi, e nun a mɔn a kɔlɔ ɛ benbane Iburahima nun Isiyaga nun Yaxuba xa kii naxan yi. <verse eid="DEU 29:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 29:13"/>N mi layirini ito xidima ɛ tan xan gbansan xa marakɔlɔn xɔn, <verse eid="DEU 29:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 29:14"/>ɛ tan naxanye tixi be Alatala en ma Ala yɛtagi. N na a xidima ɛ nun ɛ yixɛtɛne nan fan xa naxanye munma bari singen. <verse eid="DEU 29:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 29:15"/>Ɛ a kolon en bu Misiran yi kii naxan yi, e nun en mɔn dangu yamanane ra kii naxan yi kira yi be. <verse eid="DEU 29:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 29:16"/>Ɛ bata siyani itoe suxure ɲaxine to: a wudi daxine, a gɛmɛn daxine, a gbeti daxine, e nun a xɛma daxine. <verse eid="DEU 29:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 29:17"/>Xɛmɛ ba, ɲaxalan ba, bɔnsɔn ba, xabila ba, ɛ sese nama xɛtɛ Alatala ɛ Ala fɔxɔ ra, ɛ siga na siyane alane batudeni. Ɛ a liga ki faɲi alogo suxure batu yo nama lu ɛ yɛ alo sansi salen xɔlɛna. <verse eid="DEU 29:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 29:18"/>Na muxu sifan na kɔlɔni ito mɛ, a dubama a yɛtɛ xa nɛn a bɔɲɛni, a naxa, “N bɔɲɛ xunbenla sɔtɔma nɛn hali n to kankanxi n kɛɲaan ma.” Na yi yamana feen birin kala. <verse eid="DEU 29:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 29:19"/>Alatala mi diɲɛ na kanna ma. Alaa xɔlɔn nun a kunfa sariɲanxin kelima nɛn na kanna xili ma. A dangane birin sa a fari naxanye sɛbɛxi kitabuni ito kui. A xinla yi lɔ ayi dunuɲa yi. <verse eid="DEU 29:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 29:20"/>Alatala na kanna luma nɛn a danna Isirayila yamaan yɛ alogo yihadin xa a li naxan findixi layirin dangane ra, naxanye sɛbɛxi sariya kitabuni ito kui.<verse eid="DEU 29:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 29:21"/>Ɛ yixɛtɛn naxanye fama ɛ xanbi ra, e nun xɔɲɛn naxanye kelima bɔxɔ makuyene yi, ne fitina feene nun fe xɔdɛxɛne toma nɛn, Alatala naxanye dɔxɔma ɛ bɔxɔn na. <verse eid="DEU 29:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 29:22"/>Dolen nun fɔxɔn luma nɛn bɔxɔn fari. Sese mi nɔɛ siyɛ, sansi yo mi nɔɛ solɛ, hali ɲɔxɔnde keden mi luyɛ. Yamanan luma nɛn alo Sodoma nun Gomora nun Adamaha nun Seboyimi, Alatala taan naxanye kala a xɔlɔni. <verse eid="DEU 29:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 29:23"/>Nayi, siya gbɛtɛne maxɔdinna tima nɛn, e naxa, “Nanfera Alatala ito rabaxi a bɔxɔn na? A xɔlɔxi nanfera na kiini?” <verse eid="DEU 29:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 29:24"/>E yabima nɛn, e naxa, “Feni itoe ligaxi nɛn bayo yamani ito bata Alatala layirin kala, e benbane Ala naxan xidi e xa, a to e ramini Misiran yi. <verse eid="DEU 29:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 29:25"/>E bata suxurene batu, e yi e xinbi sin e xa, e mi yi naxanye kolon, Ala mi tinxi naxanye ra. <verse eid="DEU 29:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 29:26"/>Nanara, Alatala ɲaxankatani ito birin dɔxi bɔxɔni ito ra a xɔlɔni alo a sɛbɛ kitabuni ito kui kii naxan yi. <verse eid="DEU 29:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 29:27"/>Alatala bata a xɔlɔ gbeen dɔxɔ a yamaan na, a yi e ba e bɔxɔni, a yi e rasiga bɔxɔn gbɛtɛni, e dɛnaxan yi iki.”<verse eid="DEU 29:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 29:28"/>Alatala en ma Ala nan gbee wundo feene ra. Koni feen naxanye makɛnɛnxi en xa, en nun en ma diine nan gbee ne ra habadan! A lan nɛn en xa sariya falani itoe birin suxu.<verse eid="DEU 29:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 29"/>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="DEU 30"/>
  <para style="s">Alaa layirina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 30:1"/>N feen naxanye birin falaxi ɛ xa, dubane nun dangane, ne birin kamalima nɛn. Alatala ɛ Ala na ɛ raxuya ayi waxatin naxan yi siya gbɛtɛne yɛ, ɛ mirima nɛn feni itoe ma. <verse eid="DEU 30:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 30:2"/>Ɛ yi xɛtɛ Alatala ɛ Ala ma, ɛ mɔn yi a xuiin suxu ɛ bɔɲɛn birin na e nun ɛ niin birin yi, ɛ tan nun ɛ diine alo n na yamarima ɛ ma kii naxan yi to. <verse eid="DEU 30:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 30:3"/>Nayi, Alatala ɛ Ala kininkininma ɛ ma nɛn, a ɛ ba konyiyani, a yi ɛ malan keli siyane yɛ a ɛ raxuya ayi naxanye yɛ. <verse eid="DEU 30:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 30:4"/>Hali ɛ kedixin sa dɔxi han bɔxɔn danna ra, Alatala ɛ Ala ɛ tongoma nɛn mɛnni, a mɔn yi ɛ malan. <verse eid="DEU 30:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 30:5"/>Alatala ɛ Ala mɔn ɛ xalima nɛn ɛ benbane bɔxɔni alogo ɛ xa na masɔtɔ, a yi ɛ rasabati, a ɛ rawuya ayi dangu ɛ benbane ra. <verse eid="DEU 30:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 30:6"/>Alatala ɛ Ala nan ɛ nun ɛ yixɛtɛne bɔɲɛne rasariɲanma alogo ɛ xa Alatala ɛ Ala xanu ɛ bɔɲɛn ma e nun ɛ niin birin yi, ɛ yi siimaya faɲin sɔtɔ. <verse eid="DEU 30:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 30:7"/>N tan Alatala, ɛ Ala danga sɛbɛxini itoe birin dɔxɔma nɛn ɛ yaxune ra naxanye ɛ raɲaxuxi. <verse eid="DEU 30:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 30:8"/>Nayi, ɛ mɔn birama nɛn Alatala fɔxɔ ra, ɛ a yamarine birin suxu n naxanye fima ɛ ma to. <verse eid="DEU 30:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 30:9"/>Alatala, ɛ Ala baraka gbeen sama nɛn ɛ wanle birin yi. Ɛ yi dii wuyaxi sɔtɔ, e nun xuruseene nun hɛrisigɛ gbeena, xa ɛ Alatala kɛnɛn alo ɛ benbane <verse eid="DEU 30:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 30:10"/>ɛ yi Alatala ɛ Ala xuiin suxu, ɛ yi a yamarine nun tɔnne suxu naxanye sɛbɛxi sariya kitabuni ito kui, ɛ yi xɛtɛ a ma ɛ bɔɲɛn birin na e nun ɛ niin birin yi.<verse eid="DEU 30:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Alaa sariyana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 30:11"/>N yamarin naxan fima ɛ ma to, fe xɔdɛxɛ mi a ra ɛ tan xa. <verse eid="DEU 30:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 30:12"/>A mi kore, alogo i xa a fala, i naxa, “Nde nɔɛ tɛ kore, a xa sa fa a ra en xa, a a rali en ma alogo en xa a liga?” <verse eid="DEU 30:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 30:13"/>A mi sa fɔxɔ igen fan kidima, alogo i xa a fala, i naxa, “Nde nɔɛ fɔxɔ igen gidɛ, a xa sa fa a ra en xa, a yi a rali en ma alogo en xa a liga?” <verse eid="DEU 30:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 30:14"/>Ɛn-ɛn-ɛn, Alaa falana i dɛxɔn ma, a i dɛɛn kui, a i bɔɲɛni alogo i xa a liga.<verse eid="DEU 30:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nii rakisin sugandi fena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 30:15"/>N bata fa siimayaan nun faxan na to e nun fe faɲin nun a ɲaxina. Ɛ a mato ɛ keden sugandi. <verse eid="DEU 30:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 30:16"/>N bata ɛ yamari to, ɛ xa Alatala ɛ Ala xanu, ɛ xa sigan ti a kirane xɔn, ɛ xa a yamarine nun a tɔnne nun a sariyane suxu, alogo ɛ xa siimaya faɲin sɔtɔ, ɛ yi wuya ayi, Alatala ɛ Ala yi ɛ baraka na bɔxɔni ɛ fama dɛnaxan masɔtɔdeyi. <verse eid="DEU 30:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 30:17"/>Koni xa ɛ xɛtɛ a fɔxɔ ra, ɛ a matandi, ɛ bira suxure batu feen fɔxɔ ra, <verse eid="DEU 30:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 30:18"/>n xa a fala ɛ xa to, ɛ halagima nɛn feu! Ɛ mi buma na bɔxɔni ɛ dɛnaxan sɔtɔma Yurudɛn kidima. <verse eid="DEU 30:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 30:19"/>Kore xɔnna nun bɔxɔ xɔnna nan n serene ra to, fa fala a n bata fa siimayaan nun faxan na e nun duban nun dangana. Ɛ xa siimayaan nan sugandi, ɛ tan nun ɛ yixɛtɛne. <verse eid="DEU 30:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 30:20"/>Ɛ xa Alatala ɛ Ala xanu, ɛ yi a xuiin suxu, ɛ yi lu a fɔxɔ ra. Amasɔtɔ Alatala nan ɛ nii rakisin na. A siimaya xunkuyen fima ɛ ma nɛn na bɔxɔni, Alatala a kɔlɔ naxan ma fe ra, a a soma nɛn ɛ benba Iburahima nun Isiyaga nun Yaxuba yii.<verse eid="DEU 30:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 30"/>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="DEU 31"/>
  <para style="s">Yosuwe findi fena yɛɛratiin na</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 31:1"/>Nabi Musa yi a fala Isirayila kaane birin xa, <verse eid="DEU 31:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 31:2"/>a naxa, “N bata ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ ɲɛɛ mɔxɔɲɛ sɔtɔ iki, n mi fa nɔɛ tiyɛ ɛ yɛɛ ra. Alatala bata a fala n xa, a n mi Yurudɛn baan gidima. <verse eid="DEU 31:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 31:3"/>Alatala ɛ Ala nan tima ɛ yɛɛ ra, a mɛn kaane birin halagi alogo ɛ xa e bɔxɔne masɔtɔ. Yosuwe fan tima nɛn ɛ yɛɛ ra, alo Alatala a fala kii naxan yi. <verse eid="DEU 31:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 31:4"/>Alatala siyani itoe halagima nɛn alo a Sixɔn nun Ogo, Amorine mangane halagi kii naxan yi, e nun e yamanane. <verse eid="DEU 31:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 31:5"/>Alatala yi e sa ɛ sagoni. Ɛ xa a liga e ra alo n bata a yamari ɛ ma kii naxan yi. <verse eid="DEU 31:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 31:6"/>Ɛ sɛnbɛ so, ɛ wɛkilɛ! Ɛ nama kuisan, ɛ nama gaxu e yɛɛ ra, bayo ɛ nun Alatala ɛ Ala nan sigama. A mi kelɛ i dɛxɔn mumɛ, a mi ɛ rabeɲinɲɛ fefe ma.”<verse eid="DEU 31:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 31:7"/>Nabi Musa yi Yosuwe xili, a yi falan ti a xa Isirayila kaane birin malanxin yɛɛ xɔri, a naxa, “I sɛnbɛ so, i wɛkilɛ, bayo i tan nan tima Isirayila kaane yɛɛ ra siga na bɔxɔni Alatala a kɔlɔ naxan ma fe ra a a soma ɛ benbane yii nɛn. I tan xa e kɛɛ bɔxɔne yitaxun e ra. <verse eid="DEU 31:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 31:8"/>Alatala tima nɛn i yɛɛ ra, a lu i xɔn, a mi kelɛ i dɛxɔn, a mi i rabeɲinɲɛ fefe ma. I nama kuisan, i nama gaxu.”<verse eid="DEU 31:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 31:9"/>Musa to sariyani ito sɛbɛ, a yi a taxu saraxaraline ra, Lewi yixɛtɛn naxanye Alatalaa Layiri Kankiraan xalima, e nun Isirayila fonne. <verse eid="DEU 31:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 31:10"/>Musa yi yamarini ito fi e ma, a naxa, “Ɲɛɛ solofere yo ɲɛɛ solofere, yamaan diɲama donle ma ɲɛɛn naxan na, Bubu Kui Sanla waxatini, <verse eid="DEU 31:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 31:11"/>ɛ xa sariyani ito xaran ɛ xui yitexin na Isirayila kaane birin xa, naxanye fama e malandeni Alatala ɛ Ala yɛtagi, a yire sugandixini. <verse eid="DEU 31:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 31:12"/>Ɛ yamaan birin malanma nɛn mɛnni, xɛmɛne nun ɲaxanle nun diine e nun xɔɲɛn naxanye dɔxi ɛ taane yi, alogo e xa a mɛ, e yi fatan Alatala ɛ Ala binyadeni, e sariyani ito a falane birin suxu ki faɲi. <verse eid="DEU 31:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 31:13"/>E diin naxanye mi sariyan kolonxi singen, ne fan a mɛma nɛn. E yi fatan Alatala ɛ Ala binyadeni fanni ɛ dɔxi na bɔxɔni ɛ Yurudɛn baan gidima naxan masɔtɔdeni.”<verse eid="DEU 31:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 31:14"/>Alatala yi a fala Nabi Musa xa, a naxa, “I faxa waxatin bata maso, Yosuwe xili, ɛ birin yi siga Naralan Bubuni alogo n xa n ma yamarine fi a ma mɛnni.” Nabi Musa nun Yosuwe yi siga Naralan Bubuni. <verse eid="DEU 31:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 31:15"/>Alatala yi mini e xa kundani naxan yi tema bubun so dɛɛn xun ma. <verse eid="DEU 31:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 31:16"/>Alatala yi a fala Nabi Musa xa, a naxa, “I faxamatɔɔn na a ra. I faxa xanbini, yamani ito xɔɲɛne suxurene batuma nɛn na bɔxɔni e sigama dɛnaxan yi. E e mɛma n na nɛn, e yi layirin kala n naxan xidixi e xa. <verse eid="DEU 31:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 31:17"/>Na waxatini, n xɔlɔma nɛn e ma han n yi n mɛ e ra. N na n yɛtagin luxunma nɛn e ma. Siya gbɛtɛne e halagima nɛn. Tɔrɔ wuyaxi nun fe xɔdɛxɛne yi so e xun na. E a kolonma nɛn na waxatini, a tɔrɔni itoe e lixi nɛn bayo n tan, e Ala, mi fa e yɛ sɔnɔn. <verse eid="DEU 31:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 31:18"/>N na n yɛtagin luxunma nɛn e ma na waxatini bayo e bata fe ɲaxin liga e suxurene batu. <verse eid="DEU 31:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 31:19"/>Iki, i xa bɛtini ito sɛbɛ. Musa, i xa a xaran Isirayila kaane xa, e yi lu a bɛ, alogo a xa findi seren na n tan nun Isirayila kaane tagi. <verse eid="DEU 31:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 31:20"/>N yamani ito xalima nɛn na bɔxɔni, nɔnɔn nun kumin gbo dɛnaxan yi, alo n nan n kɔlɔ e benbane xa kii naxan yi. E na e dɛge, e lugo han e gbo, e birama nɛn ala gbɛtɛne fɔxɔ ra, e yi e batu, e n ma layirin kala. <verse eid="DEU 31:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 31:21"/>Tɔrɔne nun fe xɔdɛxɛne na fa e ma, bɛtini ito findima seren nan na e xili ma. E yixɛtɛne mi ɲinanɲɛ a xɔn. N yamani ito kui feene kolon hali benun e xa so na bɔxɔni n na n kɔlɔ e xa naxan ma fe ra.” <verse eid="DEU 31:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 31:22"/>Na lɔxɔni, Nabi Musa yi na bɛtin sɛbɛ, Ala naxan falaxi. A yi a xaran Isirayila kaane xa.<verse eid="DEU 31:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 31:23"/>Ala yi yamarini ito so Nunu a dii Yosuwe yii. A yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “I sɛnbɛ so, i wɛkilɛ! I tan nan Isirayila kaane xalima na bɔxɔni n na n kɔlɔ e xa naxan ma fe ra. N tan yɛtɛɛn luma nɛn i xɔn.”<verse eid="DEU 31:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 31:24"/>Nabi Musa yi sariya falani itoe birin sɛbɛ Kitabun kui. <verse eid="DEU 31:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 31:25"/>A to yelin, a yi yamarini ito fi Lewine ma, naxanye Alatalaa Layiri Kankiraan xalima. A yi a fala e xa, a naxa, <verse eid="DEU 31:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 31:26"/>“Ɛ kitabuni ito tongo, Alaa sariyan sɛbɛxi naxan kui, ɛ xa a sa Alatala ɛ Alaa Layiri Kankiraan dɛxɔn ma. A xa lu mɛnni seren na Isirayila kaane xili ma, <verse eid="DEU 31:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 31:27"/>bayo n na kolon a matandi tiine nun yama murutɛxin nan ɛ ra. Xa ɛ Alatala matandima n mɔn ɛ yɛ waxatin naxan yi, n na faxa, ɛ mɔn a matandima nɛn dangu na ra. <verse eid="DEU 31:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 31:28"/>Iki, ɛ ɛ malan n fɛma, ɛ nun ɛ fonne nun ɛ bɔnsɔnne yɛɛratine, alogo n xa falani itoe ti ɛ yɛtagi. Kore xɔnna nun bɔxɔ xɔnna nan findima serene ra ɛ xili ma. <verse eid="DEU 31:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 31:29"/>N na a kolon, a n na faxa, ɛ kala gbeen tima nɛn, ɛ yi xɛtɛ kiraan fɔxɔ ra n na ɛ yamarixi naxan na. Waxati famatɔne yi, ɛ fe ɲaxin ligama nɛn Alatala yɛɛ ra yi, a yi xɔlɔ ɛ ma ɛ kɛwanle fe ra, yihadin yi ɛ li.”<verse eid="DEU 31:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 31:30"/>Nabi Musa yi bɛtini ito birin xaran Isirayila yamaan xa.<verse eid="DEU 31:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 31"/>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="DEU 32"/>
  <para style="s">Nabi Musaa bɛtina</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 32:1"/>Kore xɔnna, i tuli mati n ma falan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:1">Bɔxɔ xɔnna, n fala xuiin namɛ.<verse eid="DEU 32:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 32:2"/>N ma xaranna xa godo yamaan ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:2">alo tule igena.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:2">N ma falan xa lu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:2">alo xiila sɛxɛn na.<verse eid="DEU 32:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 32:3"/>N na Alatala xinla nan nalima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:3">Ɛ xa en ma Ala tantun, a gbo!<verse eid="DEU 32:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 32:4"/>En kantan fanyen nan a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:4">a wanle kamalixi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:4">A kirane birin tinxin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:4">Ɲɔndina Ala na a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:4">naxan mi yifu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:4">A tan nan tinxin, a fan!<verse eid="DEU 32:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 32:5"/>Koni yamaan bata kala a yɛɛ ra yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:5">a dii mi fa e ra!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:5">Yagina e xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:5">yama yifuxin naxan mi tinxin.<verse eid="DEU 32:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 32:6"/>Yama daxu xaxilitarena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:6">ɛ lan ɛ xa na fe sifan liga Alatala ra ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:6">Ɛ Fafe xa mi a tan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:6">ɛ da mangana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:6">naxan ɛ findixi a yamaan na?<verse eid="DEU 32:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 32:7"/>Ɛ miri lɔxɔ danguxine ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:7">Ɛ yi ɛ xaxili lu waxati gbɛtɛne xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:7">Ɛ ɛ fafane maxɔdin e nun fonne.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:7">E xa fe danguxine yɛba ɛ xa.<verse eid="DEU 32:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 32:8"/>Kore Xɔnna Ala to yi bɔxɔni taxunma siyane ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:8">a to yi adamadiine bama e bode ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:8">a yi yamanane danne sa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:8">fata Isirayila kaane yatɛn na.<verse eid="DEU 32:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 32:9"/>Bayo Alatala gbeen findixi a yamaan nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:9">A gbeen nan Yaxuba bɔnsɔnna ra.<verse eid="DEU 32:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 32:10"/>A Isirayila toxi tonbonna nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:10">tɔrɔ bɔxɔ xarena.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:10">A yi a ratanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:10">a yi a ɲɔxɔ lu a xɔn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:10">alo a yɛtɛɛn yɛɛna.<verse eid="DEU 32:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 32:11"/>A luxi alo singbinna</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:11">naxan a diine maxaranma tugandeni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:11">A a gubugubune dɔxɔ e bun</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:11">alogo e nama bira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:11">a yi e yite a gubugubune ra.<verse eid="DEU 32:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 32:12"/>Alatala kedenna nan tixi a yamaan yɛɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:12">Ala gbɛtɛ yo mi a malixi.<verse eid="DEU 32:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 32:13"/>A yi e rasabati geyane fari.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:13">A yi e balo xɛɛne bogi seene ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:13">A yi kumin ba e xa gɛmɛne yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:13">a turen ba fanyen ma.<verse eid="DEU 32:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 32:14"/>Ɲingene nun yɛxɛɛne yi nɔnɔn fi ɛ ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:14">Yɛxɛɛ dii turaxine nun kɔtɔne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:14">e nun kontonna naxanye kelixi Basan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:14">ɛ yi ne suben don.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:14">Ɛ yi murutu kɛsɛ faɲine don,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:14">Ɛ yi manpa hagigɛne min.<verse eid="DEU 32:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 32:15"/>Isirayila tinxinxin yi gbo ayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:15">a yi tondi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:15">turen yi gbo a fatini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:15">a fatin yi fanɲɛ ayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:15">a yi xɛtɛ Ala fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:15">a da mangana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:15">a yi a mɛ Ala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:15">a kantan fanyena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:15">naxan a rakisima.<verse eid="DEU 32:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 32:16"/>Isirayila yi Ala raxɔxɔlɔnɲɛ ayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:16">e bira ala gbɛtɛne fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:16">e suxurene ki.<verse eid="DEU 32:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 32:17"/>E yi ɲinanne ki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:17">Ala mi naxanye ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:17">e mi yi naxanye kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:17">e benbane mi yi naxanye kolon.<verse eid="DEU 32:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 32:18"/>Ɛ bata ɲinan Ala xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:18">naxan ɛ ratanga alo fanyena</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:18">naxan ɛ ramini dunuɲa yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:18">a siimayaan fi ɛ ma.<verse eid="DEU 32:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 32:19"/>Alatala to a diine kɛɲaan to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:19">a yi xɔlɔ e ma, a yi a mɛ e ra.<verse eid="DEU 32:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 32:20"/>A yi a fala, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:20">“N xa n yɛtagi luxun e ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:20">n yi a mato feen naxan e lima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:20">Amasɔtɔ yama xaxilitaren nan e ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:20">Dii yanfantenne nan e ra.<verse eid="DEU 32:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 32:21"/>E bata n naxɔxɔlɔnɲɛ ayi wule alane xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:21">E bata n naxɔlɔ suxure fufafune fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:21">N tan fan e raxɔxɔlɔnma ayi nɛn muxune xɔn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:21">yama faɲin mi naxanye ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:21">N yi e raxɔlɔ siya xaxilitaren xɔn.<verse eid="DEU 32:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 32:22"/>Ɔn, n ma xɔlɔn bata gbo ayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:22">a wolon han a barinne yimaxa laxira yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:22">A luma nɛn alo tɛɛn naxan bɔxɔn ganma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:22">A gan han a sa geyane bunne li.”<verse eid="DEU 32:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 32:23"/>“N fitina feene gboma ayi e ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:23">n nan n ma xanle birin wolima nɛn.<verse eid="DEU 32:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 32:24"/>N fitina kamɛn nagodoma e xili ma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:24">n fitina furen nafa e ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:24">n burunna sube xaɲɛne rafa e ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:24">e nun saɲi xɔlɛne.<verse eid="DEU 32:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 32:25"/>Naxanye tanden ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:25">silanfanna nan e diine faxama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:25">Naxanye banxini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:25">gaxun yi ne faxa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:25">E birin faxama nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:25">xɛmɛn nun ɲaxanla,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:25">dii ɲɔrɛn nun fonna.<verse eid="DEU 32:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 32:26"/>N yi wama nɛn e birin naxuya feni ayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:26">e xinle yi tunun dunuɲa yi.<verse eid="DEU 32:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 32:27"/>Koni n mi tin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:27">yaxune yi n magele.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:27">N mi wama a xɔn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:27">a e xa e miri</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:27">a e tan nan e nɔxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:27">a Alatala funfun mi a ra.<verse eid="DEU 32:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 32:28"/>Siya xaxilima mi ne ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:28">E mi lɔnnixi.<verse eid="DEU 32:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 32:29"/>Xa fe kolonna nan yi e ra nun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:29">e yi a kolonma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:29">e sigan dɛnaxan yi.<verse eid="DEU 32:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 32:30"/>Yaxu keden nɔɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:30">Isirayila kaa wuli keden kedɛ di?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:30">Yaxu firin nɔɛ muxu wuli fu kedɛ di?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:30">Na mi ligɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:30">fɔ Alatala na e sa yaxune sagoni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:30">a tan naxan luxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:30">alo e kantan fanyena.<verse eid="DEU 32:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 32:31"/>Yaxune yati a kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:31">a e kantan se mi dangu en kantan fanyen na, Ala.”<verse eid="DEU 32:31"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 32:32"/>“E feene fɔlɔxi Sodoma nun Gomora nin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:32">E luxi nɛn alo manpa binla</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:32">naxan salenne bitinxi bɔxɔ ɲaxini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:32">a bogi xɔlɛne ramini,<verse eid="DEU 32:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 32:33"/>naxan igen luxi alo saɲin xɔlɛna.<verse eid="DEU 32:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 32:34"/>Na feene birin namaraxi n yii wundoni.<verse eid="DEU 32:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 32:35"/>N tan nan gbeeɲɔxɔ tiin na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:35">N feene saranma nɛn e ɲɔxɔne ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:35">na muxune yi dagalanɲɛ ayi a waxatini.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:35">A gbee mi luxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:35">yihadin yi e li,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:35">e yigitɛgɛ lɔxɔn bata maso.”<verse eid="DEU 32:35"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 32:36"/>Alatalaa yamaan makitima nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:36">koni a mɔn kininkininma e ma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:36">bayo e sɛnbɛ yo mi fa na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:36">Muxu yo mi na naxan e maliyɛ.<verse eid="DEU 32:36"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 32:37"/>Ala e maxɔdinma nɛn, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:37">“Ɛ alane minɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:37">naxanye yi ɛ kantanma,<verse eid="DEU 32:37"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 32:38"/>ɛ yi naxanye kima sube tureni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:38">naxanye yi ɛ manpaan minma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:38">E xa keli ɛ malideni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:38">e xa ɛ ratanga.<verse eid="DEU 32:38"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 32:39"/>Iki ɛ xa a kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:39">a n tan keden peen na a ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:39">Ala gbɛtɛ mi na fɔ n tan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:39">N tan nan muxun faxama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:39">n mɔn yi a rakeli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:39">N tan nan muxun maxɔlɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:39">n mɔn yi a yiyalan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:39">Nde gbɛtɛ nɔɛ muxuna nde bɛ n yii?<verse eid="DEU 32:39"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 32:40"/>Habadan Ala nan n tan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:40">n bata n yiini te kore,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:40">n yi n kɔlɔ n yɛtɛni:<verse eid="DEU 32:40"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 32:41"/>N na n ma silanfanna raxanxan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:41">n yi a suxu n yii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:41">n nan n gbeen ɲɔxɔma nɛn n yaxune ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:41">n na e saren fima nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:41">naxanye n naɲaxuxi.<verse eid="DEU 32:41"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 32:42"/>N na n ma xanle sinma nɛn wunli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:42">n ma silanfanna yi suben don.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:42">Yɛngɛsone nun muxu suxine</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:42">nun gali mangane birin faxama nɛn.”<verse eid="DEU 32:42"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 32:43"/>Siyane, ɛ nun Alaa yamaan xa sɛwa ɛ bode xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:43">Ala a walikɛne faxan ɲɔxɔma nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:43">A e gbeen ɲɔxɔma nɛn a yaxune ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:43">A yi a yamaan nun e yamanan yulubine xafari.<verse eid="DEU 32:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 32:44"/>Musa nun Nunu a dii Yosuwe yi bɛtini ito birin xaran yamaan xa e xuini texin na.<verse eid="DEU 32:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 32:45"/>Musa to yelin falani itoe tideni Isirayila kaane xa, <verse eid="DEU 32:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 32:46"/>a yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Ɛ xa falani itoe birin suxu ken n naxanye ralixi ɛ ma to. Ɛ xa e yamari ɛ diine ma alogo e xa sariya falani itoe birin suxu ki faɲi. <verse eid="DEU 32:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 32:47"/>Fufafu falan mi itoe ra. Ɛ niin nakisi feen yɛtɛɛn nan e ra. Ɛ siimaya xunkuyen sɔtɔma nɛn e xɔn, na bɔxɔni ɛ dɛnaxan sɔtɔma Yurudɛn kidima.”<verse eid="DEU 32:47"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nabi Musaa saya fena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 32:48"/>Na lɔxɔni, Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, a naxa, <verse eid="DEU 32:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 32:49"/>“Siga Abarimi bɔxɔni, Nebo geyaan fari, naxan Moyaba yi, Yeriko taan yɛtagi. I xa Kanan bɔxɔn mato mɛnni, n naxan fima Isirayila kaane ma e kɛɛn na. <verse eid="DEU 32:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="DEU 32:50"/>I na te geyaan fari, i faxama nɛn. I yi siga i benbane fɔxɔ ra laxira yi alo i tada Haruna faxa Horo geyaan fari kii naxan yi, a yi siga a benbane fɔxɔ ra laxira yi. <verse eid="DEU 32:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="DEU 32:51"/>Na birin bayo, ɛ mi tinxinya ligaxi Isirayila kaane yɛtagi Kadesi yi, Meriba igene dɛnaxan yi, Sini tonbonni. Ɛ mi n ma sariɲanna binyaxi yamaan tagi. <verse eid="DEU 32:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="DEU 32:52"/>Nanara, i bɔxɔn toma nɛn wulani, n naxan fima Isirayila kaane ma, koni i tan gbindin mi soɛ na.”<verse eid="DEU 32:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 32"/>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="DEU 33"/>
  <para style="s">Nabi Musa dubana Isirayila xa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 33:1"/>Benun Musa xa faxa, Alaa muxuna, a yi duba Isirayila kaane xa, a naxa:<verse eid="DEU 33:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 33:2"/>Alatala fa nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:2">keli Sinayi geyaan fari alo sogena.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:2">A yi te Seyiri bɔxɔni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:2">Isirayila kaane yi dɛnaxan yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:2">A nɔrɔn yi godo a yamaan ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:2">keli Paran geyaan fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:2">maleka wuli wuyaxi yi biraxi a fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="DEU 33:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 33:3"/>Ala Isirayila bɔnsɔnna xanuxi yati!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:3">A a muxu sariɲanxine kantanma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:3">naxanye e xinbi sinma a bun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:3">e yi a xaranna ramɛ.<verse eid="DEU 33:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 33:4"/>Musa bata sariyan fi en ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:4">alo nafunla Yaxubaa yamaan xa.<verse eid="DEU 33:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 33:5"/>Ala findi nɛn Isirayila Mangan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:5">yamaan yɛɛratine malanni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:5">e nun Isirayila bɔnsɔnne birin.<verse eid="DEU 33:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 33:6"/>Ala xa siin fi Rubɛn bɔnsɔnna ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:6">Ala xa siimayaan fi Rubɛn yixɛtɛne ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:6">a yamaan yi wuya ayi.<verse eid="DEU 33:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 33:7"/>Musa falani ito nan ti Yuda bɔnsɔnna fe yi, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:7">“Alatala xa Yuda xuiin namɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:7">alogo a xa fa a yamaan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:7">Yuda yi a yɛtɛ xun mayɛngɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:7">Ala xa a mali a yaxune yɛngɛdeni.”<verse eid="DEU 33:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 33:8"/>Musa falani ito nan ti Lewi bɔnsɔnna fe yi, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:8">“Ala, i bata Yurima nun Tumin<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">33.8</char> <char style="fk">Yurima nun Tumin</char> masɛnsɛn ti seene fe sɛbɛxi Xɔrɔyaan 28.30 kui. Saraxaraline yi masɛnsɛnna tima ne nan na alogo e xa Ala sagoon kolon.</note> so</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:8">Lewi bɔnsɔnna yii i sagoon kolon feen na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:8">I rafan muxune nan e ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:8">i naxanye kɛɲaan fɛsɛfɛsɛ Masa yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:8">i naxanye makiti Meriba igene fe ra.<verse eid="DEU 33:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 33:9"/>E mi bira e fafe nun e nga sagoon fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:9">xanamu e ngaxakedenne</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:9">hanma e diine,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:9">koni e bira nɛn i ya fala gbansanna fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:9">e yi i ya layirin kantan.<verse eid="DEU 33:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 33:10"/>E tan nan Yaxuba bɔnsɔnna xaranma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:10">i ya yamarine ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:10">e yi Isirayila kaane xaran i ya sariyan ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:10">E wusulanna gan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:10">e saraxa gan daxine ba i ya saraxa ganden fari.<verse eid="DEU 33:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 33:11"/>Alatala xa e baraka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:11">Ala xa barakan sa e kɛwanle birin yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:11">Ala xa e yɛngɛfane sɛnbɛn ɲan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:11">Ala xa e yaxune rabira</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:11">alogo e nama fa nɔ kelɛ sɔnɔn.”<verse eid="DEU 33:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 33:12"/>Musa falani ito nan ti Bunyamin bɔnsɔnna fe yi, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:12">“Alatala xanuntenne nan ne ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:12">E luma nɛn Ala fɛma bɔɲɛ xunbenli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:12">bayo a e ratangama nɛn waxatin birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:12">a mɔn yi lu e xɔn.”<verse eid="DEU 33:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 33:13"/>Musa falani ito nan ti Yusufu bɔnsɔnna fe yi, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:13">“Alatala xa barakan sa e bɔxɔni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:13">Ala xa xiila ragodo a ma keli kore.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:13">Ala xa tigi igen namini a ma keli bɔxɔni.<verse eid="DEU 33:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 33:14"/>Ala xa sogen xa fan e sansine ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:14">kike yo kike e bogine yi mɔ.<verse eid="DEU 33:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 33:15"/>Ala xa e xɛɛne rasabati</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:15">geya bɔxɔ faɲine ma.<verse eid="DEU 33:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 33:16"/>Ala xa e bɔxɔn bogi seene fan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:16">Ala naxan falan ti fɔtɔndini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:16">a xa hinan Yusufu ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:16">a naxan sugandixi mangan na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:16">a ngaxakedenne tagi.<verse eid="DEU 33:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 33:17"/>Xunna kenla Yusufu xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">A sɛnbɛn gbo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">alo ɲingen dii tura singena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">a fenne nan a yɛngɛso seene ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">alo burunna ɲingena.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">A siyane birin nɔma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">han bɔxɔn danne.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">Efirami bɔnsɔnna wuli fu ganle nan ne ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">Manase bɔnsɔnna wuli wuli ganle nan ne ra.”<verse eid="DEU 33:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 33:18"/>Musa falani ito nan ti Sabulon bɔnsɔnna fe yi, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:18">“Sabulon bɔnsɔnna, ɛ sɛwa yulayani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:18">Isakari bɔnsɔnna, ɛ sɛwa ɛ bubune kui.<verse eid="DEU 33:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 33:19"/>Ɛ siyane xilima nɛn geyaan fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:19">ɛ saraxa tinxinxine ba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:19">Amasɔtɔ ɛ ɛ balon sɔtɔma nɛn fɔxɔ igen nafunli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:19">e nun hɛrisigɛn naxan fɔxɔ igen dɛ.”<verse eid="DEU 33:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 33:20"/>Musa falani ito nan ti Gadi bɔnsɔnna a fe yi, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:20">“Ala xa na kanna baraka</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:20">naxan Gadi a bɔxɔn nagboma ayi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:20">Gadi dɔxi mɛnni alo yatan</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:20">naxan suben suxu a a sanna nun a xunni bɔ.<verse eid="DEU 33:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 33:21"/>Gadi bata dahamu bɔxɔn findi a gbeen na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:21">alo mangan naxan tixi yamaan yɛɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:21">A bata Alatala fe ragidixin nakamali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:21">a mɔn bata Alaa kitin sa Isirayila ma.”<verse eid="DEU 33:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 33:22"/>Musa falani ito nan ti Dan bɔnsɔnna fe yi, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:22">“Dan luxi nɛn alo yata sɛnbɛmaan naxan kelima Basan bɔxɔni a tugan.”<verse eid="DEU 33:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 33:23"/>Musa falani ito nan ti Nafatali bɔnsɔnna fe yi, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:23">“Nafatali rafan Ala ma han!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:23">Alatala barakan saxi a fe yi kati!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:23">Ala xa a bɔxɔn nagbo ayi sogegododeni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:23">e nun yiifanna ma.”<verse eid="DEU 33:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 33:24"/>Musa falani ito nan ti Aseri bɔnsɔnna fe yi, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:24">“Ala xa Aseri baraka Yaxuba a diine yɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:24">A ngaxakedenne xa hinan a ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:24">A turen xa gbo ayi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:24">han a yi a sanna maxa a ra.<verse eid="DEU 33:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 33:25"/>Ala xa ɛ taan so dɛɛn findi wuren nun sulan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:25">Ala xa kɛndɛyaan fi ɛ ma ɛ siimayaan birin yi.”<verse eid="DEU 33:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 33:26"/>Musa mɔn yi a fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:26">“Isirayilaa Ala maliga yo mi na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:26">A kelima kore, a fa i mali.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:26">A kundani gidima a nɔrɔni.<verse eid="DEU 33:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 33:27"/>Habadan Ala nan i yigiyaden na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:27">a habadan yiine nan nasoxi i bun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:27">A i yaxune kedima nɛn i yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:27">a naxa, ‘E halagi!’<verse eid="DEU 33:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 33:28"/>Isirayila dɔxɔma nɛn bɔɲɛ xunbenli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:28">Ala Yaxuba bɔnsɔnna luma nɛn a danna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:28">murutun nun manpa nɛnɛn yi gbo a bɔxɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:28">xiila fan yi sa keli kore.<verse eid="DEU 33:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 33:29"/>Sɛwana ɛ xa, Isirayila kaane.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">Ɛ maliga yo mi na siyane yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">Alatala naxan nakisima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">A tan nan ɛ yɛ masansan wure lefaan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">ɛ mali tiina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">a tan nan findixi ɛ nɔ ti silanfanna ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">Ɛ yaxune e mafelenma nɛn ɛ yɛtagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">ɛ fan yi e taane kidene kala.”<verse eid="DEU 33:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 33"/>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="DEU 34"/>
  <para style="s">Nabi Musa yi faxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 34:1"/>Nabi Musa yi te Nebo geyaan fari, Moyaba mɛrɛmɛrɛni, han Pisiga geyana, naxan Yeriko taan yɛtagi. Alatala yi yamanan yiren birin yita a ra mɛnni, keli Galadi ma han sa dɔxɔ Dan yamanan na, <verse eid="DEU 34:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 34:2"/>e nun Nafatali a bɔxɔn birin, e nun Efirami nun Manase a bɔxɔna, e nun Yuda a bɔxɔna han fɔxɔ igen naxan sogegododeni, <verse eid="DEU 34:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 34:3"/>e nun Negewi bɔxɔna, e nun Yurudɛn mɛrɛmɛrɛna, e nun Yeriko taan lanbanna, tugu bili taana, han sa dɔxɔ Soyari ra. <verse eid="DEU 34:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 34:4"/>Alatala yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “I yɛɛn ti bɔxɔn na n na n kɔlɔ naxan ma fe ra Iburahima nun Isiyaga nun Yaxuba xa. N naxa, ‘N bɔxɔni ito fima ɛ yixɛtɛne ma nɛn.’ N bata a yita i ra, koni i mi soon na.”<verse eid="DEU 34:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 34:5"/>Musa, Alatalaa walikɛɛn yi faxa mɛnni, Moyaba bɔxɔni, alo Alatala a fala kii naxan yi. <verse eid="DEU 34:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 34:6"/>Ala yi a maluxun mɛrɛmɛrɛni, Moyaba bɔxɔni Beti-Peyori yɛtagi. Muxu yo mi a kolon a gaburun dɛnaxan yi han to. <verse eid="DEU 34:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 34:7"/>Nabi Musa faxaxi a ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ ɲɛɛ mɔxɔɲɛ nan ma. Koni, a mɔn yi seen toma a faɲin na, a sɛnbɛn fan mi yi ɲanxi. <verse eid="DEU 34:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 34:8"/>Isirayila kaane yi Musa wuga Moyaba mɛrɛmɛrɛni xii tonge saxan han e yi yelin a ɲan feen ligɛ.<verse eid="DEU 34:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 34:9"/>Nunu a dii Yosuwe yi lugoxi fe kolonna niin na bayo Musa bata yi a yiin sa a ma. Isirayila kaane yi a xuiin suxu, e mɔn yi Musa yamarine suxu Alatala naxanye fixi a ma.<verse eid="DEU 34:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 34:10"/>Nabi gbɛtɛ yo munma mini Isirayila yamanani naxan maliga Nabi Musa ra. A yi falan tima Alatala xa yɛɛ nun yɛɛ. <verse eid="DEU 34:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 34:11"/>Alatala a xɛxi Misiran yamanani taxamasenne nun kabanakone nan ligadeyi Firawona nun a kuntigine nun a yamanan birin yɛɛ xɔri. <verse eid="DEU 34:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 34:12"/>Nabi Musa walixi sɛnbɛ magaxuxin nin Isirayila kaane birin yɛɛ xɔri.<verse eid="DEU 34:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 34"/>
</usx>
